declare
  v_items constant jsonb := $satx$[{"gid":"36b4ef61-5b77-5ccc-a45c-08aae33a3d0c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.param_condition/ask_solution","group":"nes.root.param_condition","passage":"In the equation given here, p is a positive constant, and the equation has a single real solution.\n\n$x^2 + px + 225 = 0$","question":"What is the solution to the equation?","options":["30","-15","-30","15"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 방정식은 중근을 갖고, 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = p² - 4·225 = 0 이므로 p² = 900 이다. (3) p 는 양수이므로 p = 30 이다. (4) 방정식은 $(x + 15)^2 = 0$ 꼴이다. (5) 따라서 해는 x = -15 이다. 따라서 정답은 -15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means a double root, so D = 0. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive constant. (4) The equation becomes a perfect square. (5) Read off the solution. So the answer is -15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.551Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"root","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이","concepts":["판별식 조건","완전제곱 중근","부호 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"ask_solution","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-15,"correctOption":"-15"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"36b4ef61-5b77-5ccc-a45c-08aae33a3d0c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3531650f-dcb9-54bb-a5bf-922f2f7f73e2","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.constraint_select/radical_equation","group":"nes.root.constraint_select","passage":"For the equation shown, x is a real number. $\\sqrt{x + 10} = x - 2$","question":"Find the real solution of the equation.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["6"],"explanation":"(1) 양변을 제곱해 근호를 없앤다. (2) $x + 10 = (x - 2)^2$ 를 전개해 표준형으로 정리한다. (3) $x^2 - 5x - 6 = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 x = -1 또는 x = 6 이다. (5) 원식의 우변 $x - 2$ 은 근호 값이므로 0 이상이어야 한다. x = -1 일 때 -3 < 0 이라 제외한다. (6) x = 6 를 원식에 대입해 성립함을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Square both sides to remove the radical. (2) Expand and move everything to one side. (3) Write the quadratic. (4) Factor to get two candidates. (5) The right side must be nonnegative, which rules out one candidate. (6) Verify the remaining candidate. So the answer is 6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.554Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"root","extraThinking":"제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답","concepts":["무리방정식 제곱","이차방정식 인수분해","외래근 검증"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"radical_equation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6,"correctOption":"6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3531650f-dcb9-54bb-a5bf-922f2f7f73e2","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4a1c8703-2819-5606-a051-c1f58aa7dc38","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.chain2/larger","group":"nes.root.chain2","passage":"Let k be the larger solution of the equation $x^2 - 7x - 8 = 0$. A second equation is built from k:\n\n$x^2 - 2kx + k^2 - 4 = 0$","question":"What is the greater solution of the second equation?","options":["8","2","6","10"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식 $x^2 - 7x - 8 = 0$ 을 인수분해한다. (2) 근은 x = -1 과 x = 8 이므로 큰 근 k = 8 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식에 k = 8 를 대입한다: $(x - 8)^2 = 4$ 꼴이다. (4) 양변의 제곱근을 취하면 x - 8 = ±2 이다. (5) x = 6 또는 x = 10 이다. (6) 큰 근은 10 이다. 따라서 정답은 10이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor the first equation. (2) Find the two solutions and take the larger one as k. (3) Substitute k. (4) Take square roots. (5) Solve for x. (6) Choose the requested solution. So the answer is 10.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.555Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계에서 구한 값이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 근 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"root","extraThinking":"앞 단계에서 구한 값이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 근 하나","concepts":["이차방정식 인수분해","치환·전개","완전제곱형 방정식"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"larger","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":10,"correctOption":"10"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4a1c8703-2819-5606-a051-c1f58aa7dc38","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"914848b8-5bb4-578b-a049-35327451fc4d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.inverse/diff_coeffs","group":"nes.root.inverse","passage":"In the equation given here, m and n are constants. One solution of the equation is -1, and the other solution is 6 more than that solution.\n\n$x^2 + mx + n = 0$","question":"Find n - m.","options":["-1","-9","-5","9"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 한 근이 -1 이고 다른 근은 6 more than 이므로 다른 근은 5 이다. (2) 근의 합은 -1 + 5 = 4 이고 이것은 -m 와 같다. (3) 따라서 m = -4 이다. (4) 근의 곱은 -1·5 = -5 이고 이것은 n 와 같다. (5) n - m = -5 - (-4) = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the other solution. (2) The sum of the solutions equals the negative of the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product equals the constant term. (5) Compute the requested combination. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.555Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"root","extraThinking":"근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","근의 차 조건","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"diff_coeffs","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"914848b8-5bb4-578b-a049-35327451fc4d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"00bab3e6-900b-583b-aa9a-36b04b986f9c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse/rearranged_form","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"The equation shown has two different real solutions, where b and c are constants. The sum of the solutions is 1, and the product of the solutions is -30.\n\n$4x^2 = bx + c$","question":"What is the value of b + c?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["124"],"explanation":"(1) 4x² = bx + c 를 표준형으로 이항하면 $4x^2 - bx - c = 0$ 이다. (2) 두 근의 합 = b/4 = 1 이므로 b = 4 이다. (3) 두 근의 곱 = -c/4 = -30 이므로 c = 120 이다. (4) 부호에 주의해 b 와 c 를 확인한다(c 는 이항 때문에 곱의 -4 배). (5) b + c = 4 + 120 = 124 이다. 따라서 정답은 124이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Move every term to one side. (2) Use the sum of solutions. (3) Use the product of solutions. (4) Check the signs created by moving terms. (5) Add. So the answer is 124.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.556Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음","concepts":["표준형 정리(이항)","근과 계수의 관계","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"rearranged_form","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":124,"correctOption":"124"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"00bab3e6-900b-583b-aa9a-36b04b986f9c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5e45d162-2eff-5da3-af7c-f3d7638a7dc0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition/param_sum_condition","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","passage":"In the equation below, k is a constant. The equation has two real solutions, and the sum of the solutions is -11.\n\n$x^2 + (-3k - 1)x + (-2k + 22) = 0$","question":"Find the product of the two solutions.","options":["-11","30","-30","-4"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 두 근의 합은 x 의 계수의 부호를 바꾼 값이다. (2) -(-3k - 1) = -11 로 놓는다. (3) 이 일차방정식을 풀면 k = -4 이다. (4) 상수항에 k = -4 를 대입하면 -2·(-4) + 22 = 30 이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 상수항과 같으므로 30 이다. 따라서 정답은 30이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (2) Set the sum equal to the given value. (3) Solve for k. (4) Substitute k into the constant term. (5) The product equals the constant term. So the answer is 30.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.556Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","매개변수 일차방정식","대입 후 곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"param_sum_condition","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":30,"correctOption":"30"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5e45d162-2eff-5da3-af7c-f3d7638a7dc0","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"12fe4a13-b9c5-59ba-acc2-7eccae7af76c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind/sum_of_y","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"A parabola and a line are given by the equations below, and they cross at two points in the xy-plane.\n\n$y = x^2 + 2$\n$y = 8x - 10$","question":"What is the sum of the y-coordinates of the two points of intersection?","options":["8","44","54","64"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 교점에서는 두 식의 y 가 같으므로 두 식의 우변을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 2 = 8x - 10$ 이다. (3) 모두 한쪽으로 옮기면 $x^2 - 8x + 12 = 0$ 이다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(-8) = 8 = 8 이다 (x 좌표의 합). (5) 각 점의 y 좌표는 직선 y = 8x - 10 에서 나오므로 합은 8(8) + 2(-10) = 44 이다. 따라서 정답은 44이다.","explanationEn":"(1) At an intersection the two y-values are equal. (2) Set the right sides equal. (3) Move all terms to one side. (4) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (5) Sum the y-values through the line. So the answer is 44.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.557Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","방정식 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"sum_of_y","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":44,"correctOption":"44"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"12fe4a13-b9c5-59ba-acc2-7eccae7af76c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b43475ff-f96c-570c-a051-31e72d3e24ed","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_leading_coefficient","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k be the sum of the solutions of the equation $x^2 - 12x + 27 = 0$. Then a second equation is written using that value of k:\n\n$kx^2 + 12x + 1 = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the real solutions of the second equation?","options":["12","1","-12","-1"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 합은 -(-12) = 12 이므로 k = 12 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = 12 를 대입하면 $12x^2 + 12x + 1 = 0$ 이다. (3) 판별식 -12² - 4·12·1 = 96 > 0 이므로 서로 다른 두 실근이 있다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(12) / 12 이다. (5) -12 / 12 = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Check that real solutions exist. (4) Use -b/a. (5) Divide. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.557Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"sum_then_leading_coefficient","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b43475ff-f96c-570c-a051-31e72d3e24ed","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2e83625e-2e4b-5272-a69e-eccfa6027cbe","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse/leading_coefficient_inverse","group":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"For the equation shown, k is a positive integer, and the equation has two real solutions whose product is 8.\n\n$kx^2 + 18x + 24 = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the solutions of the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-6"],"explanation":"(1) 근의 곱은 c/k = 24/k 이고 이것이 8 이다. (2) 24/k = 8 이므로 k = 3 이다. (3) k = 3 를 대입한 방정식은 $3x^2 + 18x + 24 = 0$ 이다. (4) 근의 합은 -(18) / 3 이다. (5) -18 / 3 = -6 이다. 따라서 정답은 -6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of solutions is c over the leading coefficient. (2) Solve for k. (3) Write the equation with k known. (4) Use -b/a for the sum. (5) Divide. So the answer is -6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.557Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계(곱)","최고차 계수 역산","근과 계수의 관계(합)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"leading_coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-6,"correctOption":"-6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"2e83625e-2e4b-5272-a69e-eccfa6027cbe","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d7fb2e36-d323-5b16-aa9e-9035c8bd21f7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind/one_negative_t","group":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"For the equation shown, x is a real number. $x^4 - 2x^2 - 8 = 0$","question":"Find the product of every real solution of the equation.","options":["-8","-2","4","-4"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² = t 로 치환하면 t 에 대한 이차방정식이 된다. (2) $t^2 - 2t - 8 = 0$ 을 인수분해해 t 의 근을 구한다. (3) t = 4 또는 t = -2 이다. x² = t 가 실수이려면 t ≥ 0 이어야 하므로 t = 4 만 쓴다. (4) 실근은 x = ±2 이다. (5) 모든 실근의 곱은 -4 이다. 따라서 정답은 -4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute t = x². (2) Factor the quadratic in t. (3) A negative t cannot equal x², so keep only the positive root. (4) List the real solutions. (5) Multiply them, keeping the signs. So the answer is -4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.558Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱","concepts":["치환(x²=t)","근과 계수의 관계","실근 선별(음수 제곱 제외)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"one_negative_t","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-4,"correctOption":"-4"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d7fb2e36-d323-5b16-aa9e-9035c8bd21f7","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e8939e8e-f3ba-53b9-a9e1-a66da094d8fb","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2/product_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the product of the two solutions of $x^2 - 8x + 12 = 0$. Consider the second equation below, which uses k:\n\n$x^2 + (k - 3)x - 3k = 0$","question":"Find the sum of the squares of the two solutions of the second equation.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["153"],"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 곱은 상수항 12 이므로 k = 12 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = 12 를 대입하면 $x^2 + (9)x - 36 = 0$ 이다. (3) 인수분해하면 $(x - 3)(x + 12) = 0$ 이므로 근은 3 과 -12 이다. (4) 두 근의 제곱의 합은 3² + (-12)² 이다. (5) 9 + 144 = 153 이다. 따라서 정답은 153이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Factor the second equation. (4) Square and add. (5) Compute. So the answer is 153.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.558Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱의 합"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"product_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":153,"correctOption":"153"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"e8939e8e-f3ba-53b9-a9e1-a66da094d8fb","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"54bc3b9e-7271-54ca-a923-e49a0950737e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition/count_two_real","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","passage":"In the equation below, k is a positive integer.\n\n$x^2 - 18x + k = 0$","question":"How many values of k give an equation with two different real solutions?","options":["79","81","18","80"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² 의 계수가 1 이므로 판별식은 D = b² - 4k 이다. (2) 서로 다른 두 실근이므로 D > 0, 즉 324 - 4k > 0 이다. (3) 이를 풀면 k < 81 이다(k = 81 는 D = 0 이라 제외). (4) 1 ≤ k ≤ 80 인 정수를 센다. (5) 개수는 80 이다. 따라서 정답은 80이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the discriminant. (2) Translate the root condition into an inequality. (3) Solve the inequality, watching the boundary. (4) Count the integers in the allowed range. (5) State the count. So the answer is 80.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.558Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정","concepts":["판별식 부등식","정수 개수 세기","경계값 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"count_two_real","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":80,"correctOption":"80"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"54bc3b9e-7271-54ca-a923-e49a0950737e","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"98973a34-eece-5433-aeaa-a84f416523b7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select/overlap_possible","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","passage":"Consider the equation below. $(x^2 - 25)(x^2 - 7x) = 0$","question":"What is the number of distinct positive real solutions of the equation?","options":["4","2","3","1"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 곱이 0 이므로 두 인수 중 하나가 0 이다. (2) x² - 25 = 0 에서 x = ±5 이다. (3) $x^2 - 7x = 0$ 을 풀면 x = 7, 0 이다. (4) 모든 실근 중 양수만 모은다. (5) 겹치는 값을 한 번만 세어 서로 다른 양의 실근은 2 개이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A product is zero when a factor is zero. (2) Solve the first factor. (3) Solve the second factor. (4) Keep only the positive solutions. (5) Count distinct positive solutions once each. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.559Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["곱의 영 인수분해","양수 조건","중복 해 제거"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"overlap_possible","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"98973a34-eece-5433-aeaa-a84f416523b7","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"bd621722-9bf6-5603-aa50-387adc578ac8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind/translation_intercepts","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","passage":"The graph of the function f is shown by the equation below:\n\n$f(x) = x^2 + 12x + 11$\n\nThe graph of f is translated 5 units to the right and then 30 units up to form the graph of g.","question":"What is the number of x-intercepts of the graph of g?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["0"],"explanation":"(1) f 의 꼭짓점의 y 좌표(최솟값)는 11 - 144/4 = -25 이다. (2) 수평 이동은 x절편의 위치만 바꾸고 개수는 바꾸지 않는다. (3) 위로 30 이동하면 g 의 최솟값은 -25 + 30 = 5 이다. (4) 아래로 열린 포물선이 아니라 위로 열린 포물선(최고차 계수 1 > 0)이다. (5) 최솟값이 양수 이므로 x절편은 0 개이다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the minimum value of f. (2) A horizontal shift moves the intercepts but does not change how many there are. (3) Apply the vertical shift to the minimum. (4) The parabola opens upward. (5) Decide the number of x-intercepts from the sign of the minimum. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.559Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정","concepts":["그래프 평행이동","꼭짓점(최솟값)","x절편과 실근 개수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"translation_intercepts","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"bd621722-9bf6-5603-aa50-387adc578ac8","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d48c321d-854c-586c-a2d7-2fd33380ff05","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios/union_of_solution_sets","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","passage":"Two equations are given below:\n\nEquation 1: $x^2 - x - 6 = 0$\n\nEquation 2: $x^2 - 25 = 0$","question":"How many different real numbers are a solution to at least one of the two equations?","options":["4","3","2","5"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) Equation 1 을 풀면 x = 3, -2 이다. (2) Equation 2 의 판별식 0 - 4·(-25) = 100 의 부호를 확인한다. (3) Equation 2 의 실근: 5 와 -5. (4) 두 해 집합을 합하되 같은 값은 한 번만 센다. (5) 서로 다른 실수 해는 4 개이다. 따라서 정답은 4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Solve Equation 1. (2) Check the discriminant of Equation 2. (3) Solve Equation 2 over the reals. (4) Combine the two solution sets without double counting. (5) Count the distinct numbers. So the answer is 4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.559Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["이차방정식 풀이","해 집합 비교","합집합의 원소 수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"union_of_solution_sets","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":4,"correctOption":"4"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d48c321d-854c-586c-a2d7-2fd33380ff05","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"aa2d1483-54a9-573c-ac47-eb4c44f98414","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse/conjugate_sum","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"Both solutions of the equation $x^2 + bx + c = 0$, where b and c are integers, can be written as $-4 \\pm 3\\sqrt{3}$.","question":"What is the value of b + c?","options":["-19","-11","8","-3"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 계수가 정수이므로 두 해는 켤레 p ± q√n 이다: -4 ± 3√3. (2) 두 해의 합은 2·(-4) = -8 이고 이것은 -b 이다. (3) b = 8 이다. (4) 두 해의 곱은 (-4)² - (3√3)² = 16 - 27 = -11 이고 이것이 c 이다. (5) b + c = 8 + (-11) = -3 이다. 따라서 정답은 -3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The solutions are a conjugate pair. (2) The sum of the solutions is minus the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product of conjugates is p² - q²n. (5) Combine. So the answer is -3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.559Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음","concepts":["켤레근","근과 계수의 관계","근호 제곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"conjugate_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-3,"correctOption":"-3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"aa2d1483-54a9-573c-ac47-eb4c44f98414","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"af7e1946-55e9-591c-acc9-71114d4f57df","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind/squared_difference","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"Consider the equation below, which has two real solutions, and neither solution is an integer.\n\n$x^2 + 6x - 1 = 0$","question":"What is the value of the squared difference of the two solutions?","options":["34","40","38","36"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 판별식 36 - 4·(-1) = 40 > 0 이고 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 서로 다른 무리수이다. (2) 두 해의 합 r + s = -6, 곱 rs = -1 이다. (3) (r - s)² = (r + s)² - 4rs 를 이용한다. (4) 36 - 4·(-1) 를 계산한다. (5) 결과는 40 이다. 따라서 정답은 40이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Check the discriminant: two irrational real solutions. (2) Vieta's formulas. (3) Use the symmetric identity. (4) Substitute the sum and product. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 40.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.559Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","대칭식 항등식","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"squared_difference","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":40,"correctOption":"40"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"af7e1946-55e9-591c-acc9-71114d4f57df","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"97fe012b-27d9-5aab-a6f7-93a05a4ef9ba","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k be the sum of the solutions of the equation $3x^2 + 18x + 2 = 0$. Then a second equation is written with that value of k:\n\n$x^2 - 5x - k = 0$","question":"What is the value of the sum of the squares of the solutions of the second equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["13"],"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식의 판별식 324 - 4·3·2 = 300 는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 무리수이다. 해를 구하지 않고 합을 쓴다. (2) 두 해의 합은 -(18)/3 = -6 이므로 k = -6 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식은 $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0$ 이므로 합 5, 곱 6 이다. (4) 제곱합은 (합)² - 2(곱) 이다. (5) 5² - 2·(6) = 25 + (-12) = 13 이다. 따라서 정답은 13이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The roots are irrational, so use the sum formula instead of solving. (2) Compute k. (3) Substitute k into the second equation. (4) Use the sum-of-squares identity. (5) Compute. So the answer is 13.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.560Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱합 항등식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"sum_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":13,"correctOption":"13"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"97fe012b-27d9-5aab-a6f7-93a05a4ef9ba","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ed83f0df-ca46-5b3b-aef8-c805e86d5bee","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift/area_equation_sum","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","passage":"A rectangular poster has a width of w inches. Its length is 5 less than twice the width, and its area is 70 square inches. Setting the area expression equal to the given area gives a quadratic equation in w.","question":"If both solutions of the equation are added, including one that cannot be a width, what is the sum?","options":["5","35","5/2","-5/2"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 가로가 w, 세로가 5 less than twice the width 이므로 세로는 2w - 5 이다. (2) 넓이 = 가로 × 세로 이므로 $w(2w - 5) = 70$ 이다. (3) 전개해 표준형으로 정리하면 $2w^2 - 5w - 70 = 0$ 이다. (4) 판별식 25 + 560 = 585 > 0 이므로 서로 다른 두 실근이 있다. (5) 두 근의 합은 -(-5)/2 = 5/2 이다. 따라서 정답은 5/2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the length in terms of w. (2) Area is width times length. (3) Expand and move everything to one side. (4) Two real solutions exist. (5) Use -b/a. So the answer is 5/2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.560Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(넓이 조건)을 식으로 모델링해 표준형으로 정리한 뒤, 도형에서는 의미 없는 근까지 포함한 근의 합을 읽음 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"문장(넓이 조건)을 식으로 모델링해 표준형으로 정리한 뒤, 도형에서는 의미 없는 근까지 포함한 근의 합을 읽음 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 방정식의 합","concepts":["도형 문장의 식 세우기(넓이)","표준형 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"area_equation_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2.5,"correctOption":"5/2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"ed83f0df-ca46-5b3b-aef8-c805e86d5bee","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"acc8b19b-181d-5d3c-a9ad-fa050e156f78","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse/formula_inverse","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"In the equation below, b and c are integers. The solutions of the equation are $\\frac{-1 \\pm \\sqrt{85}}{6}$.\n\n$3x^2 + bx + c = 0$","question":"What must c equal?","options":["-7","7","-84","-14"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 공식 x = (-b ± √(b² - 4·3·c)) / 6 와 주어진 해를 비교한다. (2) 분모 6 = 2·3 로 a = 3 와 일치한다. (3) 분자의 -b = -1 이므로 b = 1 이다. (4) 근호 안: b² - 4·3·c = 85, 즉 1 - 12c = 85 이다. (5) 이를 풀면 c = -7 이다. 따라서 정답은 -7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Compare with the quadratic formula. (2) The denominator matches 2a. (3) Read the linear coefficient. (4) Set the discriminant equal to the radicand. (5) Solve for the constant. So the answer is -7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.560Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 공식 결과에서 b = -u, 판별식 b²-4ac = D 로 c 를 거꾸로 푸는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 곱 c/a 를 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 공식 결과에서 b = -u, 판별식 b²-4ac = D 로 c 를 거꾸로 푸는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 곱 c/a 를 읽음","concepts":["근의 공식","판별식 역산","계수 비교"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"formula_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-7,"correctOption":"-7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"acc8b19b-181d-5d3c-a9ad-fa050e156f78","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"58532c2b-72d2-5cec-a81c-0a5573e8a0b9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2/product_then_factor","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Suppose k equals the product of the solutions of $3x^2 + 5x - 15 = 0$. Consider the second equation below, which uses k:\n\n$x^2 + (k + 6)x + 6k = 0$","question":"Find the larger solution of the second equation.","options":["6","5","-6","-5"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식의 판별식 25 - -180 = 205 는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 무리수이다. 곱의 공식을 쓴다. (2) 두 해의 곱은 -15/3 = -5 이므로 k = -5 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식에 k = -5 를 대입하면 $x^2 + 1x + (-30) = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 $(x + (-5))(x + 6) = 0$ 이다. (5) 근은 5 와 -6 이고 큰 근은 5 이다. 따라서 정답은 5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The roots are irrational; use the product formula. (2) Compute k. (3) Substitute k. (4) Factor. (5) Pick the larger solution. So the answer is 5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.561Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["무리수 근을 풀지 않고 곱을 읽은 뒤 그 값이 인수분해 가능한 둘째 방정식의 계수가 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"무리수 근을 풀지 않고 곱을 읽은 뒤 그 값이 인수분해 가능한 둘째 방정식의 계수가 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","이차방정식 인수분해"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"product_then_factor","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5,"correctOption":"5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"58532c2b-72d2-5cec-a81c-0a5573e8a0b9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"93fbabdf-5daa-5679-af24-841977e3fd70","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift/revenue_equation_product","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","passage":"A theater sells tickets at a price of p dollars per ticket. At that price, it sells 50 - 3p tickets per day, and the revenue is 160 dollars per day. Setting the revenue expression equal to the given revenue gives a quadratic equation in p.","question":"If both solutions of the equation are multiplied, what is the product?","options":["50/3","160","-160/3","160/3"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 가격이 p 이고 판매량이 50 - 3p 이므로 매출 = 가격 × 판매량 = p(50 - 3p) 이다. (2) 매출이 160 이므로 $p(50 - 3p) = 160$ 이다. (3) 전개해 표준형으로 정리하면 $3p^2 - 50p + 160 = 0$ 이다. (4) 판별식 2500 - 1920 = 580 > 0 이고 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 서로 다른 무리수이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 160/3 = 160/3 이다. 따라서 정답은 160/3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Revenue is price times quantity. (2) Set revenue equal to the given amount. (3) Expand and move all terms to one side. (4) The solutions are irrational real numbers. (5) Use c/a. So the answer is 160/3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.561Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(가격·판매량·매출)을 식으로 모델링한 뒤 표준형의 상수항과 최고차 계수의 비를 읽음 — medium 은 식으로 주어진 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"문장(가격·판매량·매출)을 식으로 모델링한 뒤 표준형의 상수항과 최고차 계수의 비를 읽음 — medium 은 식으로 주어진 방정식의 곱","concepts":["문장 모델링(매출=가격×판매량)","표준형 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"revenue_equation_product","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":53.33333333333334,"correctOption":"160/3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"93fbabdf-5daa-5679-af24-841977e3fd70","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5559eb22-5243-59ad-a6c6-b7ff964561d7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.param_condition/ask_solution","group":"nes.root.param_condition","passage":"In the equation given here, b is a positive constant such that the equation has exactly one real solution.\n\n$x^2 + bx + 121 = 0$","question":"What is the value of x that satisfies the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-11"],"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 방정식은 중근을 갖고, 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = b² - 4·121 = 0 이므로 b² = 484 이다. (3) b 는 양수이므로 b = 22 이다. (4) 방정식은 $(x + 11)^2 = 0$ 꼴이다. (5) 따라서 해는 x = -11 이다. 따라서 정답은 -11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means a double root, so D = 0. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive constant. (4) The equation becomes a perfect square. (5) Read off the solution. So the answer is -11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.561Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"root","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이","concepts":["판별식 조건","완전제곱 중근","부호 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"ask_solution","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-11,"correctOption":"-11"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5559eb22-5243-59ad-a6c6-b7ff964561d7","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3dd446ea-ca61-5474-a73d-2b696f6c46f8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2/square_of_root","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the greater of the two solutions of $x^2 - 8x - 36 = 0$.","question":"Which expression is equivalent to k squared?","options":["$68 + 16\\sqrt{13}$","$16 + 16\\sqrt{13}$","$68$","$68 - 16\\sqrt{13}$"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 공식으로 큰 해를 구한다. (2) $k = 4 + 2\\sqrt{13}$ 로 근호를 정리한다 (판별식 208 = 208). (3) 제곱한다: $k^2 = (4)^2 + 2(4)(2\\sqrt{13}) + (2\\sqrt{13})^2$ . (4) $(2\\sqrt{13})^2 = 52$ 이므로 상수항은 16 + 52 = 68 이다. (5) $k^2 = 68 + 16\\sqrt{13}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $68 + 16\\sqrt{13}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the quadratic formula. (2) Simplify the radical. (3) Square the binomial. (4) Evaluate the radical square. (5) Combine like terms. So the answer is $68 + 16\\sqrt{13}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.562Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 공식 → 근호 정리 → 이항 제곱 전개 → 동류항 정리의 4단 연쇄 — medium 은 근호꼴 해를 구하는 한 단계"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"근의 공식 → 근호 정리 → 이항 제곱 전개 → 동류항 정리의 4단 연쇄 — medium 은 근호꼴 해를 구하는 한 단계","concepts":["근의 공식·근호 정리","이항식 제곱","근호 동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"square_of_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":125.68882040742385,"correctOption":"$68 + 16\\sqrt{13}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3dd446ea-ca61-5474-a73d-2b696f6c46f8","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"84d33816-e7f0-5996-a313-8295e1947f13","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.constraint_select/negative_root","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.constraint_select","passage":"The equation below has two real solutions, one positive and one negative. $x^2 - 4x - 40 = 0$","question":"What is the solution of the equation that is less than 0?","options":["$-2 - 2\\sqrt{11}$","$2 + 2\\sqrt{11}$","$2 - 2\\sqrt{11}$","$-2 + 2\\sqrt{11}$"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 상수항 -40 < 0 이므로 두 해의 곱이 음수여서 한 해는 양수, 한 해는 음수이다. (2) 근의 공식: x = (4 ± √176) / 2 이다. (3) √176 = 4√11 로 정리하면 x = 2 ± 2√11 이다. (4) 음수 해는 - 부호를 택한 $2 - 2\\sqrt{11}$ 이다 (반대 부호 해는 $2 + 2\\sqrt{11}$ 로 조건에 맞지 않는다). (5) 답: $2 - 2\\sqrt{11}$. 따라서 정답은 $2 - 2\\sqrt{11}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A negative constant means the solutions have opposite signs. (2) Apply the quadratic formula. (3) Simplify the radical. (4) Choose the solution matching the sign condition. (5) State the answer. So the answer is $2 - 2\\sqrt{11}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.563Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 해의 부호(c<0 이면 서로 다른 부호)를 판단해 조건에 맞는 해를 고르고 근호를 정리 — medium 은 근호꼴의 두 해를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"두 해의 부호(c<0 이면 서로 다른 부호)를 판단해 조건에 맞는 해를 고르고 근호를 정리 — medium 은 근호꼴의 두 해를 구함","concepts":["근의 공식·근호 정리","근의 부호 판단","조건에 맞는 해 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"negative_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-4.6332495807108,"correctOption":"$2 - 2\\sqrt{11}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"84d33816-e7f0-5996-a313-8295e1947f13","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5eaf73ec-7b48-5d0e-ae17-b10e875ee570","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind/two_numbers_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind","passage":"Two positive numbers differ by 6, and the sum of their squares is 44.","question":"Which of the following is the greater of the two numbers?","options":["$6 + \\sqrt{13}$","$-3 - \\sqrt{13}$","$-3 + \\sqrt{13}$","$3 + \\sqrt{13}$"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 작은 수를 x 라 하면 큰 수는 x + 6 이다. (2) 제곱의 합: $x^2 + (x + 6)^2 = 44$ 이다. (3) 전개·정리하면 $x^2 + 6x + -4 = 0$ 이다. (4) 근의 공식으로 x = -3 ± 1√13 이고, 양수이므로 x = $-3 + \\sqrt{13}$ 이다. (5) 큰 수는 x + 6 = $3 + \\sqrt{13}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $3 + \\sqrt{13}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let the smaller number be x. (2) Write the sum of squares. (3) Expand and simplify. (4) Choose the positive solution. (5) Add the difference. So the answer is $3 + \\sqrt{13}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.564Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(수의 관계)을 이차방정식으로 모델링해 근의 공식과 근호 정리, 양수 조건 선택, 큰 수 계산까지 연결 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근호꼴 해"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"문장(수의 관계)을 이차방정식으로 모델링해 근의 공식과 근호 정리, 양수 조건 선택, 큰 수 계산까지 연결 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근호꼴 해","concepts":["문장 모델링","근의 공식·근호 정리","양수 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"two_numbers_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6.60555127546399,"correctOption":"$3 + \\sqrt{13}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5eaf73ec-7b48-5d0e-ae17-b10e875ee570","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f5771ad0-b03d-5123-af8a-775afb3d8cba","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition/tangent_k","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","passage":"The parabola and the line given by the equations below touch at exactly one point in the xy-plane. The constant k is a real number.\n\n$y = x^2 - x + 1$\n$y = -15x + k$","question":"What must k equal?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-48"],"explanation":"(1) 교점에서 두 식의 y 가 같으므로 이차식과 직선식을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 - x + 1 = -15x + k$ 를 정리하면 $x^2 + 14x + 1 - k = 0$ 이다. (3) 한 점에서 만나므로 이 방정식이 중근을 가져야 한다: 판별식 D = 0. (4) (14)² - 4(1 - k) = 0 에서 k = 1 - 196/4 = -48 이다. (5) 중근은 x = -(14)/2 = -7 이다. 묻는 값은 k 이다. 따라서 정답은 -48이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the two expressions for y equal. (2) Rearrange into standard form. (3) One intersection point means a double root. (4) Solve D = 0 for k. (5) The double root is the x-coordinate of the touching point. So the answer is -48.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.565Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["'한 점에서 만난다'를 두 식을 같게 놓은 이차방정식의 판별식 0 으로 번역해 직선의 상수를 정함 — medium 은 교점 개수 또는 좌표를 직접 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"'한 점에서 만난다'를 두 식을 같게 놓은 이차방정식의 판별식 0 으로 번역해 직선의 상수를 정함 — medium 은 교점 개수 또는 좌표를 직접 구함","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","판별식 조건","접점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"tangent_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-48,"correctOption":"-48"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f5771ad0-b03d-5123-af8a-775afb3d8cba","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"59de22a6-ced8-5c04-a181-30ed7e7b963b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind/points_to_line_sum_x","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","passage":"A line passes through the points (3, -16) and (5, -24) in the xy-plane. It intersects the parabola $y = x^2 + 4x + 11$ at two points.","question":"What is the sum of the x-coordinates of the intersection points?","options":["8","-8","0","15"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 기울기 = (-24 - (-16)) / (5 - 3) = -4 이다. (2) 직선의 식은 y = -4x - 4 이다. (3) 교점에서는 y 가 같으므로 $x^2 + 4x + 11 = -4x - 4$ 이다. (4) 정리하면 $x^2 + 8x + 15 = 0$ 이고 두 근의 합은 -8 = -8 이다 (x 좌표의 합). (5) 판별식이 양수여서 서로 다른 두 교점이 있음을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 -8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Compute the slope of the line. (2) Find the intercept and write the line. (3) Set the two expressions equal. (4) The sum of solutions gives the sum of x-coordinates. (5) Check the discriminant is positive. So the answer is -8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.565Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 점에서 직선의 식(기울기·절편)을 구하는 개념과 교점 개념을 연결 — medium 은 식이 주어진 직선과 포물선의 교점"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"두 점에서 직선의 식(기울기·절편)을 구하는 개념과 교점 개념을 연결 — medium 은 식이 주어진 직선과 포물선의 교점","concepts":["두 점을 지나는 직선","이차함수와 직선의 교점","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"points_to_line_sum_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-8,"correctOption":"-8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"59de22a6-ced8-5c04-a181-30ed7e7b963b","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b1b5b7d7-376d-5e34-a864-34ec3eadd369","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select/first_quadrant_point","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","passage":"A parabola and a line are given by the equations below, and they cross at two points in the xy-plane.\n\n$y = x^2 + 4x - 7$\n$y = x + 3$","question":"What is the y-coordinate of the point of intersection that lies in the first quadrant?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["5"],"explanation":"(1) 교점에서 y 가 같으므로 두 식을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 3x - 10 = 0$ 을 만든다. (3) 인수분해하면 x = -5 또는 x = 2 이다. (4) 직선에 대입해 두 교점 (-5, -2), (2, 5) 를 구한다. (5) 제1사분면은 x > 0 이고 y > 0 이므로 (2, 5) 만 해당한다. (6) y 좌표는 5 이다. 따라서 정답은 5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the expressions for y equal. (2) Rearrange to standard form. (3) Factor to find the x-coordinates. (4) Find both intersection points. (5) Keep the point with both coordinates positive. (6) Read the y-coordinate. So the answer is 5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.565Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 교점을 모두 구한 뒤 사분면 조건(양쪽 좌표 부호)으로 후보를 제거 — medium 은 교점의 x좌표를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"두 교점을 모두 구한 뒤 사분면 조건(양쪽 좌표 부호)으로 후보를 제거 — medium 은 교점의 x좌표를 구함","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","방정식 풀이","사분면 조건 선택"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"first_quadrant_point","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5,"correctOption":"5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b1b5b7d7-376d-5e34-a864-34ec3eadd369","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"be56718b-3713-5607-a938-f25b155a2ece","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition/sum_of_k","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","passage":"In the equation given here, k is an integer constant. The equation has exactly one real solution.\n\n$x^2 + kx + (-k + 24) = 0$","question":"If all possible values of k are added, what is the sum?","options":["-4","4","-2","-96"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = k² - 4(-k + 24) = 0 이므로 $k^2 - (-4)k - 96 = 0$ 이다. (3) 이 k 에 대한 이차방정식의 판별식 16 + 384 = 400 = 400 는 양수이므로 k 는 두 개이다. (4) 근과 계수의 관계 또는 인수분해로 k = -12, 8 이다. (5) 합: 8 + (-12) = -4 이다. 따라서 정답은 -4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One real solution means D = 0. (2) Write the condition as an equation in k. (3) The condition in k has two solutions. (4) Solve for k. (5) Combine as requested. So the answer is -4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.565Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건이 매개변수에 대한 또 하나의 이차방정식(k²-4uk-4m=0)이 되는 이중 구조 — medium 은 계수 하나가 미지수인 판별식 부등식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건이 매개변수에 대한 또 하나의 이차방정식(k²-4uk-4m=0)이 되는 이중 구조 — medium 은 계수 하나가 미지수인 판별식 부등식","concepts":["판별식 조건","매개변수 이차방정식","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"sum_of_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-4,"correctOption":"-4"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"be56718b-3713-5607-a938-f25b155a2ece","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f9073f3f-17ce-5f4d-ac89-4c0d2f6cea7c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse/double_root_given","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","passage":"In the equation below, m and n are constants. The equation has exactly one real solution, x = 11.\n\n$x^2 + mx + n = 0$","question":"What is the value of m + n?","options":["-22","143","99","121"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이고 x = 11 이므로 중근이다. (2) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 식은 $(x - 11)^2$ 와 같다. (3) 전개하면 $x^2 - 22x + 121$ 이다. (4) 계수를 읽으면 m = -22, n = 121 이다. (5) m + n = -22 + 121 = 99 이다. 따라서 정답은 99이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A single solution is a double root. (2) The quadratic must be a perfect square. (3) Expand the square. (4) Read the coefficients. (5) Combine. So the answer is 99.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.565Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["중근 조건에서 이차식 자체를 (x-r)² 으로 재구성해 계수를 읽는 역방향 사고 — medium 은 판별식으로 매개변수를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"중근 조건에서 이차식 자체를 (x-r)² 으로 재구성해 계수를 읽는 역방향 사고 — medium 은 판별식으로 매개변수를 구함","concepts":["중근과 완전제곱식","전개·계수 비교","접선(꼭짓점이 x축 위)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"double_root_given","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":99,"correctOption":"99"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f9073f3f-17ce-5f4d-ac89-4c0d2f6cea7c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b937f4d8-4804-5572-adc7-b95f966e9731","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select/count_k_two_real","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","passage":"For the equation shown, k is a nonzero integer with -8 ≤ k ≤ 8.\n\n$kx^2 + 7x + 1 = 0$","question":"How many values of k give an equation with two different real solutions?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["16"],"explanation":"(1) k ≠ 0 이므로 이차방정식이고 판별식은 D = b² - 4kc 이다. (2) 서로 다른 두 실근이므로 D > 0, 즉 49 - 4k > 0 이다. (3) 음수 k 는 항상 D > 0 을 만족하므로 -8 ≤ k ≤ -1 의 8개가 모두 성립한다. (4) 양수 k 는 k < 49/4 이어야 하고 경계는 제외하므로 1 ≤ k ≤ 12 중 8 이하인 8개이다. (5) 전체 개수는 8 + 8 = 16 이다. 따라서 정답은 16이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The equation is quadratic since k is nonzero. (2) Two distinct real solutions need D > 0. (3) Every negative k works. (4) Positive k must satisfy a strict upper bound. (5) Add the counts. So the answer is 16.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.566Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["최고차 계수가 매개변수라 k=0 제외, 음수 k 는 항상 성립, 양수 k 는 경계(D=0) 제외로 나눠 세는 제약 추적 — medium 은 부호 조건을 만족하는 k 하나를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"최고차 계수가 매개변수라 k=0 제외, 음수 k 는 항상 성립, 양수 k 는 경계(D=0) 제외로 나눠 세는 제약 추적 — medium 은 부호 조건을 만족하는 k 하나를 구함","concepts":["판별식 부등식","정수 범위 세기","k≠0 조건"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"count_k_two_real","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":16,"correctOption":"16"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b937f4d8-4804-5572-adc7-b95f966e9731","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8d9a4103-597a-54b2-a5f9-fa3177685aa2","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2/discriminant_then_count","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2","passage":"For the first equation below, k is a positive constant, and the equation has exactly one real solution.\n\nFirst equation: $x^2 + kx + 4 = 0$\n\nSecond equation: $x^2 - kx + 6 = 0$","question":"Using that value of k, what is the number of real solutions of the second equation?","options":["2","1","3","0"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식이 해가 하나뿐이므로 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) k² - 4·4 = 0 이므로 k² = 16 이다. (3) k 는 양수이므로 k = 4 이다. (4) 둘째 방정식에 k = 4 를 대입하면 $x^2 - 4x + 6 = 0$ 이고 판별식은 16 - 4·6 = -8 이다. (5) 판별식이 음수 이므로 실근은 0 개이다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means D = 0 for the first equation. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive value. (4) Substitute k and compute the second discriminant. (5) Decide the number of real solutions from its sign. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.566Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 판별식 조건에서 구한 k 가 뒤 방정식의 판별식 부호를 결정하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 판별식 부호"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 판별식 조건에서 구한 k 가 뒤 방정식의 판별식 부호를 결정하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 판별식 부호","concepts":["판별식 조건","양수 조건 선택","실근 개수 판정"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"discriminant_then_count","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"8d9a4103-597a-54b2-a5f9-fa3177685aa2","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c8a6ded9-ec79-5abe-a13f-ddab14aa81ef","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.param_condition/ask_constant","group":"nes.root.param_condition","passage":"In the equation below, p is a positive constant chosen so that the equation has only one real solution.\n\n$x^2 + px + 36 = 0$","question":"Find p.","options":["36","-12","6","12"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 방정식은 중근을 갖고, 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = p² - 4·36 = 0 이므로 p² = 144 이다. (3) p 는 양수이므로 p = 12 이다. (4) 방정식은 $(x + 6)^2 = 0$ 꼴이다. (5) 따라서 해는 x = -6 이다. 묻는 값은 p = 12 이다. 따라서 정답은 12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means a double root, so D = 0. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive constant. (4) The equation becomes a perfect square. (5) Read off the solution. So the answer is 12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.567Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"root","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이","concepts":["판별식 조건","완전제곱 중근","부호 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"ask_constant","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":12,"correctOption":"12"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"c8a6ded9-ec79-5abe-a13f-ddab14aa81ef","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b08d557f-41fe-5ecf-a8a8-ebb657be2c56","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.constraint_select/radical_equation","group":"nes.root.constraint_select","passage":"Look at the equation below. $\\sqrt{x - 2} = x - 4$","question":"Which value of x satisfies the equation?","options":["6","3","18","9"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 양변을 제곱해 근호를 없앤다. (2) $x - 2 = (x - 4)^2$ 를 전개해 표준형으로 정리한다. (3) $x^2 - 9x + 18 = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 x = 3 또는 x = 6 이다. (5) 원식의 우변 $x - 4$ 은 근호 값이므로 0 이상이어야 한다. x = 3 일 때 -1 < 0 이라 제외한다. (6) x = 6 를 원식에 대입해 성립함을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Square both sides to remove the radical. (2) Expand and move everything to one side. (3) Write the quadratic. (4) Factor to get two candidates. (5) The right side must be nonnegative, which rules out one candidate. (6) Verify the remaining candidate. So the answer is 6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.567Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"root","extraThinking":"제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답","concepts":["무리방정식 제곱","이차방정식 인수분해","외래근 검증"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"radical_equation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6,"correctOption":"6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b08d557f-41fe-5ecf-a8a8-ebb657be2c56","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"71a417d8-7cbe-534a-ad5c-710e679591f0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.inverse/sum_coeffs","group":"nes.root.inverse","passage":"For the equation shown, b and c are constants. One solution of the equation is -5, and the other solution is 1 less than that solution.\n\n$x^2 + bx + c = 0$","question":"What is the sum of b and c?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["41"],"explanation":"(1) 한 근이 -5 이고 다른 근은 1 less than 이므로 다른 근은 -6 이다. (2) 근의 합은 -5 + (-6) = -11 이고 이것은 -b 와 같다. (3) 따라서 b = 11 이다. (4) 근의 곱은 -5·(-6) = 30 이고 이것은 c 와 같다. (5) b + c = 11 + 30 = 41 이다. 따라서 정답은 41이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the other solution. (2) The sum of the solutions equals the negative of the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product equals the constant term. (5) Compute the requested combination. So the answer is 41.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.567Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"root","extraThinking":"근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","근의 차 조건","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"sum_coeffs","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":41,"correctOption":"41"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"71a417d8-7cbe-534a-ad5c-710e679591f0","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0185256c-4a1c-5e2e-aeef-b2b441de63f8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse/rearranged_form","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"Consider the equation below, which has two real solutions, where b and c are constants. The sum of the solutions is 12, and the product of the solutions is 35.\n\n$2x^2 = bx + c$","question":"What is the sum of b and c?","options":["-46","24","94","-70"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 2x² = bx + c 를 표준형으로 이항하면 $2x^2 - bx - c = 0$ 이다. (2) 두 근의 합 = b/2 = 12 이므로 b = 24 이다. (3) 두 근의 곱 = -c/2 = 35 이므로 c = -70 이다. (4) 부호에 주의해 b 와 c 를 확인한다(c 는 이항 때문에 곱의 -2 배). (5) b + c = 24 + (-70) = -46 이다. 따라서 정답은 -46이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Move every term to one side. (2) Use the sum of solutions. (3) Use the product of solutions. (4) Check the signs created by moving terms. (5) Add. So the answer is -46.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.567Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음","concepts":["표준형 정리(이항)","근과 계수의 관계","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"rearranged_form","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-46,"correctOption":"-46"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"0185256c-4a1c-5e2e-aeef-b2b441de63f8","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"31f1762e-c1b9-5716-a6e2-413d675995e8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition/param_sum_condition","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","passage":"For the equation shown, k is a constant. The equation has two real solutions, and the sum of the solutions is 8.\n\n$x^2 + (2k - 18)x + (2k - 3) = 0$","question":"What is the product of the solutions of the equation?","options":["-7","7","5","8"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 두 근의 합은 x 의 계수의 부호를 바꾼 값이다. (2) -(2k - 18) = 8 로 놓는다. (3) 이 일차방정식을 풀면 k = 5 이다. (4) 상수항에 k = 5 를 대입하면 2·5 + (-3) = 7 이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 상수항과 같으므로 7 이다. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (2) Set the sum equal to the given value. (3) Solve for k. (4) Substitute k into the constant term. (5) The product equals the constant term. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.567Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","매개변수 일차방정식","대입 후 곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"param_sum_condition","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"31f1762e-c1b9-5716-a6e2-413d675995e8","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8b66b1f2-daf2-5f71-abc6-3724ba2d7fcf","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind/sum_of_x","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"The system of equations below graphs a parabola and a line that meet at two points in the xy-plane.\n\n$y = x^2 - 3x - 5$\n$y = 5x - 12$","question":"If the two intersection points are added, what is the sum of their x-coordinates?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["8"],"explanation":"(1) 교점에서는 두 식의 y 가 같으므로 두 식의 우변을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 - 3x - 5 = 5x - 12$ 이다. (3) 모두 한쪽으로 옮기면 $x^2 - 8x + 7 = 0$ 이다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(-8) = 8 = 8 이다 (x 좌표의 합). (5) 두 교점이 서로 다른 실수임을 판별식으로 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) At an intersection the two y-values are equal. (2) Set the right sides equal. (3) Move all terms to one side. (4) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (5) Check that two distinct intersections exist. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.568Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","방정식 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"sum_of_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"8b66b1f2-daf2-5f71-abc6-3724ba2d7fcf","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ecb039b0-f937-582a-ab3d-4bee62d24cfa","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_leading_coefficient","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Suppose k is equal to the sum of the solutions of $x^2 - 13x + 36 = 0$. Consider the second equation below, which uses k:\n\n$kx^2 - 26x - 3 = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the solutions of the second equation?","options":["2","13","26","-2"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 합은 -(-13) = 13 이므로 k = 13 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = 13 를 대입하면 $13x^2 - 26x - 3 = 0$ 이다. (3) 판별식 26² - 4·13·(-3) = 832 > 0 이므로 서로 다른 두 실근이 있다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(-26) / 13 이다. (5) 26 / 13 = 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Check that real solutions exist. (4) Use -b/a. (5) Divide. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.568Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"sum_then_leading_coefficient","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"ecb039b0-f937-582a-ab3d-4bee62d24cfa","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"1818285b-61b8-56e9-acd7-7c70b144db15","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse/leading_coefficient_inverse","group":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"In the equation given here, k is a positive integer, and the equation has two real solutions whose product is -10.\n\n$kx^2 + 15x - 50 = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the solutions of the equation?","options":["3","-3","5","-15"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 곱은 c/k = -50/k 이고 이것이 -10 이다. (2) -50/k = -10 이므로 k = 5 이다. (3) k = 5 를 대입한 방정식은 $5x^2 + 15x - 50 = 0$ 이다. (4) 근의 합은 -(15) / 5 이다. (5) -15 / 5 = -3 이다. 따라서 정답은 -3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of solutions is c over the leading coefficient. (2) Solve for k. (3) Write the equation with k known. (4) Use -b/a for the sum. (5) Divide. So the answer is -3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.568Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계(곱)","최고차 계수 역산","근과 계수의 관계(합)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"leading_coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-3,"correctOption":"-3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"1818285b-61b8-56e9-acd7-7c70b144db15","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"96aa87c5-fa96-5507-a374-53df1db495cd","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition/param_product_condition","group":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition","passage":"For the equation shown, k is a constant. The equation has two real solutions, and the product of the solutions is -10.\n\n$x^2 - (k - 4)x + (2k - 12) = 0$","question":"Find the larger of the two solutions.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["2"],"explanation":"(1) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 두 근의 곱은 상수항과 같다. (2) 2k - 12 = -10 로 놓고 풀면 k = 1 이다. (3) x 의 계수에 k 를 대입하면 1·1 + (-4) = -3 이다. (4) 방정식은 $x^2 + 3x - 10 = 0$ 이다. (5) 인수분해하면 x = -5 또는 x = 2 이므로 큰 근은 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of solutions is the constant term. (2) Solve for k. (3) Substitute k into the linear coefficient. (4) Write the equation with k known. (5) Factor and pick the larger solution. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.568Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["곱 조건 → k → 계수 대입 → 인수분해의 순서로 한 방정식을 두 번 쓴다 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"곱 조건 → k → 계수 대입 → 인수분해의 순서로 한 방정식을 두 번 쓴다 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계(곱)","매개변수 방정식","이차방정식 풀이"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"param_product_condition","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"96aa87c5-fa96-5507-a374-53df1db495cd","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"09f44782-dca8-5eb1-abd5-d8da80b41127","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind/two_positive_t","group":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"Consider the equation below. $x^4 - 20x^2 + 64 = 0$","question":"Find the product of every real solution of the equation.","options":["-64","8","-20","64"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² = t 로 치환하면 t 에 대한 이차방정식이 된다. (2) $t^2 - 20t + 64 = 0$ 을 인수분해해 t 의 근을 구한다. (3) t = 16 또는 t = 4 로 둘 다 양수이다. (4) 실근은 x = ±4, ±2 이다. (5) 모든 실근의 곱은 64 이다. 따라서 정답은 64이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute t = x². (2) Factor the quadratic in t. (3) Both roots in t are positive. (4) List the real solutions. (5) Multiply them, keeping the signs. So the answer is 64.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.568Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱","concepts":["치환(x²=t)","근과 계수의 관계","실근 선별(음수 제곱 제외)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"two_positive_t","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":64,"correctOption":"64"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"09f44782-dca8-5eb1-abd5-d8da80b41127","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"dd8ee436-94ee-5321-ab8c-7376d4ee0c44","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2/product_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k be the product of the solutions of the equation $x^2 - 3x - 18 = 0$. A second equation is given below, where k is that product:\n\n$x^2 + (k - 6)x - 6k = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the squares of the solutions of the second equation?","options":["576","36","360","324"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 곱은 상수항 -18 이므로 k = -18 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = -18 를 대입하면 $x^2 + (-24)x + 108 = 0$ 이다. (3) 인수분해하면 $(x - 6)(x + (-18)) = 0$ 이므로 근은 6 과 18 이다. (4) 두 근의 제곱의 합은 6² + 18² 이다. (5) 36 + 324 = 360 이다. 따라서 정답은 360이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Factor the second equation. (4) Square and add. (5) Compute. So the answer is 360.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.569Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱의 합"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"product_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":360,"correctOption":"360"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"dd8ee436-94ee-5321-ab8c-7376d4ee0c44","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f3570999-cfb2-5118-a560-e11856789fa0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition/count_two_real","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","passage":"For the equation shown, k is a positive integer.\n\n$x^2 + 12x + k = 0$","question":"For how many values of k does the equation have two distinct real solutions?","options":["35","34","12","36"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² 의 계수가 1 이므로 판별식은 D = b² - 4k 이다. (2) 서로 다른 두 실근이므로 D > 0, 즉 144 - 4k > 0 이다. (3) 이를 풀면 k < 36 이다(k = 36 는 D = 0 이라 제외). (4) 1 ≤ k ≤ 35 인 정수를 센다. (5) 개수는 35 이다. 따라서 정답은 35이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the discriminant. (2) Translate the root condition into an inequality. (3) Solve the inequality, watching the boundary. (4) Count the integers in the allowed range. (5) State the count. So the answer is 35.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.569Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정","concepts":["판별식 부등식","정수 개수 세기","경계값 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"count_two_real","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":35,"correctOption":"35"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f3570999-cfb2-5118-a560-e11856789fa0","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"aaaeab93-a003-5fc1-a676-a74bb40656c9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select/overlap_possible","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","passage":"Consider the equation below. $(x^2 - 9)(x^2 - 3x - 4) = 0$","question":"What is the number of distinct positive real solutions of the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["2"],"explanation":"(1) 곱이 0 이므로 두 인수 중 하나가 0 이다. (2) x² - 9 = 0 에서 x = ±3 이다. (3) $x^2 - 3x - 4 = 0$ 을 풀면 x = 4, -1 이다. (4) 모든 실근 중 양수만 모은다. (5) 겹치는 값을 한 번만 세어 서로 다른 양의 실근은 2 개이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A product is zero when a factor is zero. (2) Solve the first factor. (3) Solve the second factor. (4) Keep only the positive solutions. (5) Count distinct positive solutions once each. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.569Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["곱의 영 인수분해","양수 조건","중복 해 제거"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"overlap_possible","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"aaaeab93-a003-5fc1-a676-a74bb40656c9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0109063c-a57b-5fbc-a7ae-5588e92b4de4","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind/translation_intercepts","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","passage":"The graph of the function f is shown by the equation below:\n\n$f(x) = x^2 - 8x - 8$\n\nTo get the graph of g, the graph of f is moved 5 units to the right, and then 20 units up.","question":"How many times does the graph of g cross or touch the x-axis?","options":["3","1","2","0"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 꼭짓점의 y 좌표(최솟값)는 -8 - 64/4 = -24 이다. (2) 수평 이동은 x절편의 위치만 바꾸고 개수는 바꾸지 않는다. (3) 위로 20 이동하면 g 의 최솟값은 -24 + 20 = -4 이다. (4) 아래로 열린 포물선이 아니라 위로 열린 포물선(최고차 계수 1 > 0)이다. (5) 최솟값이 음수 이므로 x절편은 2 개이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the minimum value of f. (2) A horizontal shift moves the intercepts but does not change how many there are. (3) Apply the vertical shift to the minimum. (4) The parabola opens upward. (5) Decide the number of x-intercepts from the sign of the minimum. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.569Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정","concepts":["그래프 평행이동","꼭짓점(최솟값)","x절편과 실근 개수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"translation_intercepts","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"0109063c-a57b-5fbc-a7ae-5588e92b4de4","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a6c170bd-7028-5a12-a36c-a2d2713da0a1","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios/union_of_solution_sets","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","passage":"Two equations are given below:\n\nEquation 1: $x^2 - 7x + 10 = 0$\n\nEquation 2: $x^2 + 1 = 0$","question":"What is the total number of distinct real solutions of the two equations combined?","options":["1","3","0","2"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) Equation 1 을 풀면 x = 5, 2 이다. (2) Equation 2 의 판별식 0 - 4·1 = -4 의 부호를 확인한다. (3) Equation 2 의 실근: 없음(실근 없음). (4) 두 해 집합을 합하되 같은 값은 한 번만 센다. (5) 서로 다른 실수 해는 2 개이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Solve Equation 1. (2) Check the discriminant of Equation 2. (3) Solve Equation 2 over the reals. (4) Combine the two solution sets without double counting. (5) Count the distinct numbers. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.569Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["이차방정식 풀이","해 집합 비교","합집합의 원소 수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"union_of_solution_sets","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a6c170bd-7028-5a12-a36c-a2d2713da0a1","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"aa96eb8a-0e0d-5404-a044-54a2d5203d95","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse/conjugate_sum","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"Both solutions of the equation $x^2 + bx + c = 0$, where b and c are integers, are $-1 \\pm 2\\sqrt{10}$.","question":"Find b + c.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-37"],"explanation":"(1) 계수가 정수이므로 두 해는 켤레 p ± q√n 이다: -1 ± 2√10. (2) 두 해의 합은 2·(-1) = -2 이고 이것은 -b 이다. (3) b = 2 이다. (4) 두 해의 곱은 (-1)² - (2√10)² = 1 - 40 = -39 이고 이것이 c 이다. (5) b + c = 2 + (-39) = -37 이다. 따라서 정답은 -37이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The solutions are a conjugate pair. (2) The sum of the solutions is minus the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product of conjugates is p² - q²n. (5) Combine. So the answer is -37.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.569Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음","concepts":["켤레근","근과 계수의 관계","근호 제곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"conjugate_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-37,"correctOption":"-37"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"aa96eb8a-0e0d-5404-a044-54a2d5203d95","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"94d911b9-74c2-51ec-a32a-22cb82dc1bc3","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind/squared_difference","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"The equation below has two different real solutions, and neither solution is an integer.\n\n$x^2 + 7x + 9 = 0$","question":"If r and s are the solutions, what is the square of r minus s?","options":["67","31","13","49"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 판별식 49 - 4·9 = 13 > 0 이고 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 서로 다른 무리수이다. (2) 두 해의 합 r + s = -7, 곱 rs = 9 이다. (3) (r - s)² = (r + s)² - 4rs 를 이용한다. (4) 49 - 4·9 를 계산한다. (5) 결과는 13 이다. 따라서 정답은 13이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Check the discriminant: two irrational real solutions. (2) Vieta's formulas. (3) Use the symmetric identity. (4) Substitute the sum and product. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 13.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.570Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","대칭식 항등식","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"squared_difference","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":13,"correctOption":"13"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"94d911b9-74c2-51ec-a32a-22cb82dc1bc3","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8f8a47c4-7f63-5f5b-a612-23eb42d19e00","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the sum of the two solutions of $2x^2 - 10x + 6 = 0$. Then a second equation is written with that value of k:\n\n$x^2 - 5x - k = 0$","question":"What is the sum of the squares of the solutions of the second equation?","options":["25","35","15","5"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식의 판별식 100 - 4·2·6 = 52 는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 무리수이다. 해를 구하지 않고 합을 쓴다. (2) 두 해의 합은 -(-10)/2 = 5 이므로 k = 5 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식은 $x^2 - 5x - 5 = 0$ 이므로 합 5, 곱 -5 이다. (4) 제곱합은 (합)² - 2(곱) 이다. (5) 5² - 2·(-5) = 25 + 10 = 35 이다. 따라서 정답은 35이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The roots are irrational, so use the sum formula instead of solving. (2) Compute k. (3) Substitute k into the second equation. (4) Use the sum-of-squares identity. (5) Compute. So the answer is 35.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.570Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱합 항등식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"sum_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":35,"correctOption":"35"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"8f8a47c4-7f63-5f5b-a612-23eb42d19e00","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"9ad26f56-a0c1-5dc1-a134-08c869606bfc","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse/formula_inverse","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"In the equation below, p and q are integers. The solutions of the equation are $\\frac{5 \\pm \\sqrt{157}}{6}$.\n\n$3x^2 + px + q = 0$","question":"What is the value of q?","options":["-132","-11","11","-22"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 공식 x = (-p ± √(p² - 4·3·q)) / 6 와 주어진 해를 비교한다. (2) 분모 6 = 2·3 로 a = 3 와 일치한다. (3) 분자의 -p = 5 이므로 p = -5 이다. (4) 근호 안: p² - 4·3·q = 157, 즉 25 - 12q = 157 이다. (5) 이를 풀면 q = -11 이다. 따라서 정답은 -11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Compare with the quadratic formula. (2) The denominator matches 2a. (3) Read the linear coefficient. (4) Set the discriminant equal to the radicand. (5) Solve for the constant. So the answer is -11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.570Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 공식 결과에서 b = -u, 판별식 b²-4ac = D 로 c 를 거꾸로 푸는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 곱 c/a 를 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 공식 결과에서 b = -u, 판별식 b²-4ac = D 로 c 를 거꾸로 푸는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 곱 c/a 를 읽음","concepts":["근의 공식","판별식 역산","계수 비교"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"formula_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-11,"correctOption":"-11"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"9ad26f56-a0c1-5dc1-a134-08c869606bfc","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"db424728-e0e8-537f-a3ae-225a549a5e40","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2/product_then_factor","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the product of the two solutions of $3x^2 + 4x - 6 = 0$. Then a second equation is written with that value of k:\n\n$x^2 + (k + 6)x + 6k = 0$","question":"Find the larger solution of the second equation.","options":["6","-6","2","-2"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식의 판별식 16 - -72 = 88 는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 무리수이다. 곱의 공식을 쓴다. (2) 두 해의 곱은 -6/3 = -2 이므로 k = -2 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식에 k = -2 를 대입하면 $x^2 + 4x + (-12) = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 $(x + (-2))(x + 6) = 0$ 이다. (5) 근은 2 와 -6 이고 큰 근은 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The roots are irrational; use the product formula. (2) Compute k. (3) Substitute k. (4) Factor. (5) Pick the larger solution. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.570Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["무리수 근을 풀지 않고 곱을 읽은 뒤 그 값이 인수분해 가능한 둘째 방정식의 계수가 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"무리수 근을 풀지 않고 곱을 읽은 뒤 그 값이 인수분해 가능한 둘째 방정식의 계수가 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","이차방정식 인수분해"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"product_then_factor","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"db424728-e0e8-537f-a3ae-225a549a5e40","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f270205c-e39b-5898-af04-4e3507cf07f9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift/revenue_equation_product","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","passage":"A museum shop sells posters at a price of p dollars per poster. At that price, it sells 45 - 3p posters per day, and the revenue is 39 dollars per day. Setting the revenue expression equal to the given revenue gives a quadratic equation in p.","question":"What is the product of the two solutions of this quadratic equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["13"],"explanation":"(1) 가격이 p 이고 판매량이 45 - 3p 이므로 매출 = 가격 × 판매량 = p(45 - 3p) 이다. (2) 매출이 39 이므로 $p(45 - 3p) = 39$ 이다. (3) 전개해 표준형으로 정리하면 $3p^2 - 45p + 39 = 0$ 이다. (4) 판별식 2025 - 468 = 1557 > 0 이고 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 서로 다른 무리수이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 39/3 = 13 이다. 따라서 정답은 13이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Revenue is price times quantity. (2) Set revenue equal to the given amount. (3) Expand and move all terms to one side. (4) The solutions are irrational real numbers. (5) Use c/a. So the answer is 13.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.571Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(가격·판매량·매출)을 식으로 모델링한 뒤 표준형의 상수항과 최고차 계수의 비를 읽음 — medium 은 식으로 주어진 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"문장(가격·판매량·매출)을 식으로 모델링한 뒤 표준형의 상수항과 최고차 계수의 비를 읽음 — medium 은 식으로 주어진 방정식의 곱","concepts":["문장 모델링(매출=가격×판매량)","표준형 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"revenue_equation_product","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":12.999999999999995,"correctOption":"13"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f270205c-e39b-5898-af04-4e3507cf07f9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"310c1e6d-1a23-5172-a4c3-43078ccb9689","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse/conjugate_other_root","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse","passage":"In the equation given here, b and c are integers, and one solution of the equation is $-6 + 3\\sqrt{11}$.\n\n$x^2 + bx + c = 0$","question":"Which of the following is the other solution of the equation?","options":["$-6 - 3\\sqrt{11}$","$6 - 3\\sqrt{11}$","$6 + 3\\sqrt{11}$","$-6 + 3\\sqrt{11}$"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) b, c 가 정수이므로 무리수 해는 켤레와 함께 나온다. (2) 한 해가 $-6 + 3\\sqrt{11}$ 이므로 다른 해는 켤레 $-6 - 3\\sqrt{11}$ 이다. (3) 두 해의 합은 2·(-6) = -12 이고 이것이 -b 와 같아야 한다 (b = 12). (4) 두 해의 곱은 (-6)² - (3√11)² = -63 으로 정수이다. (5) 다른 해는 $-6 - 3\\sqrt{11}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $-6 - 3\\sqrt{11}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) With integer coefficients irrational solutions come in conjugate pairs. (2) The other solution is the conjugate. (3) Check with the sum of solutions. (4) Check the product is an integer. (5) State the other solution. So the answer is $-6 - 3\\sqrt{11}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.571Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["한 해에서 다른 해를 역으로 추론(켤레근 정리, 합 2p 로 확인)하고 근호꼴을 정리 — medium 은 방정식을 직접 풀어 근호꼴로 적음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"한 해에서 다른 해를 역으로 추론(켤레근 정리, 합 2p 로 확인)하고 근호꼴을 정리 — medium 은 방정식을 직접 풀어 근호꼴로 적음","concepts":["켤레근 정리","근과 계수의 관계","근호 표기"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"conjugate_other_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-15.9498743710662,"correctOption":"$-6 - 3\\sqrt{11}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"310c1e6d-1a23-5172-a4c3-43078ccb9689","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4f12bee1-6873-5dae-ac2b-da93151636c9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2/square_of_root","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the greater of the two solutions of $x^2 - 10x + 15 = 0$.","question":"Which of the following is equal to the square of k?","options":["$35 + 10\\sqrt{10}$","$35$","$35 - 10\\sqrt{10}$","$25 + 10\\sqrt{10}$"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 공식으로 큰 해를 구한다. (2) $k = 5 + \\sqrt{10}$ 로 근호를 정리한다 (판별식 40 = 40). (3) 제곱한다: $k^2 = (5)^2 + 2(5)(1\\sqrt{10}) + (1\\sqrt{10})^2$ . (4) $(1\\sqrt{10})^2 = 10$ 이므로 상수항은 25 + 10 = 35 이다. (5) $k^2 = 35 + 10\\sqrt{10}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $35 + 10\\sqrt{10}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the quadratic formula. (2) Simplify the radical. (3) Square the binomial. (4) Evaluate the radical square. (5) Combine like terms. So the answer is $35 + 10\\sqrt{10}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.572Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 공식 → 근호 정리 → 이항 제곱 전개 → 동류항 정리의 4단 연쇄 — medium 은 근호꼴 해를 구하는 한 단계"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"근의 공식 → 근호 정리 → 이항 제곱 전개 → 동류항 정리의 4단 연쇄 — medium 은 근호꼴 해를 구하는 한 단계","concepts":["근의 공식·근호 정리","이항식 제곱","근호 동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"square_of_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":66.62277660168381,"correctOption":"$35 + 10\\sqrt{10}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4f12bee1-6873-5dae-ac2b-da93151636c9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"76471a25-4d01-5e66-aa3a-7bbe5b4de56a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.constraint_select/radical_equation","group":"nes.root.constraint_select","passage":"Look at the equation below. $\\sqrt{x + 27} = x - 3$","question":"What is the value of x that makes the equation true?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["9"],"explanation":"(1) 양변을 제곱해 근호를 없앤다. (2) $x + 27 = (x - 3)^2$ 를 전개해 표준형으로 정리한다. (3) $x^2 - 7x - 18 = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 x = -2 또는 x = 9 이다. (5) 원식의 우변 $x - 3$ 은 근호 값이므로 0 이상이어야 한다. x = -2 일 때 -5 < 0 이라 제외한다. (6) x = 9 를 원식에 대입해 성립함을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Square both sides to remove the radical. (2) Expand and move everything to one side. (3) Write the quadratic. (4) Factor to get two candidates. (5) The right side must be nonnegative, which rules out one candidate. (6) Verify the remaining candidate. So the answer is 9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.572Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"root","extraThinking":"제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답","concepts":["무리방정식 제곱","이차방정식 인수분해","외래근 검증"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"radical_equation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":9,"correctOption":"9"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"76471a25-4d01-5e66-aa3a-7bbe5b4de56a","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ff2af9f0-9af8-5193-af01-db725a697e8e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind/two_numbers_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind","passage":"The difference between two positive numbers is 2, and the sum of their squares is 236.","question":"What is the value of the larger number?","options":["$2 + 3\\sqrt{13}$","$1 + 9\\sqrt{13}$","$-1 + 3\\sqrt{13}$","$1 + 3\\sqrt{13}$"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 작은 수를 x 라 하면 큰 수는 x + 2 이다. (2) 제곱의 합: $x^2 + (x + 2)^2 = 236$ 이다. (3) 전개·정리하면 $x^2 + 2x + -116 = 0$ 이다. (4) 근의 공식으로 x = -1 ± 3√13 이고, 양수이므로 x = $-1 + 3\\sqrt{13}$ 이다. (5) 큰 수는 x + 2 = $1 + 3\\sqrt{13}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $1 + 3\\sqrt{13}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let the smaller number be x. (2) Write the sum of squares. (3) Expand and simplify. (4) Choose the positive solution. (5) Add the difference. So the answer is $1 + 3\\sqrt{13}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.573Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(수의 관계)을 이차방정식으로 모델링해 근의 공식과 근호 정리, 양수 조건 선택, 큰 수 계산까지 연결 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근호꼴 해"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"문장(수의 관계)을 이차방정식으로 모델링해 근의 공식과 근호 정리, 양수 조건 선택, 큰 수 계산까지 연결 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근호꼴 해","concepts":["문장 모델링","근의 공식·근호 정리","양수 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"two_numbers_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":11.816653826391967,"correctOption":"$1 + 3\\sqrt{13}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"ff2af9f0-9af8-5193-af01-db725a697e8e","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"bd63be4c-f537-55cd-ad9f-69f5d07494a9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition/tangent_x","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","passage":"In the xy-plane, the graph of the parabola and the line below intersect at exactly one point. The constant k is a real number.\n\n$y = x^2 + 6x - 5$\n$y = -8x + k$","question":"What is the x-coordinate of the point where the graphs meet?","options":["14","-14","-7","7"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 교점에서 두 식의 y 가 같으므로 이차식과 직선식을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 6x - 5 = -8x + k$ 를 정리하면 $x^2 + 14x - 5 - k = 0$ 이다. (3) 한 점에서 만나므로 이 방정식이 중근을 가져야 한다: 판별식 D = 0. (4) (14)² - 4(-5 - k) = 0 에서 k = -5 - 196/4 = -54 이다. (5) 중근은 x = -(14)/2 = -7 이다. 따라서 정답은 -7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the two expressions for y equal. (2) Rearrange into standard form. (3) One intersection point means a double root. (4) Solve D = 0 for k. (5) The double root is the x-coordinate of the touching point. So the answer is -7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.574Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["'한 점에서 만난다'를 두 식을 같게 놓은 이차방정식의 판별식 0 으로 번역해 직선의 상수를 정함 — medium 은 교점 개수 또는 좌표를 직접 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"'한 점에서 만난다'를 두 식을 같게 놓은 이차방정식의 판별식 0 으로 번역해 직선의 상수를 정함 — medium 은 교점 개수 또는 좌표를 직접 구함","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","판별식 조건","접점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"tangent_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-7,"correctOption":"-7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"bd63be4c-f537-55cd-ad9f-69f5d07494a9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3d08bb21-07ac-59a7-a268-e4690e75f6bc","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind/points_to_line_sum_x","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","passage":"In the xy-plane, a line contains the points (-3, -7) and (0, 2). The line crosses the parabola $y = x^2 + 3x - 23$ at two points.","question":"What is the sum of the x-coordinates of the two points of intersection?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["0"],"explanation":"(1) 기울기 = (2 - (-7)) / (0 - (-3)) = 3 이다. (2) 직선의 식은 y = 3x + 2 이다. (3) 교점에서는 y 가 같으므로 $x^2 + 3x - 23 = 3x + 2$ 이다. (4) 정리하면 $x^2 - 25 = 0$ 이고 두 근의 합은 0 = 0 이다 (x 좌표의 합). (5) 판별식이 양수여서 서로 다른 두 교점이 있음을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Compute the slope of the line. (2) Find the intercept and write the line. (3) Set the two expressions equal. (4) The sum of solutions gives the sum of x-coordinates. (5) Check the discriminant is positive. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.574Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 점에서 직선의 식(기울기·절편)을 구하는 개념과 교점 개념을 연결 — medium 은 식이 주어진 직선과 포물선의 교점"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"두 점에서 직선의 식(기울기·절편)을 구하는 개념과 교점 개념을 연결 — medium 은 식이 주어진 직선과 포물선의 교점","concepts":["두 점을 지나는 직선","이차함수와 직선의 교점","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"points_to_line_sum_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3d08bb21-07ac-59a7-a268-e4690e75f6bc","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5930c773-c6ac-5825-ab2c-ca503897cbe1","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select/first_quadrant_point","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","passage":"A parabola and a line are given by the equations below, and they cross at two points in the xy-plane.\n\n$y = x^2 + 5x - 1$\n$y = 2x + 9$","question":"What is the y-coordinate of the intersection point in quadrant I?","options":["-5","2","13","-1"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 교점에서 y 가 같으므로 두 식을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 3x - 10 = 0$ 을 만든다. (3) 인수분해하면 x = 2 또는 x = -5 이다. (4) 직선에 대입해 두 교점 (2, 13), (-5, -1) 를 구한다. (5) 제1사분면은 x > 0 이고 y > 0 이므로 (2, 13) 만 해당한다. (6) y 좌표는 13 이다. 따라서 정답은 13이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the expressions for y equal. (2) Rearrange to standard form. (3) Factor to find the x-coordinates. (4) Find both intersection points. (5) Keep the point with both coordinates positive. (6) Read the y-coordinate. So the answer is 13.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.574Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 교점을 모두 구한 뒤 사분면 조건(양쪽 좌표 부호)으로 후보를 제거 — medium 은 교점의 x좌표를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"두 교점을 모두 구한 뒤 사분면 조건(양쪽 좌표 부호)으로 후보를 제거 — medium 은 교점의 x좌표를 구함","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","방정식 풀이","사분면 조건 선택"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"first_quadrant_point","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":13,"correctOption":"13"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5930c773-c6ac-5825-ab2c-ca503897cbe1","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"95ea298a-62cd-5e20-a143-caafc88115d5","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition/sum_of_k","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","passage":"In the equation given here, k is an integer constant. The equation has exactly one real solution.\n\n$x^2 + kx + (2k + 21) = 0$","question":"If all possible values of k are added, what is the sum?","options":["4","-8","8","-84"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = k² - 4(2k + 21) = 0 이므로 $k^2 - 8k - 84 = 0$ 이다. (3) 이 k 에 대한 이차방정식의 판별식 64 + 336 = 400 = 400 는 양수이므로 k 는 두 개이다. (4) 근과 계수의 관계 또는 인수분해로 k = -6, 14 이다. (5) 합: 14 + (-6) = 8 이다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One real solution means D = 0. (2) Write the condition as an equation in k. (3) The condition in k has two solutions. (4) Solve for k. (5) Combine as requested. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.574Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건이 매개변수에 대한 또 하나의 이차방정식(k²-4uk-4m=0)이 되는 이중 구조 — medium 은 계수 하나가 미지수인 판별식 부등식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건이 매개변수에 대한 또 하나의 이차방정식(k²-4uk-4m=0)이 되는 이중 구조 — medium 은 계수 하나가 미지수인 판별식 부등식","concepts":["판별식 조건","매개변수 이차방정식","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"sum_of_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"95ea298a-62cd-5e20-a143-caafc88115d5","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f56cf8dd-5043-532c-a4db-482ba3b04a7e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse/tangent_to_axis","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","passage":"The parabola below has its vertex on the x-axis at the point (-11, 0). Here, p and q are constants.\n\n$y = x^2 + px + q$","question":"What is the value of q - p?","options":["99","143","121","-143"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이고 x = -11 이므로 중근이다. (2) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 식은 $(x - (-11))^2$ 와 같다. (3) 전개하면 $x^2 - (-22)x + 121$ 이다. (4) 계수를 읽으면 p = 22, q = 121 이다. (5) q - p = 121 - 22 = 99 이다. 따라서 정답은 99이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A single solution is a double root. (2) The quadratic must be a perfect square. (3) Expand the square. (4) Read the coefficients. (5) Combine. So the answer is 99.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.575Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["중근 조건에서 이차식 자체를 (x-r)² 으로 재구성해 계수를 읽는 역방향 사고 — medium 은 판별식으로 매개변수를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"중근 조건에서 이차식 자체를 (x-r)² 으로 재구성해 계수를 읽는 역방향 사고 — medium 은 판별식으로 매개변수를 구함","concepts":["중근과 완전제곱식","전개·계수 비교","접선(꼭짓점이 x축 위)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"tangent_to_axis","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":99,"correctOption":"99"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f56cf8dd-5043-532c-a4db-482ba3b04a7e","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4f893b99-e45c-5314-ac98-cee74b6d18c5","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select/count_k_two_real","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","passage":"For the equation shown, k is a nonzero integer with -7 ≤ k ≤ 7.\n\n$kx^2 + 9x + 1 = 0$","question":"For how many values of k does the equation have two distinct real solutions?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["14"],"explanation":"(1) k ≠ 0 이므로 이차방정식이고 판별식은 D = b² - 4kc 이다. (2) 서로 다른 두 실근이므로 D > 0, 즉 81 - 4k > 0 이다. (3) 음수 k 는 항상 D > 0 을 만족하므로 -7 ≤ k ≤ -1 의 7개가 모두 성립한다. (4) 양수 k 는 k < 81/4 이어야 하고 경계는 제외하므로 1 ≤ k ≤ 20 중 7 이하인 7개이다. (5) 전체 개수는 7 + 7 = 14 이다. 따라서 정답은 14이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The equation is quadratic since k is nonzero. (2) Two distinct real solutions need D > 0. (3) Every negative k works. (4) Positive k must satisfy a strict upper bound. (5) Add the counts. So the answer is 14.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.575Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["최고차 계수가 매개변수라 k=0 제외, 음수 k 는 항상 성립, 양수 k 는 경계(D=0) 제외로 나눠 세는 제약 추적 — medium 은 부호 조건을 만족하는 k 하나를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"최고차 계수가 매개변수라 k=0 제외, 음수 k 는 항상 성립, 양수 k 는 경계(D=0) 제외로 나눠 세는 제약 추적 — medium 은 부호 조건을 만족하는 k 하나를 구함","concepts":["판별식 부등식","정수 범위 세기","k≠0 조건"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"count_k_two_real","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":14,"correctOption":"14"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4f893b99-e45c-5314-ac98-cee74b6d18c5","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e11646a5-dc8b-5302-a614-7d37f09b8c2c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.param_condition/ask_constant","group":"nes.root.param_condition","passage":"In the given equation, p is a positive constant and the equation has exactly one real solution.\n\n$x^2 + px + 100 = 0$","question":"What must p equal?","options":["20","10","100","-20"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 방정식은 중근을 갖고, 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = p² - 4·100 = 0 이므로 p² = 400 이다. (3) p 는 양수이므로 p = 20 이다. (4) 방정식은 $(x + 10)^2 = 0$ 꼴이다. (5) 따라서 해는 x = -10 이다. 묻는 값은 p = 20 이다. 따라서 정답은 20이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means a double root, so D = 0. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive constant. (4) The equation becomes a perfect square. (5) Read off the solution. So the answer is 20.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.575Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"root","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이","concepts":["판별식 조건","완전제곱 중근","부호 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"ask_constant","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":20,"correctOption":"20"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"e11646a5-dc8b-5302-a614-7d37f09b8c2c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"14817e04-7e00-5b38-abd7-f22b1c052df3","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.constraint_select/radical_equation","group":"nes.root.constraint_select","passage":"Look at the equation below. $\\sqrt{x + 1} = x - 5$","question":"Find the real solution of the equation.","options":["24","3","11","8"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 양변을 제곱해 근호를 없앤다. (2) $x + 1 = (x - 5)^2$ 를 전개해 표준형으로 정리한다. (3) $x^2 - 11x + 24 = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 x = 3 또는 x = 8 이다. (5) 원식의 우변 $x - 5$ 은 근호 값이므로 0 이상이어야 한다. x = 3 일 때 -2 < 0 이라 제외한다. (6) x = 8 를 원식에 대입해 성립함을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Square both sides to remove the radical. (2) Expand and move everything to one side. (3) Write the quadratic. (4) Factor to get two candidates. (5) The right side must be nonnegative, which rules out one candidate. (6) Verify the remaining candidate. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.575Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"root","extraThinking":"제곱으로 생긴 외래근을 원식에 대입해 걸러내야 한다(제약 추적·후보 제거) — medium 은 인수분해로 나온 근을 그대로 답","concepts":["무리방정식 제곱","이차방정식 인수분해","외래근 검증"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"radical_equation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"14817e04-7e00-5b38-abd7-f22b1c052df3","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0dc4ef34-84ca-53df-a462-5e1fa93e84cb","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.inverse/diff_coeffs","group":"nes.root.inverse","passage":"In the given equation, p and q are constants. One solution of the equation is -1, and the other solution is 3 more than that solution.\n\n$x^2 + px + q = 0$","question":"Find q - p.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-1"],"explanation":"(1) 한 근이 -1 이고 다른 근은 3 more than 이므로 다른 근은 2 이다. (2) 근의 합은 -1 + 2 = 1 이고 이것은 -p 와 같다. (3) 따라서 p = -1 이다. (4) 근의 곱은 -1·2 = -2 이고 이것은 q 와 같다. (5) q - p = -2 - (-1) = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the other solution. (2) The sum of the solutions equals the negative of the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product equals the constant term. (5) Compute the requested combination. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.575Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"root","extraThinking":"근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","근의 차 조건","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"diff_coeffs","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"0dc4ef34-84ca-53df-a462-5e1fa93e84cb","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a8b4b319-31c0-5f7f-a96b-c47190c27116","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse/rearranged_form","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"The equation below has two real solutions, where b and c are constants. The sum of the solutions is -2, and the product of the solutions is -24.\n\n$3x^2 = bx + c$","question":"What is the value of b + c?","options":["-78","-6","66","72"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 3x² = bx + c 를 표준형으로 이항하면 $3x^2 - bx - c = 0$ 이다. (2) 두 근의 합 = b/3 = -2 이므로 b = -6 이다. (3) 두 근의 곱 = -c/3 = -24 이므로 c = 72 이다. (4) 부호에 주의해 b 와 c 를 확인한다(c 는 이항 때문에 곱의 -3 배). (5) b + c = -6 + 72 = 66 이다. 따라서 정답은 66이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Move every term to one side. (2) Use the sum of solutions. (3) Use the product of solutions. (4) Check the signs created by moving terms. (5) Add. So the answer is 66.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.575Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음","concepts":["표준형 정리(이항)","근과 계수의 관계","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"rearranged_form","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":66,"correctOption":"66"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a8b4b319-31c0-5f7f-a96b-c47190c27116","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"eef0f9ab-5c0b-5e41-adb8-e025467a96bb","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition/param_sum_condition","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","passage":"For the equation shown, k is a constant. The equation has two real solutions, and the sum of the solutions is 4.\n\n$x^2 + (-3k - 16)x + (2k - 4) = 0$","question":"What is the value of the product of the solutions?","options":["-12","-4","4","12"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 두 근의 합은 x 의 계수의 부호를 바꾼 값이다. (2) -(-3k - 16) = 4 로 놓는다. (3) 이 일차방정식을 풀면 k = -4 이다. (4) 상수항에 k = -4 를 대입하면 2·(-4) + (-4) = -12 이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 상수항과 같으므로 -12 이다. 따라서 정답은 -12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (2) Set the sum equal to the given value. (3) Solve for k. (4) Substitute k into the constant term. (5) The product equals the constant term. So the answer is -12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.575Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","매개변수 일차방정식","대입 후 곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"param_sum_condition","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-12,"correctOption":"-12"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"eef0f9ab-5c0b-5e41-adb8-e025467a96bb","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"aa9cd43d-8885-5e12-acc6-ba0091a88511","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse/leading_coefficient_inverse","group":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"In the equation given here, k is a positive integer, and the equation has two real solutions whose product is 30.\n\n$kx^2 - 22x + 60 = 0$","question":"Find the sum of the two solutions.","options":["2","-11","22","11"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 곱은 c/k = 60/k 이고 이것이 30 이다. (2) 60/k = 30 이므로 k = 2 이다. (3) k = 2 를 대입한 방정식은 $2x^2 - 22x + 60 = 0$ 이다. (4) 근의 합은 -(-22) / 2 이다. (5) 22 / 2 = 11 이다. 따라서 정답은 11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of solutions is c over the leading coefficient. (2) Solve for k. (3) Write the equation with k known. (4) Use -b/a for the sum. (5) Divide. So the answer is 11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.576Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계(곱)","최고차 계수 역산","근과 계수의 관계(합)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"leading_coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":11,"correctOption":"11"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"aa9cd43d-8885-5e12-acc6-ba0091a88511","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"40762049-6c34-5288-ad17-e5a85924a718","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind/one_negative_t","group":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"Consider the equation below. $x^4 + 6x^2 - 7 = 0$","question":"What is the product of all real solutions of the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-1"],"explanation":"(1) x² = t 로 치환하면 t 에 대한 이차방정식이 된다. (2) $t^2 + 6t - 7 = 0$ 을 인수분해해 t 의 근을 구한다. (3) t = 1 또는 t = -7 이다. x² = t 가 실수이려면 t ≥ 0 이어야 하므로 t = 1 만 쓴다. (4) 실근은 x = ±1 이다. (5) 모든 실근의 곱은 -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute t = x². (2) Factor the quadratic in t. (3) A negative t cannot equal x², so keep only the positive root. (4) List the real solutions. (5) Multiply them, keeping the signs. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.576Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱","concepts":["치환(x²=t)","근과 계수의 관계","실근 선별(음수 제곱 제외)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"one_negative_t","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"40762049-6c34-5288-ad17-e5a85924a718","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"c3817f2e-991e-50fe-a251-281968203ffe","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2/product_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the product of the two solutions of $x^2 + 2x - 15 = 0$. Consider the second equation below, which uses k:\n\n$x^2 + (k - 4)x - 4k = 0$","question":"What is the value of the sum of the squares of the solutions of the second equation?","options":["225","361","16","241"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 곱은 상수항 -15 이므로 k = -15 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = -15 를 대입하면 $x^2 + (-19)x + 60 = 0$ 이다. (3) 인수분해하면 $(x - 4)(x + (-15)) = 0$ 이므로 근은 4 과 15 이다. (4) 두 근의 제곱의 합은 4² + 15² 이다. (5) 16 + 225 = 241 이다. 따라서 정답은 241이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Factor the second equation. (4) Square and add. (5) Compute. So the answer is 241.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.576Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 곱이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되고, 근을 구하거나 (합)²-2(곱) 로 제곱합을 계산하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱의 합"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"product_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":241,"correctOption":"241"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"c3817f2e-991e-50fe-a251-281968203ffe","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"efa5c9ce-7588-5136-a522-2e1b50a4287d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition/count_two_real","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","passage":"In the equation below, k is a positive integer.\n\n$x^2 - 14x + k = 0$","question":"For how many positive integers k are there two distinct real solutions?","options":["47","48","14","49"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² 의 계수가 1 이므로 판별식은 D = b² - 4k 이다. (2) 서로 다른 두 실근이므로 D > 0, 즉 196 - 4k > 0 이다. (3) 이를 풀면 k < 49 이다(k = 49 는 D = 0 이라 제외). (4) 1 ≤ k ≤ 48 인 정수를 센다. (5) 개수는 48 이다. 따라서 정답은 48이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the discriminant. (2) Translate the root condition into an inequality. (3) Solve the inequality, watching the boundary. (4) Count the integers in the allowed range. (5) State the count. So the answer is 48.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.576Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"판별식 부등식 D>0 (경계 D=0 제외)을 세워 범위 안의 정수 개수를 센다 — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 실근 개수(0·1·2)만 판정","concepts":["판별식 부등식","정수 개수 세기","경계값 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"count_two_real","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":48,"correctOption":"48"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"efa5c9ce-7588-5136-a522-2e1b50a4287d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"46e34f46-686a-547d-aa63-e89c56f0912f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select/overlap_possible","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","passage":"Consider the equation below. $(x^2 - 1)(x^2 - 2x - 8) = 0$","question":"How many distinct positive real solutions does the equation have?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["2"],"explanation":"(1) 곱이 0 이므로 두 인수 중 하나가 0 이다. (2) x² - 1 = 0 에서 x = ±1 이다. (3) $x^2 - 2x - 8 = 0$ 을 풀면 x = 4, -2 이다. (4) 모든 실근 중 양수만 모은다. (5) 겹치는 값을 한 번만 세어 서로 다른 양의 실근은 2 개이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A product is zero when a factor is zero. (2) Solve the first factor. (3) Solve the second factor. (4) Keep only the positive solutions. (5) Count distinct positive solutions once each. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.576Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"양의 실근만 선별하고 두 인수의 근이 겹치는 경우를 제거(제약·중복 추적) — medium 은 한 이차방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["곱의 영 인수분해","양수 조건","중복 해 제거"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"overlap_possible","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"46e34f46-686a-547d-aa63-e89c56f0912f","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"6c5fbae2-bf35-50eb-a141-f6c02d2bfa94","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind/translation_intercepts","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","passage":"The graph of the function f is shown by the equation below:\n\n$f(x) = x^2 + 4x + 8$\n\nThe graph of g is obtained by shifting the graph of f 6 units to the left and then 1 unit down.","question":"What is the number of x-intercepts of the graph of g?","options":["1","2","3","0"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 꼭짓점의 y 좌표(최솟값)는 8 - 16/4 = 4 이다. (2) 수평 이동은 x절편의 위치만 바꾸고 개수는 바꾸지 않는다. (3) 아래로 1 이동하면 g 의 최솟값은 4 - 1 = 3 이다. (4) 아래로 열린 포물선이 아니라 위로 열린 포물선(최고차 계수 1 > 0)이다. (5) 최솟값이 양수 이므로 x절편은 0 개이다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the minimum value of f. (2) A horizontal shift moves the intercepts but does not change how many there are. (3) Apply the vertical shift to the minimum. (4) The parabola opens upward. (5) Decide the number of x-intercepts from the sign of the minimum. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.576Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"도형 이동(그래프 변환)과 실근 개수 개념을 연결하고 수평 이동은 개수에 영향을 주지 않음을 구분 — medium 은 방정식의 판별식 부호 판정","concepts":["그래프 평행이동","꼭짓점(최솟값)","x절편과 실근 개수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"translation_intercepts","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"6c5fbae2-bf35-50eb-a141-f6c02d2bfa94","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"43fe053b-1956-5371-adfb-202f2fceaf66","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios/union_of_solution_sets","group":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","passage":"Equation 1 and Equation 2 are listed below:\n\nEquation 1: $x^2 - 5x - 6 = 0$\n\nEquation 2: $x^2 - 3x - 4 = 0$","question":"How many distinct real numbers satisfy Equation 1, Equation 2, or both?","options":["2","3","4","0"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) Equation 1 을 풀면 x = -1, 6 이다. (2) Equation 2 의 판별식 9 - 4·(-4) = 25 의 부호를 확인한다. (3) Equation 2 의 실근: -1 와 4. (4) 두 해 집합을 합하되 같은 값은 한 번만 센다. (5) 서로 다른 실수 해는 3 개이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Solve Equation 1. (2) Check the discriminant of Equation 2. (3) Solve Equation 2 over the reals. (4) Combine the two solution sets without double counting. (5) Count the distinct numbers. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.576Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"num_real_solutions","extraThinking":"두 경우의 해 집합을 모두 구해 비교하고 겹치는 해를 한 번만 세어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 실근 개수","concepts":["이차방정식 풀이","해 집합 비교","합집합의 원소 수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"union_of_solution_sets","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"43fe053b-1956-5371-adfb-202f2fceaf66","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.num_real_solutions.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b8d0996d-da0c-57af-a8fd-b91ee571e93c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse/conjugate_sum","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"Both solutions of the equation $x^2 + bx + c = 0$, where b and c are integers, are $1 \\pm \\sqrt{11}$.","question":"What is the sum of b and c?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-12"],"explanation":"(1) 계수가 정수이므로 두 해는 켤레 p ± q√n 이다: 1 ± 1√11. (2) 두 해의 합은 2·(1) = 2 이고 이것은 -b 이다. (3) b = -2 이다. (4) 두 해의 곱은 (1)² - (1√11)² = 1 - 11 = -10 이고 이것이 c 이다. (5) b + c = -2 + (-10) = -12 이다. 따라서 정답은 -12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The solutions are a conjugate pair. (2) The sum of the solutions is minus the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product of conjugates is p² - q²n. (5) Combine. So the answer is -12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.577Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"해에서 계수로 역방향 재구성(켤레근의 합 2p, 곱 p²-q²n 의 부호 처리) — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 합 -b/a 를 읽음","concepts":["켤레근","근과 계수의 관계","근호 제곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"conjugate_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-12,"correctOption":"-12"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b8d0996d-da0c-57af-a8fd-b91ee571e93c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"1fc154a9-cd7e-59c0-a076-aaee76c416b9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind/squared_difference","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"The equation below has two different real solutions, and neither solution is an integer.\n\n$x^2 + 5x + 5 = 0$","question":"If r and s are the solutions, what is the square of r minus s?","options":["35","25","5","15"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 판별식 25 - 4·5 = 5 > 0 이고 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 서로 다른 무리수이다. (2) 두 해의 합 r + s = -5, 곱 rs = 5 이다. (3) (r - s)² = (r + s)² - 4rs 를 이용한다. (4) 25 - 4·5 를 계산한다. (5) 결과는 5 이다. 따라서 정답은 5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Check the discriminant: two irrational real solutions. (2) Vieta's formulas. (3) Use the symmetric identity. (4) Substitute the sum and product. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.577Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근과 계수의 관계에 대칭식 항등식((r+s)²-2rs, (r-s)²=(r+s)²-4rs)을 결합 — medium 은 근의 합만 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","대칭식 항등식","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"squared_difference","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5,"correctOption":"5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"1fc154a9-cd7e-59c0-a076-aaee76c416b9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"95b17836-846e-5bb7-aa47-46f9b31ecafd","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_sum_of_squares","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Suppose k equals the sum of the solutions of $x^2 - 3x - 2 = 0$. Consider the second equation below, which uses k:\n\n$x^2 - 4x - k = 0$","question":"Find the sum of the squares of the two solutions of the second equation.","options":["16","22","3","10"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식의 판별식 9 - 4·1·(-2) = 17 는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 무리수이다. 해를 구하지 않고 합을 쓴다. (2) 두 해의 합은 -(-3)/1 = 3 이므로 k = 3 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식은 $x^2 - 4x - 3 = 0$ 이므로 합 4, 곱 -3 이다. (4) 제곱합은 (합)² - 2(곱) 이다. (5) 4² - 2·(-3) = 16 + 6 = 22 이다. 따라서 정답은 22이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The roots are irrational, so use the sum formula instead of solving. (2) Compute k. (3) Substitute k into the second equation. (4) Use the sum-of-squares identity. (5) Compute. So the answer is 22.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.577Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근을 구하지 않고 앞 단계의 합이 뒤 방정식의 상수항이 되는 2단계 연쇄, 제곱합 항등식 재사용 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","제곱합 항등식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"sum_then_sum_of_squares","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":22,"correctOption":"22"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"95b17836-846e-5bb7-aa47-46f9b31ecafd","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"6ffe9a7e-7226-5cb8-a0e7-c5f14425d0f8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift/area_equation_sum","group":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","passage":"A rectangular garden has a width of w meters. Its length is 4 more than 3 times the width, and its area is 33 square meters. The area condition can be written as a quadratic equation in w.","question":"If both solutions of the equation are added, including one that cannot be a width, what is the sum?","options":["11","-4","4/3","-4/3"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 가로가 w, 세로가 4 more than 3 times the width 이므로 세로는 3w + 4 이다. (2) 넓이 = 가로 × 세로 이므로 $w(3w + 4) = 33$ 이다. (3) 전개해 표준형으로 정리하면 $3w^2 + 4w - 33 = 0$ 이다. (4) 판별식 16 + 396 = 412 > 0 이므로 서로 다른 두 실근이 있다. (5) 두 근의 합은 -(4)/3 = -4/3 이다. 따라서 정답은 -4/3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write the length in terms of w. (2) Area is width times length. (3) Expand and move everything to one side. (4) Two real solutions exist. (5) Use -b/a. So the answer is -4/3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.577Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(넓이 조건)을 식으로 모델링해 표준형으로 정리한 뒤, 도형에서는 의미 없는 근까지 포함한 근의 합을 읽음 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"irrational_sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"문장(넓이 조건)을 식으로 모델링해 표준형으로 정리한 뒤, 도형에서는 의미 없는 근까지 포함한 근의 합을 읽음 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 방정식의 합","concepts":["도형 문장의 식 세우기(넓이)","표준형 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"area_equation_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1.3333333333333335,"correctOption":"-4/3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"6ffe9a7e-7226-5cb8-a0e7-c5f14425d0f8","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_sum_of_roots.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"dcd0fe02-c3ad-5a9a-a62e-2ceaedab8131","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse/formula_inverse","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"In the equation given here, p and q are integers. The solutions of the equation are $\\frac{1 \\pm \\sqrt{241}}{10}$.\n\n$5x^2 + px + q = 0$","question":"What must q equal?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-12"],"explanation":"(1) 근의 공식 x = (-p ± √(p² - 4·5·q)) / 10 와 주어진 해를 비교한다. (2) 분모 10 = 2·5 로 a = 5 와 일치한다. (3) 분자의 -p = 1 이므로 p = -1 이다. (4) 근호 안: p² - 4·5·q = 241, 즉 1 - 20q = 241 이다. (5) 이를 풀면 q = -12 이다. 따라서 정답은 -12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Compare with the quadratic formula. (2) The denominator matches 2a. (3) Read the linear coefficient. (4) Set the discriminant equal to the radicand. (5) Solve for the constant. So the answer is -12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.577Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 공식 결과에서 b = -u, 판별식 b²-4ac = D 로 c 를 거꾸로 푸는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 곱 c/a 를 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 공식 결과에서 b = -u, 판별식 b²-4ac = D 로 c 를 거꾸로 푸는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 무리수 근 방정식의 근의 곱 c/a 를 읽음","concepts":["근의 공식","판별식 역산","계수 비교"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"formula_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-12,"correctOption":"-12"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"dcd0fe02-c3ad-5a9a-a62e-2ceaedab8131","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8ebc1ce6-06a0-58fe-a918-f411fe4a8941","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.compose_kind/absolute_value_substitution","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"Consider the equation below. $x^2 - 9|x| + 1 = 0$","question":"What is the product of all of the real solutions?","options":["9","1","-1","0"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) |x| = u (u ≥ 0) 로 치환하면 x² = u² 이므로 $u^2 - 9u + 1 = 0$ 이다. (2) 판별식 81 - 4 = 77 > 0 이고 근의 합 9 > 0, 곱 1 > 0 이므로 두 근 u₁, u₂ 는 모두 양수이다. (3) 각 u 에 대해 x = ±u 이므로 실근은 네 개 u₁, -u₁, u₂, -u₂ 이다. (4) 네 해의 곱은 (u₁)(-u₁)(u₂)(-u₂) = (u₁u₂)² 이다. (5) u₁u₂ = 1 이므로 곱은 1² = 1 이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute u = |x|. (2) Both roots in u are positive. (3) Each positive u gives two real solutions. (4) The signs cancel in pairs. (5) Use the product of roots. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.577Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["절댓값 방정식을 이차식으로 치환하고 양·음 대칭 해 4개의 곱(부호·제곱 처리)을 계산 — medium 은 이차방정식 두 해의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"절댓값 방정식을 이차식으로 치환하고 양·음 대칭 해 4개의 곱(부호·제곱 처리)을 계산 — medium 은 이차방정식 두 해의 곱","concepts":["절댓값 치환","근과 계수의 관계","대칭 해의 곱"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"absolute_value_substitution","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"8ebc1ce6-06a0-58fe-a918-f411fe4a8941","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"84c2d7fb-b7a9-5197-a2c5-fb809417dda9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2/product_then_factor","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Suppose k equals the product of the solutions of $x^2 - x - 3 = 0$. A second equation is given below:\n\n$x^2 + (k + 6)x + 6k = 0$","question":"What is the larger solution of the second equation?","options":["-6","6","3","-3"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식의 판별식 1 - -12 = 13 는 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 무리수이다. 곱의 공식을 쓴다. (2) 두 해의 곱은 -3/1 = -3 이므로 k = -3 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식에 k = -3 를 대입하면 $x^2 + 3x + (-18) = 0$ 이다. (4) 인수분해하면 $(x + (-3))(x + 6) = 0$ 이다. (5) 근은 3 와 -6 이고 큰 근은 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The roots are irrational; use the product formula. (2) Compute k. (3) Substitute k. (4) Factor. (5) Pick the larger solution. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.578Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["무리수 근을 풀지 않고 곱을 읽은 뒤 그 값이 인수분해 가능한 둘째 방정식의 계수가 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"무리수 근을 풀지 않고 곱을 읽은 뒤 그 값이 인수분해 가능한 둘째 방정식의 계수가 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 곱","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","이차방정식 인수분해"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"product_then_factor","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"84c2d7fb-b7a9-5197-a2c5-fb809417dda9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d67c3aee-55ee-5169-acf3-76a9115268b2","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift/revenue_equation_product","group":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","passage":"A school store sells water bottles at a price of p dollars per bottle. At that price, it sells 31 - 1p water bottles per day, and the revenue is 164 dollars per day. Writing the revenue condition as an equation in p gives a quadratic equation.","question":"What is the product of the two solutions of this quadratic equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["164"],"explanation":"(1) 가격이 p 이고 판매량이 31 - 1p 이므로 매출 = 가격 × 판매량 = p(31 - 1p) 이다. (2) 매출이 164 이므로 $p(31 - 1p) = 164$ 이다. (3) 전개해 표준형으로 정리하면 $1p^2 - 31p + 164 = 0$ 이다. (4) 판별식 961 - 656 = 305 > 0 이고 완전제곱수가 아니므로 해는 서로 다른 무리수이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 164/1 = 164 이다. 따라서 정답은 164이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Revenue is price times quantity. (2) Set revenue equal to the given amount. (3) Expand and move all terms to one side. (4) The solutions are irrational real numbers. (5) Use c/a. So the answer is 164.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.578Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(가격·판매량·매출)을 식으로 모델링한 뒤 표준형의 상수항과 최고차 계수의 비를 읽음 — medium 은 식으로 주어진 방정식의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"irrational_product_of_roots","extraThinking":"문장(가격·판매량·매출)을 식으로 모델링한 뒤 표준형의 상수항과 최고차 계수의 비를 읽음 — medium 은 식으로 주어진 방정식의 곱","concepts":["문장 모델링(매출=가격×판매량)","표준형 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"revenue_equation_product","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":164.00000000000003,"correctOption":"164"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d67c3aee-55ee-5169-acf3-76a9115268b2","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_product_of_roots.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"7698eab1-f7ec-545f-a46b-8404a8d031a9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse/conjugate_other_root","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse","passage":"For the equation shown, m and k are integers, and one solution of the equation is $-2 - 3\\sqrt{10}$.\n\n$x^2 + mx + k = 0$","question":"What is the second solution?","options":["$2 - 3\\sqrt{10}$","$2 + 3\\sqrt{10}$","$-2 + 3\\sqrt{10}$","$-2 - 3\\sqrt{10}$"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) m, k 가 정수이므로 무리수 해는 켤레와 함께 나온다. (2) 한 해가 $-2 - 3\\sqrt{10}$ 이므로 다른 해는 켤레 $-2 + 3\\sqrt{10}$ 이다. (3) 두 해의 합은 2·(-2) = -4 이고 이것이 -m 와 같아야 한다 (m = 4). (4) 두 해의 곱은 (-2)² - (3√10)² = -86 으로 정수이다. (5) 다른 해는 $-2 + 3\\sqrt{10}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $-2 + 3\\sqrt{10}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) With integer coefficients irrational solutions come in conjugate pairs. (2) The other solution is the conjugate. (3) Check with the sum of solutions. (4) Check the product is an integer. (5) State the other solution. So the answer is $-2 + 3\\sqrt{10}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.578Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["한 해에서 다른 해를 역으로 추론(켤레근 정리, 합 2p 로 확인)하고 근호꼴을 정리 — medium 은 방정식을 직접 풀어 근호꼴로 적음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"한 해에서 다른 해를 역으로 추론(켤레근 정리, 합 2p 로 확인)하고 근호꼴을 정리 — medium 은 방정식을 직접 풀어 근호꼴로 적음","concepts":["켤레근 정리","근과 계수의 관계","근호 표기"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"conjugate_other_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7.486832980505138,"correctOption":"$-2 + 3\\sqrt{10}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"7698eab1-f7ec-545f-a46b-8404a8d031a9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5681590a-217e-5938-a3a9-8ea425d77df5","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2/square_of_root","group":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the greater of the two solutions of $x^2 - 2x - 27 = 0$.","question":"Which expression is equivalent to k squared?","options":["$29$","$29 + 4\\sqrt{7}$","$29 - 4\\sqrt{7}$","$1 + 4\\sqrt{7}$"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 근의 공식으로 큰 해를 구한다. (2) $k = 1 + 2\\sqrt{7}$ 로 근호를 정리한다 (판별식 112 = 112). (3) 제곱한다: $k^2 = (1)^2 + 2(1)(2\\sqrt{7}) + (2\\sqrt{7})^2$ . (4) $(2\\sqrt{7})^2 = 28$ 이므로 상수항은 1 + 28 = 29 이다. (5) $k^2 = 29 + 4\\sqrt{7}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $29 + 4\\sqrt{7}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the quadratic formula. (2) Simplify the radical. (3) Square the binomial. (4) Evaluate the radical square. (5) Combine like terms. So the answer is $29 + 4\\sqrt{7}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.579Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 공식 → 근호 정리 → 이항 제곱 전개 → 동류항 정리의 4단 연쇄 — medium 은 근호꼴 해를 구하는 한 단계"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"irrational_root_radical_form","extraThinking":"근의 공식 → 근호 정리 → 이항 제곱 전개 → 동류항 정리의 4단 연쇄 — medium 은 근호꼴 해를 구하는 한 단계","concepts":["근의 공식·근호 정리","이항식 제곱","근호 동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"square_of_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":39.583005244258366,"correctOption":"$29 + 4\\sqrt{7}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5681590a-217e-5938-a3a9-8ea425d77df5","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.irrational_root_radical_form.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d132e19a-50c2-5a47-af23-9eee540034c9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.inverse/sum_coeffs","group":"nes.root.inverse","passage":"In the equation below, p and q are constants. One solution of the equation is -1, and the other solution is 2 less than that solution.\n\n$x^2 + px + q = 0$","question":"What is the sum of p and q?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["7"],"explanation":"(1) 한 근이 -1 이고 다른 근은 2 less than 이므로 다른 근은 -3 이다. (2) 근의 합은 -1 + (-3) = -4 이고 이것은 -p 와 같다. (3) 따라서 p = 4 이다. (4) 근의 곱은 -1·(-3) = 3 이고 이것은 q 와 같다. (5) p + q = 4 + 3 = 7 이다. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the other solution. (2) The sum of the solutions equals the negative of the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product equals the constant term. (5) Compute the requested combination. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.579Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"root","extraThinking":"근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","근의 차 조건","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"sum_coeffs","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d132e19a-50c2-5a47-af23-9eee540034c9","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f0c43c20-fa2b-5659-ac5f-598b1ec52919","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition/tangent_k","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","passage":"In the xy-plane, the graph of the parabola and the line below intersect at exactly one point. The constant k is a real number.\n\n$y = x^2 + 2x - 7$\n$y = 8x + k$","question":"Find k.","options":["-16","9","2","-7"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 교점에서 두 식의 y 가 같으므로 이차식과 직선식을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 2x - 7 = 8x + k$ 를 정리하면 $x^2 - 6x - 7 - k = 0$ 이다. (3) 한 점에서 만나므로 이 방정식이 중근을 가져야 한다: 판별식 D = 0. (4) (-6)² - 4(-7 - k) = 0 에서 k = -7 - 36/4 = -16 이다. (5) 중근은 x = -(-6)/2 = 3 이다. 묻는 값은 k 이다. 따라서 정답은 -16이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the two expressions for y equal. (2) Rearrange into standard form. (3) One intersection point means a double root. (4) Solve D = 0 for k. (5) The double root is the x-coordinate of the touching point. So the answer is -16.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.579Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["'한 점에서 만난다'를 두 식을 같게 놓은 이차방정식의 판별식 0 으로 번역해 직선의 상수를 정함 — medium 은 교점 개수 또는 좌표를 직접 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"'한 점에서 만난다'를 두 식을 같게 놓은 이차방정식의 판별식 0 으로 번역해 직선의 상수를 정함 — medium 은 교점 개수 또는 좌표를 직접 구함","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","판별식 조건","접점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"tangent_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-16,"correctOption":"-16"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f0c43c20-fa2b-5659-ac5f-598b1ec52919","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e80fda12-307c-5a09-adb9-7eb9da4a6455","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind/points_to_line_sum_x","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","passage":"In the xy-plane, a line contains the points (0, 4) and (-2, 6). The line meets the parabola $y = x^2 - x - 21$ at two points.","question":"What is the sum of the x-coordinates of the two points of intersection?","options":["-1","-2","0","-25"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 기울기 = (6 - 4) / (-2 - 0) = -1 이다. (2) 직선의 식은 y = -x + 4 이다. (3) 교점에서는 y 가 같으므로 $x^2 - x - 21 = -x + 4$ 이다. (4) 정리하면 $x^2 - 25 = 0$ 이고 두 근의 합은 0 = 0 이다 (x 좌표의 합). (5) 판별식이 양수여서 서로 다른 두 교점이 있음을 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Compute the slope of the line. (2) Find the intercept and write the line. (3) Set the two expressions equal. (4) The sum of solutions gives the sum of x-coordinates. (5) Check the discriminant is positive. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.580Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 점에서 직선의 식(기울기·절편)을 구하는 개념과 교점 개념을 연결 — medium 은 식이 주어진 직선과 포물선의 교점"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"두 점에서 직선의 식(기울기·절편)을 구하는 개념과 교점 개념을 연결 — medium 은 식이 주어진 직선과 포물선의 교점","concepts":["두 점을 지나는 직선","이차함수와 직선의 교점","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"points_to_line_sum_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"e80fda12-307c-5a09-adb9-7eb9da4a6455","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f7b69abf-f2e4-5d52-ad24-7d61ccecc75d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select/first_quadrant_point","group":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","passage":"The graphs of the two equations below intersect at two points in the xy-plane.\n\n$y = x^2 + 8x - 9$\n$y = 5x + 1$","question":"One of the two intersection points is in the first quadrant. What is its y-coordinate?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["11"],"explanation":"(1) 교점에서 y 가 같으므로 두 식을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 3x - 10 = 0$ 을 만든다. (3) 인수분해하면 x = -5 또는 x = 2 이다. (4) 직선에 대입해 두 교점 (-5, -24), (2, 11) 를 구한다. (5) 제1사분면은 x > 0 이고 y > 0 이므로 (2, 11) 만 해당한다. (6) y 좌표는 11 이다. 따라서 정답은 11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Set the expressions for y equal. (2) Rearrange to standard form. (3) Factor to find the x-coordinates. (4) Find both intersection points. (5) Keep the point with both coordinates positive. (6) Read the y-coordinate. So the answer is 11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.580Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 교점을 모두 구한 뒤 사분면 조건(양쪽 좌표 부호)으로 후보를 제거 — medium 은 교점의 x좌표를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"linear_quadratic_intersection","extraThinking":"두 교점을 모두 구한 뒤 사분면 조건(양쪽 좌표 부호)으로 후보를 제거 — medium 은 교점의 x좌표를 구함","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","방정식 풀이","사분면 조건 선택"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"first_quadrant_point","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":11,"correctOption":"11"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f7b69abf-f2e4-5d52-ad24-7d61ccecc75d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.linear_quadratic_intersection.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"933d2240-90dc-50a5-a16c-0634f104a05f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition/product_of_k","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","passage":"For the equation shown, k is an integer constant. The equation has exactly one real solution.\n\n$x^2 + kx + (4k - 15) = 0$","question":"If all possible values of k are multiplied, what is the product?","options":["-60","15","60","16"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = k² - 4(4k - 15) = 0 이므로 $k^2 - 16k - (-60) = 0$ 이다. (3) 이 k 에 대한 이차방정식의 판별식 256 + -240 = 16 = 16 는 양수이므로 k 는 두 개이다. (4) 근과 계수의 관계 또는 인수분해로 k = 6, 10 이다. (5) 곱: 10·6 = 60 이다. 따라서 정답은 60이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One real solution means D = 0. (2) Write the condition as an equation in k. (3) The condition in k has two solutions. (4) Solve for k. (5) Combine as requested. So the answer is 60.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.580Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건이 매개변수에 대한 또 하나의 이차방정식(k²-4uk-4m=0)이 되는 이중 구조 — medium 은 계수 하나가 미지수인 판별식 부등식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건이 매개변수에 대한 또 하나의 이차방정식(k²-4uk-4m=0)이 되는 이중 구조 — medium 은 계수 하나가 미지수인 판별식 부등식","concepts":["판별식 조건","매개변수 이차방정식","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"product_of_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":60,"correctOption":"60"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"933d2240-90dc-50a5-a16c-0634f104a05f","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4442ac6e-a241-50ea-a37b-f514b3e8a656","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse/tangent_to_axis","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","passage":"The parabola below has its vertex on the x-axis at the point (4, 0). Here, b and c are constants.\n\n$y = x^2 + bx + c$","question":"Find c - b.","options":["24","8","-8","16"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이고 x = 4 이므로 중근이다. (2) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 식은 $(x - 4)^2$ 와 같다. (3) 전개하면 $x^2 - 8x + 16$ 이다. (4) 계수를 읽으면 b = -8, c = 16 이다. (5) c - b = 16 - (-8) = 24 이다. 따라서 정답은 24이다.","explanationEn":"(1) A single solution is a double root. (2) The quadratic must be a perfect square. (3) Expand the square. (4) Read the coefficients. (5) Combine. So the answer is 24.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.580Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["중근 조건에서 이차식 자체를 (x-r)² 으로 재구성해 계수를 읽는 역방향 사고 — medium 은 판별식으로 매개변수를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"중근 조건에서 이차식 자체를 (x-r)² 으로 재구성해 계수를 읽는 역방향 사고 — medium 은 판별식으로 매개변수를 구함","concepts":["중근과 완전제곱식","전개·계수 비교","접선(꼭짓점이 x축 위)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"tangent_to_axis","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":24,"correctOption":"24"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4442ac6e-a241-50ea-a37b-f514b3e8a656","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"53603148-58ff-50ec-a473-dca6c98a5b4f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select/count_k_two_real","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","passage":"In the equation below, k is a nonzero integer with -8 ≤ k ≤ 8.\n\n$kx^2 - 3x + 1 = 0$","question":"For how many values of k does the equation have two distinct real solutions?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["10"],"explanation":"(1) k ≠ 0 이므로 이차방정식이고 판별식은 D = b² - 4kc 이다. (2) 서로 다른 두 실근이므로 D > 0, 즉 9 - 4k > 0 이다. (3) 음수 k 는 항상 D > 0 을 만족하므로 -8 ≤ k ≤ -1 의 8개가 모두 성립한다. (4) 양수 k 는 k < 9/4 이어야 하고 경계는 제외하므로 1 ≤ k ≤ 2 중 8 이하인 2개이다. (5) 전체 개수는 8 + 2 = 10 이다. 따라서 정답은 10이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The equation is quadratic since k is nonzero. (2) Two distinct real solutions need D > 0. (3) Every negative k works. (4) Positive k must satisfy a strict upper bound. (5) Add the counts. So the answer is 10.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.580Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["최고차 계수가 매개변수라 k=0 제외, 음수 k 는 항상 성립, 양수 k 는 경계(D=0) 제외로 나눠 세는 제약 추적 — medium 은 부호 조건을 만족하는 k 하나를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"최고차 계수가 매개변수라 k=0 제외, 음수 k 는 항상 성립, 양수 k 는 경계(D=0) 제외로 나눠 세는 제약 추적 — medium 은 부호 조건을 만족하는 k 하나를 구함","concepts":["판별식 부등식","정수 범위 세기","k≠0 조건"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"count_k_two_real","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":10,"correctOption":"10"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"53603148-58ff-50ec-a473-dca6c98a5b4f","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e3e14de7-7a14-543e-a4f4-29fb818f4694","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2/discriminant_then_count","group":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2","passage":"For the first equation below, k is a positive constant, and the equation has exactly one real solution.\n\nFirst equation: $x^2 + kx + 36 = 0$\n\nSecond equation: $x^2 - kx + 36 = 0$","question":"How many real solutions does the second equation have for this value of k?","options":["2","0","3","1"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식이 해가 하나뿐이므로 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) k² - 4·36 = 0 이므로 k² = 144 이다. (3) k 는 양수이므로 k = 12 이다. (4) 둘째 방정식에 k = 12 를 대입하면 $x^2 - 12x + 36 = 0$ 이고 판별식은 144 - 4·36 = 0 이다. (5) 판별식이 0 이므로 실근은 1 개이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means D = 0 for the first equation. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive value. (4) Substitute k and compute the second discriminant. (5) Decide the number of real solutions from its sign. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.580Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 판별식 조건에서 구한 k 가 뒤 방정식의 판별식 부호를 결정하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 판별식 부호"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"parameter_discriminant","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 판별식 조건에서 구한 k 가 뒤 방정식의 판별식 부호를 결정하는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 판별식 부호","concepts":["판별식 조건","양수 조건 선택","실근 개수 판정"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820002,"variant":"discriminant_then_count","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"e3e14de7-7a14-543e-a4f4-29fb818f4694","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.parameter_discriminant.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"48433e81-fc7d-567e-a59c-1694bc5a253b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.param_condition/ask_solution","group":"nes.root.param_condition","passage":"In the equation below, a is a positive constant chosen so that the equation has only one real solution.\n\n$x^2 + ax + 225 = 0$","question":"What is the solution to the equation?","options":["30","-30","15","-15"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 해가 하나뿐이므로 방정식은 중근을 갖고, 판별식 D = 0 이다. (2) D = a² - 4·225 = 0 이므로 a² = 900 이다. (3) a 는 양수이므로 a = 30 이다. (4) 방정식은 $(x + 15)^2 = 0$ 꼴이다. (5) 따라서 해는 x = -15 이다. 따라서 정답은 -15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) One solution means a double root, so D = 0. (2) Write the discriminant condition. (3) Choose the positive constant. (4) The equation becomes a perfect square. (5) Read off the solution. So the answer is -15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.580Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"root","extraThinking":"해의 개수 조건을 판별식 식으로 번역하고 부호 조건(양수 상수)으로 값을 하나로 고른 뒤 다시 방정식을 풀어야 한다 — medium 은 인수분해된 두 근 중 큰 근을 읽는 풀이","concepts":["판별식 조건","완전제곱 중근","부호 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820003,"variant":"ask_solution","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-15,"correctOption":"-15"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"48433e81-fc7d-567e-a59c-1694bc5a253b","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f468a1c9-4eeb-5737-a9f3-12c313272eed","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.chain2/larger","group":"nes.root.chain2","passage":"Let k be the larger solution of the equation $x^2 - 11x + 28 = 0$. Now consider a second equation, written with k:\n\n$x^2 - 2kx + k^2 - 16 = 0$","question":"Find the larger solution of the second equation.","options":["3","11","7","4"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식 $x^2 - 11x + 28 = 0$ 을 인수분해한다. (2) 근은 x = 4 과 x = 7 이므로 큰 근 k = 7 이다. (3) 둘째 방정식에 k = 7 를 대입한다: $(x - 7)^2 = 16$ 꼴이다. (4) 양변의 제곱근을 취하면 x - 7 = ±4 이다. (5) x = 3 또는 x = 11 이다. (6) 큰 근은 11 이다. 따라서 정답은 11이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor the first equation. (2) Find the two solutions and take the larger one as k. (3) Substitute k. (4) Take square roots. (5) Solve for x. (6) Choose the requested solution. So the answer is 11.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.581Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계에서 구한 값이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 근 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"root","extraThinking":"앞 단계에서 구한 값이 뒤 방정식의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 방정식의 근 하나","concepts":["이차방정식 인수분해","치환·전개","완전제곱형 방정식"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"larger","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":11,"correctOption":"11"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f468a1c9-4eeb-5737-a9f3-12c313272eed","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"efb63498-a679-5cac-a620-e279503b456a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.root.inverse/sum_coeffs","group":"nes.root.inverse","passage":"For the equation shown, b and c are constants. One solution of the equation is -4, and the other solution is 6 more than that solution.\n\n$x^2 + bx + c = 0$","question":"Find b + c.","options":["-8","2","-6","-10"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 한 근이 -4 이고 다른 근은 6 more than 이므로 다른 근은 2 이다. (2) 근의 합은 -4 + 2 = -2 이고 이것은 -b 와 같다. (3) 따라서 b = 2 이다. (4) 근의 곱은 -4·2 = -8 이고 이것은 c 와 같다. (5) b + c = 2 + (-8) = -6 이다. 따라서 정답은 -6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the other solution. (2) The sum of the solutions equals the negative of the linear coefficient. (3) Solve for the linear coefficient. (4) The product equals the constant term. (5) Compute the requested combination. So the answer is -6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.581Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.root.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"root","extraThinking":"근 → 계수의 역방향 재구성(두 번째 근 도출, 합·곱의 부호 처리) — medium 은 주어진 방정식의 근을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","근의 차 조건","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"sum_coeffs","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-6,"correctOption":"-6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"efb63498-a679-5cac-a620-e279503b456a","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.root.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"55695cca-bbed-525e-ad24-5eeea333d986","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse/rearranged_form","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","passage":"The equation shown has two different real solutions, where p and q are constants. The sum of the solutions is 9, and the product of the solutions is 18.\n\n$4x^2 = px + q$","question":"What is the sum of p and q?","options":["108","-72","-36","36"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 4x² = px + q 를 표준형으로 이항하면 $4x^2 - px - q = 0$ 이다. (2) 두 근의 합 = p/4 = 9 이므로 p = 36 이다. (3) 두 근의 곱 = -q/4 = 18 이므로 q = -72 이다. (4) 부호에 주의해 b 와 c 를 확인한다(c 는 이항 때문에 곱의 -4 배). (5) p + q = 36 + (-72) = -36 이다. 따라서 정답은 -36이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Move every term to one side. (2) Use the sum of solutions. (3) Use the product of solutions. (4) Check the signs created by moving terms. (5) Add. So the answer is -36.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.581Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"표준형으로 이항할 때 b·c 의 부호 변화를 추적하며 합·곱 조건을 계수로 역산 — medium 은 표준형 방정식의 근의 합을 -b/a 로 읽음","concepts":["표준형 정리(이항)","근과 계수의 관계","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"rearranged_form","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-36,"correctOption":"-36"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"55695cca-bbed-525e-ad24-5eeea333d986","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3c5622dc-6438-58a8-aa41-91229c9c8b76","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition/param_sum_condition","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","passage":"In the given equation, k is a constant. The equation has two real solutions, and the sum of the solutions is 6.\n\n$x^2 + (-2k + 2)x + (3k - 19) = 0$","question":"What is the product of the solutions of the equation?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-7"],"explanation":"(1) 이차항의 계수가 1 이므로 두 근의 합은 x 의 계수의 부호를 바꾼 값이다. (2) -(-2k + 2) = 6 로 놓는다. (3) 이 일차방정식을 풀면 k = 4 이다. (4) 상수항에 k = 4 를 대입하면 3·4 + (-19) = -7 이다. (5) 두 근의 곱은 상수항과 같으므로 -7 이다. 따라서 정답은 -7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (2) Set the sum equal to the given value. (3) Solve for k. (4) Substitute k into the constant term. (5) The product equals the constant term. So the answer is -7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.581Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"근의 합 조건을 매개변수 방정식으로 번역해 k 를 정한 뒤 다른 계수에 다시 대입 — medium 은 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 합을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","매개변수 일차방정식","대입 후 곱 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"param_sum_condition","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-7,"correctOption":"-7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3c5622dc-6438-58a8-aa41-91229c9c8b76","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a4f6cfac-1c4b-53a9-ae5d-1b6ebe45c5c7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind/sum_of_x","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"A parabola and a line are given by the equations below, and they cross at two points in the xy-plane.\n\n$y = x^2 + 4x + 1$\n$y = 7x + 11$","question":"If the two intersection points are added, what is the sum of their x-coordinates?","options":["3","-10","-3","11"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 교점에서는 두 식의 y 가 같으므로 두 식의 우변을 같게 놓는다. (2) $x^2 + 4x + 1 = 7x + 11$ 이다. (3) 모두 한쪽으로 옮기면 $x^2 - 3x - 10 = 0$ 이다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(-3) = 3 = 3 이다 (x 좌표의 합). (5) 두 교점이 서로 다른 실수임을 판별식으로 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) At an intersection the two y-values are equal. (2) Set the right sides equal. (3) Move all terms to one side. (4) The sum of solutions is the negative of the linear coefficient. (5) Check that two distinct intersections exist. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.581Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"연립(교점) 개념과 근의 합 개념을 연결해 두 식을 같게 놓고 정리한 뒤 합을 읽는다 — medium 은 주어진 이차방정식의 근의 합","concepts":["이차함수와 직선의 교점","방정식 정리","근과 계수의 관계"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"sum_of_x","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a4f6cfac-1c4b-53a9-ae5d-1b6ebe45c5c7","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4861639b-3cb4-5da4-a2c2-b7388e1300fe","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2/sum_then_leading_coefficient","group":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","passage":"Let k represent the sum of the two solutions of $x^2 - 10x + 24 = 0$. A second equation is given below:\n\n$kx^2 + 30x + 7 = 0$","question":"Find the sum of the two solutions of the second equation.","options":["-3","-30","3","10"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 방정식에서 두 근의 합은 -(-10) = 10 이므로 k = 10 이다. (2) 둘째 방정식에 k = 10 를 대입하면 $10x^2 + 30x + 7 = 0$ 이다. (3) 판별식 -30² - 4·10·7 = 620 > 0 이므로 서로 다른 두 실근이 있다. (4) 두 근의 합은 -(30) / 10 이다. (5) -30 / 10 = -3 이다. 따라서 정답은 -3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sum of the first equation's solutions is k. (2) Substitute k. (3) Check that real solutions exist. (4) Use -b/a. (5) Divide. So the answer is -3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.581Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"sum_of_roots","extraThinking":"앞 단계 결과가 뒤 방정식의 최고차 계수가 되고, 근이 무리수일 수 있어 합을 근과 계수의 관계로 읽어야 한다 — medium 은 한 방정식의 합","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계","연쇄 대입","판별식으로 실근 확인"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820003,"variant":"sum_then_leading_coefficient","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-3,"correctOption":"-3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4861639b-3cb4-5da4-a2c2-b7388e1300fe","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.sum_of_roots.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5c345c4c-5a46-5401-a9c2-31391b5f5d0a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse/leading_coefficient_inverse","group":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","passage":"In the given equation, k is a positive integer, and the equation has two real solutions whose product is 5.\n\n$kx^2 - 12x + 10 = 0$","question":"What is the value of the sum of the solutions?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["6"],"explanation":"(1) 근의 곱은 c/k = 10/k 이고 이것이 5 이다. (2) 10/k = 5 이므로 k = 2 이다. (3) k = 2 를 대입한 방정식은 $2x^2 - 12x + 10 = 0$ 이다. (4) 근의 합은 -(-12) / 2 이다. (5) 12 / 2 = 6 이다. 따라서 정답은 6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The product of solutions is c over the leading coefficient. (2) Solve for k. (3) Write the equation with k known. (4) Use -b/a for the sum. (5) Divide. So the answer is 6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"곱 조건으로 최고차 계수를 역산한 뒤 그 계수로 합을 다시 계산 — medium 은 최고차 계수가 숫자인 방정식에서 곱을 읽음","concepts":["근과 계수의 관계(곱)","최고차 계수 역산","근과 계수의 관계(합)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"leading_coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6,"correctOption":"6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5c345c4c-5a46-5401-a9c2-31391b5f5d0a","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f1644c02-68dd-5208-a7f7-b559cf4d4889","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind/one_negative_t","group":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","passage":"The equation below has at least two real solutions. $x^4 - 6x^2 - 27 = 0$","question":"What is the product of all of the real solutions?","options":["-27","-9","-3","9"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x² = t 로 치환하면 t 에 대한 이차방정식이 된다. (2) $t^2 - 6t - 27 = 0$ 을 인수분해해 t 의 근을 구한다. (3) t = 9 또는 t = -3 이다. x² = t 가 실수이려면 t ≥ 0 이어야 하므로 t = 9 만 쓴다. (4) 실근은 x = ±3 이다. (5) 모든 실근의 곱은 -9 이다. 따라서 정답은 -9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute t = x². (2) Factor the quadratic in t. (3) A negative t cannot equal x², so keep only the positive root. (4) List the real solutions. (5) Multiply them, keeping the signs. So the answer is -9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"product_of_roots","extraThinking":"치환(이차식 꼴 발견), t 의 근의 부호에 따른 실근 선별, x = ±√t 의 곱 계산을 연결 — medium 은 이차방정식의 근의 곱","concepts":["치환(x²=t)","근과 계수의 관계","실근 선별(음수 제곱 제외)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"one_negative_t","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-9,"correctOption":"-9"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f1644c02-68dd-5208-a7f7-b559cf4d4889","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_equations_systems","recipeId":"nes.product_of_roots.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"00173d02-a48d-5d7f-a6d0-95f73a343c90","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.chain2/f_of_f","group":"nf.evaluate.chain2","passage":"Let f be the function defined below. $f(x) = x^2 - 2x + 3$","question":"What is the value of f(f(-2))?","options":["102","121","22","99"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 안쪽부터 계산한다: f(-2) = 1·(-2)² + (-2)·(-2) + 3. (2) 제곱을 먼저 계산하면 1·4 = 4 이다. (3) f(-2) = 4 + 4 + 3 = 11 이다. (4) 이 값을 다시 f 에 넣는다: f(11) = 1·11² + (-2)·11 + 3. (5) 계산하면 102 이다. 따라서 정답은 102이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate the inner function first. (2) Square before multiplying. (3) Add the terms. (4) Use the result as the next input. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 102.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산","concepts":["함숫값","합성(연쇄 대입)","부호 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"f_of_f","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":102,"correctOption":"102"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"00173d02-a48d-5d7f-a6d0-95f73a343c90","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a728ff0f-75b2-5e7d-a6e1-a7ee4851e71f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind/difference_of_compositions","group":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","passage":"The functions f and g are defined by the equations below. $f(x) = -x^2 - 3x$ $g(x) = 3x - 5$","question":"Find f(g(3)) - g(f(3)).","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["31"],"explanation":"(1) g(3) = 3·3 + (-5) = 4 이다. (2) f(g(3)) = f(4) = -28 이다. (3) f(3) = -18 이다. (4) g(f(3)) = g(-18) = -59 이다. (5) 두 값의 차는 -28 - (-59) = 31 이다. 따라서 정답은 31이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate g first. (2) Feed it into f. (3) Evaluate f(p). (4) Feed it into g. (5) Subtract. So the answer is 31.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값","concepts":["함수 합성","함숫값","순서의 비가환성"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"difference_of_compositions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":31,"correctOption":"31"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a728ff0f-75b2-5e7d-a6e1-a7ee4851e71f","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5c5e7594-16b8-59af-abd2-32152498369d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift/table_to_formula","group":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","passage":"A quadratic function f has the values below: f(0) = 5, f(1) = 2, and f(2) = -7.","question":"What is f(5)?","options":["-25","-43","-70","-16"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f(0) = 5 이므로 상수항은 5 이다. (2) f(x) = ax² + bx + 5 에서 f(1) = a + b + 5 = 2 이므로 a + b = -3 이다. (3) f(2) = 4a + 2b + 5 = -7 이므로 2a + b = -6 이다. (4) 두 식을 빼면 a = -3, b = 0 이다. (5) f(x) = -3x^2 + 5 이므로 f(5) = -70 이다. 따라서 정답은 -70이다.","explanationEn":"(1) f(0) is the constant term. (2) Use f(1). (3) Use f(2). (4) Solve for a and b. (5) Evaluate at the new input. So the answer is -70.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표(값)에서 이차함수 식을 세우는 모델링(상수항, 일차·이차 계수 연립) 후 새 입력에서 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"표(값)에서 이차함수 식을 세우는 모델링(상수항, 일차·이차 계수 연립) 후 새 입력에서 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함숫값","concepts":["표에서 식 세우기","이차함수 계수 결정","함숫값"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"table_to_formula","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-70,"correctOption":"-70"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5c5e7594-16b8-59af-abd2-32152498369d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"31cac416-e44c-5b85-ad6f-ef86e0fa86a0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios/quadratic_vs_linear_threshold","group":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","passage":"The total cost, in dollars, of a print shop plan after t months is given by $A(t) = t^2 + 19$. The total cost of a copy center plan after t months is given by $B(t) = 5t + 56$.","question":"For what is the least integer t such that A(t) > B(t)?","options":["8","9","10","11"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A(t) = t^2 + 19, B(t) = 5t + 56 이다. (2) A(0) = 19 < B(0) = 56 이므로 처음에는 A 가 더 싸다. (3) t 를 늘려 가며 두 값을 비교한다: t = 9 에서 A = 100, B = 101. (4) t = 10 에서 A = 119, B = 106 로 A 가 처음으로 더 크다. (5) 따라서 10 개월이다. 따라서 정답은 10이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both cost models. (2) Compare at t = 0. (3) Compare just before the crossing. (4) Find the first t where A exceeds B. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 10.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 모델의 값을 비교해 임계 시점을 찾는 탐색(부등식·교차점 해석) — medium 은 한 모델의 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"두 모델의 값을 비교해 임계 시점을 찾는 탐색(부등식·교차점 해석) — medium 은 한 모델의 함숫값","concepts":["함숫값 비교","이차-일차 교차","임계점 탐색"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"quadratic_vs_linear_threshold","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":10,"correctOption":"10"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"31cac416-e44c-5b85-ad6f-ef86e0fa86a0","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2a579111-c116-55f3-afed-ed7c90c9a1a0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.inverse/vertex_and_point_inverse","group":"nf.vertex_x.inverse","passage":"Consider the function below, b and c are constants. The graph of the function in the xy-plane has its vertex at x = 6 and passes through the point (1, 15).\n\n$f(x) = -2x^2 + bx + c$","question":"Find b + c.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["17"],"explanation":"(1) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표는 -b/(2a) = 6 이다 (a = -2). (2) -b = -24 이므로 b = 24 이다. (3) 점 (1, 15) 를 대입한다: -2·1² + 24·1 + c = 15. (4) -2 + 24 + c = 15 이므로 c = -7 이다. (5) b + c = 24 + (-7) = 17 이다. 따라서 정답은 17이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the vertex formula. (2) Solve for b. (3) Substitute the point. (4) Solve for c. (5) Add. So the answer is 17.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["꼭짓점 공식에서 b 를 역산하고 점의 좌표를 대입해 c 를 구하는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 표준형에서 꼭짓점 x좌표 -b/2a 를 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"꼭짓점 공식에서 b 를 역산하고 점의 좌표를 대입해 c 를 구하는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 표준형에서 꼭짓점 x좌표 -b/2a 를 계산","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","점의 대입","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"vertex_and_point_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":17,"correctOption":"17"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"2a579111-c116-55f3-afed-ed7c90c9a1a0","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d64f0cfc-214c-58ab-a783-6c64086a7796","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind/zeros_and_translation","group":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","passage":"The function f is defined by the equation below: $f(x) = (x + 7)(x + 3)$. A second function is $g(x) = f(x + 2) - 2$.","question":"At what value of x does the graph of g have its vertex?","options":["-3","-5","-7","-9"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 영점은 x = -7, -3 이다. (2) 영점의 중점이 꼭짓점의 x 좌표이므로 (-7 + (-3))/2 = -5 이다. (3) g(x) = f(x + 2) + (상수) 이므로 그래프는 오른쪽으로 -2 만큼 이동한다(음수면 왼쪽). (4) 위·아래 이동 e 는 꼭짓점의 y 좌표만 바꾼다. (5) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표는 -5 + (-2) = -7 이다. 따라서 정답은 -7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Read the zeros of f. (2) The vertex lies midway between the zeros. (3) Interpret the horizontal shift. (4) The vertical shift does not change the x-coordinate. (5) Add the horizontal shift. So the answer is -7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["영점의 중점이 꼭짓점이라는 성질과 평행이동(수평 이동만 x좌표에 영향)을 결합 — medium 은 표준형에서 -b/2a 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"영점의 중점이 꼭짓점이라는 성질과 평행이동(수평 이동만 x좌표에 영향)을 결합 — medium 은 표준형에서 -b/2a 계산","concepts":["영점과 대칭축","그래프 평행이동","꼭짓점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"zeros_and_translation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-7,"correctOption":"-7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d64f0cfc-214c-58ab-a783-6c64086a7796","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"abe02398-9a9f-5321-a0a1-4aef57d87d1b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift/four_sides","group":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","passage":"A farmer has 24 feet of fencing to build a rectangular enclosure. The fencing is used on all four sides. The width of the enclosure is x feet.","question":"The farmer wants the enclosure to have the greatest possible area. What should the width be, in feet?","options":["8","3","12","6"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 울타리는 폭 2개와 길이 2개에 쓰이므로 2x + 2(길이) = 24 이고 길이는 12 - x 이다. (2) 넓이 A(x) = x(12 - x) 이다. (3) 전개하면 A(x) = -x^2 + 12x 로 위로 볼록한 이차함수이다. (4) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표 = 12/(2·1) = 6 이다. (5) 폭은 6, 길이는 12 - 6 = 6 이므로 묻는 값은 6 이다. 따라서 정답은 6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Express the length with the fencing constraint. (2) Area is width times length. (3) Expand: a downward-opening quadratic. (4) The maximum occurs at the vertex. (5) Answer the question asked. So the answer is 6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["울타리 길이 조건을 식으로 모델링해 넓이 이차함수를 세우고 꼭짓점을 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 꼭짓점"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"울타리 길이 조건을 식으로 모델링해 넓이 이차함수를 세우고 꼭짓점을 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 꼭짓점","concepts":["문장 모델링(울타리·넓이)","이차함수의 최댓값 위치","꼭짓점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"four_sides","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6,"correctOption":"6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"abe02398-9a9f-5321-a0a1-4aef57d87d1b","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2247b257-a4c4-5613-af2a-c0d28a473c3c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.chain2/vertex_then_vertex","group":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","passage":"Suppose h is the x-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of f, where $f(x) = 2x^2 + 8x + 5$. A second function g is defined using h:\n\n$g(x) = -x^2 + hx - 2$","question":"What is the x-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of g?","options":["2","1","-2","-1"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 꼭짓점 x 좌표 h = -(8)/(2·2) = -2 이다. (2) g(x) 에 h = -2 를 대입하면 g(x) = -x^2 - 2x - 2 이다. (3) g 의 x 계수는 -2, x² 계수는 -1 이다. (4) 꼭짓점 공식: x = -(-2)/(2·-1). (5) 계산하면 -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find h with the vertex formula. (2) Substitute h into g. (3) Read the coefficients of g. (4) Apply the vertex formula to g. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.582Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 꼭짓점 좌표가 뒤 함수의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 함수의 꼭짓점 x좌표"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 꼭짓점 좌표가 뒤 함수의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 함수의 꼭짓점 x좌표","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","연쇄 대입","계수 해석"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"vertex_then_vertex","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"2247b257-a4c4-5613-af2a-c0d28a473c3c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0fd3dfbd-f04d-5efb-afce-eff46ea22095","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.inverse/maximum_value","group":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","passage":"Consider the function below, b is a constant. The graph of the function in the xy-plane has its vertex at x = 3 and crosses the y-axis at the point (0, 6).\n\n$f(x) = -x^2 + bx + 6$","question":"What is the maximum value of f?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["15"],"explanation":"(1) 최고차 계수 -1 가 음수라 위로 볼록하므로 꼭짓점이 최댓값 이다. (2) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표가 3 이므로 -b/(2·-1) = 3, 즉 b = 6 이다. (3) y절편이 6 이므로 상수항은 6 이다. (4) f(3) = -1·9 + 6·3 + 6. (5) 계산하면 15 이다. 따라서 정답은 15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sign of a decides minimum or maximum. (2) Solve for b with the vertex formula. (3) Read the constant term. (4) Evaluate f at the vertex. (5) Compute. So the answer is 15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["꼭짓점 위치 조건에서 b 를 역산하고 최대·최소 여부(a 의 부호)를 판단해 꼭짓점의 y 값을 구함 — medium 은 표준형의 최솟값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"꼭짓점 위치 조건에서 b 를 역산하고 최대·최소 여부(a 의 부호)를 판단해 꼭짓점의 y 값을 구함 — medium 은 표준형의 최솟값 계산","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","y절편","최대·최소 판단"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"maximum_value","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":15,"correctOption":"15"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"0fd3dfbd-f04d-5efb-afce-eff46ea22095","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3e83e991-c2ef-5c5f-a737-1fcc72c41622","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind/scaled_max","group":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","passage":"The function f is defined by the equation below: $f(x) = x^2 + 8x - 2$. The function g is defined by $g(x) = -2f(x) - 3$.","question":"What is the maximum value of g?","options":["33","-21","36","-18"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f(x) = x^2 + 8x - 2 를 완전제곱식으로 쓰면 꼭짓점의 y 값(최솟값)은 -2 - 64/4 = -18 이다. (2) g(x) = -2f(x) - 3 이다. (3) u = -2 이므로 g 는 위로 볼록해 최댓값 을 가진다. (4) g 의 극값은 -2·(-18) - 3 이다. (5) 계산하면 33 이다. 따라서 정답은 33이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the minimum of f. (2) Write g in terms of f. (3) A negative multiple flips the parabola. (4) Apply the transformation to the vertex value. (5) Compute. So the answer is 33.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["함수의 상수배·평행이동이 꼭짓점의 y값에 어떻게 반영되는지(부호가 바뀌면 최소→최대)를 결합 — medium 은 한 함수의 최솟값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"함수의 상수배·평행이동이 꼭짓점의 y값에 어떻게 반영되는지(부호가 바뀌면 최소→최대)를 결합 — medium 은 한 함수의 최솟값","concepts":["완전제곱식(꼭짓점)","함수의 변환","최대·최소 판단"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"scaled_max","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":33,"correctOption":"33"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3e83e991-c2ef-5c5f-a737-1fcc72c41622","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5fcae44b-e0b4-52f1-af78-575ed2494d6b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift/maximize_revenue","group":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","passage":"A bakery sells cakes at a price of p dollars per cake. At that price, it sells 20 - 1p cakes per day.","question":"What is the maximum possible revenue per day, in dollars?","options":["200","10","100","20"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 매출 = 가격 × 판매량 이므로 R(p) = p(20 - 1p) 이다. (2) 전개하면 R(p) = -1p² + 20p 로 위로 볼록한 이차함수이다. (3) 최대는 꼭짓점에서 생기고 p = 20/(2·1) = 10 이다. (4) R(10) = 10(20 - 1·10) 를 계산한다. (5) 최대 매출은 100 달러이다. 따라서 정답은 100이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Revenue is price times quantity. (2) Expand: a downward-opening quadratic. (3) The maximum is at the vertex. (4) Evaluate the revenue at that price. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 100.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(가격·판매량)에서 매출 이차함수를 모델링하고 꼭짓점의 y 값을 최대 매출로 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 최댓값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"문장(가격·판매량)에서 매출 이차함수를 모델링하고 꼭짓점의 y 값을 최대 매출로 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 최댓값","concepts":["문장 모델링(매출=가격×판매량)","이차함수 최댓값","꼭짓점 y 좌표"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"maximize_revenue","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":100,"correctOption":"100"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5fcae44b-e0b4-52f1-af78-575ed2494d6b","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"df075012-07f2-56e8-a768-078db7e03bea","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios/compare_two_maxima","group":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","passage":"The heights, in feet, of two thrown balls t seconds after launch are modeled by the functions below.\n\n$h(t) = -2t^2 + 8t + 6$\n$k(t) = -t^2 + 8t + 8$","question":"How many feet higher is the greater of the two maximum heights than the lesser?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["10"],"explanation":"(1) 첫 번째 모델의 꼭짓점: t = -8/(2·(-2)) = 2, 최대 높이 14 이다. (2) 두 번째 모델의 꼭짓점: t = 4, 최대 높이 24 이다. (3) 두 최대 높이를 비교한다. (4) 더 큰 값 24 에서 작은 값 14 을 뺀다. (5) 차이는 10 피트이다. 따라서 정답은 10이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Maximum of the first model. (2) Maximum of the second model. (3) Compare the two maxima. (4) Subtract the smaller maximum from the larger. (5) State the difference. So the answer is 10.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 모델 각각의 꼭짓점 y 값을 구해 비교(두 경우의 최댓값 비교) — medium 은 한 모델의 최댓값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"두 모델 각각의 꼭짓점 y 값을 구해 비교(두 경우의 최댓값 비교) — medium 은 한 모델의 최댓값","concepts":["꼭짓점 y 값","두 모델 비교","차 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"compare_two_maxima","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":10,"correctOption":"10"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"df075012-07f2-56e8-a768-078db7e03bea","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"14408b58-db47-596a-a969-394583463b17","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse/two_points_then_solve","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","passage":"The number of yeast cells in a dish is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot b^t$, where a and b are positive constants and t is the number of days since the first measurement. The model gives N(2) = 40 and N(4) = 160.","question":"Find the value of t for which N(t) = 320.","options":["6","4","32","5"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 값의 비: N(4)/N(2) = 160/40 = b^2 이다. (2) b^2 = 4 이므로 b = 2 이다. (3) N(2) = a·2^2 = 40 이므로 a = 10 이다. (4) 10·2^t = 320 에서 2^t = 32 이다. (5) 2^5 = 32 이므로 t = 5 이다. 따라서 정답은 5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Divide the two values. (2) Solve for b. (3) Solve for a. (4) Isolate the exponential. (5) Solve the exponent. So the answer is 5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 값의 비에서 b 를 역산하고 a 를 구한 뒤 지수 방정식을 푸는 3단 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 a, b 가 주어진 모델에서 시점을 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"두 값의 비에서 b 를 역산하고 a 를 구한 뒤 지수 방정식을 푸는 3단 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 a, b 가 주어진 모델에서 시점을 구함","concepts":["지수함수의 비","계수 역산","지수 방정식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"two_points_then_solve","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5,"correctOption":"5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"14408b58-db47-596a-a969-394583463b17","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"28aaebc4-1a74-5f25-a73e-290a86ec913d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select/substitution_positive_root","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","passage":"For the equation shown, x is a real number. $3^{2x} + 3(3^{x}) - 18 = 0$","question":"What is the value of x that satisfies the equation?","options":["2","-6","3","1"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) u = 3^x 로 치환하면 3^(2x) = u² 이므로 $u^2 + 3u - 18 = 0$ 이다. (2) 인수분해하면 (u - 3)(u + 6) = 0 이므로 u = 3 또는 u = -6 이다. (3) 3^x 는 항상 양수이므로 u = -6 는 불가능하다. (4) 3^x = 3 이다. (5) 3 = 3^1 이므로 x = 1 이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute u = b^x. (2) Factor. (3) An exponential is always positive. (4) Keep the positive root. (5) Solve the exponent. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환 후 나온 음수 u 는 b^x 가 될 수 없다는 제약으로 후보를 제거하고 지수 방정식을 풂 — medium 은 b^x = 상수 꼴을 한 번 풂"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"치환 후 나온 음수 u 는 b^x 가 될 수 없다는 제약으로 후보를 제거하고 지수 방정식을 풂 — medium 은 b^x = 상수 꼴을 한 번 풂","concepts":["치환(u=b^x)","이차방정식 인수분해","지수의 양수 제약"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"substitution_positive_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"28aaebc4-1a74-5f25-a73e-290a86ec913d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"68fa7441-d565-5e07-a774-f59ef9c23a10","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2/exponent_solution_then_linear","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","passage":"The number of bacteria in a culture t hours after a measurement begins is given by $P(t) = 8 \\cdot 3^t$. Let T be the time at which P(T) = 72. A second quantity is given by $Q(t) = -4t$.","question":"What is Q(T)?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-8"],"explanation":"(1) P(T) = 8·3^T = 72 이므로 3^T = 9 이다. (2) 9 = 3^2 이므로 T = 2 이다. (3) Q(t) = -4t 에 t = 2 를 대입한다. (4) Q(2) = -4·2 + 0. (5) 계산하면 -8 이다. 따라서 정답은 -8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Isolate the exponential. (2) Solve the exponent. (3) Use T as the input of Q. (4) Substitute. (5) Compute. So the answer is -8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["지수 방정식의 해가 다른 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 지수 방정식의 해 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"지수 방정식의 해가 다른 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 지수 방정식의 해 한 번","concepts":["지수 방정식","일차함수의 값","연쇄 대입"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"exponent_solution_then_linear","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-8,"correctOption":"-8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"68fa7441-d565-5e07-a774-f59ef9c23a10","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d271f4f7-be59-5cf8-a385-25cd2dc9e5e4","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind/same_base_linear","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind","passage":"Consider the equation below. $2^{2x + 2} = 4^{2x + 2}$","question":"Find the value of x.","options":["0","1","2","-1"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 2 = 2^1, 4 = 2^2 이므로 두 밑을 2 로 통일한다. (2) 좌변의 지수는 1(2x + 2), 우변의 지수는 2(2x + 2) 이다. (3) 밑이 같으므로 지수를 같게 놓는다. (4) 2x + 2 = 4x + 4 로 정리한다. (5) x 항을 모으면 -2x = 2 이므로 x = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Rewrite both bases with the same prime. (2) Multiply the exponents by the base powers. (3) Equal bases mean equal exponents. (4) Write the linear equation. (5) Solve for x. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["밑을 통일(지수 법칙)하고 지수의 일차방정식을 세워 푸는 개념의 결합 — medium 은 한 변이 상수인 지수 방정식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"밑을 통일(지수 법칙)하고 지수의 일차방정식을 세워 푸는 개념의 결합 — medium 은 한 변이 상수인 지수 방정식","concepts":["밑의 통일(지수 법칙)","일차방정식","지수 방정식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"same_base_linear","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d271f4f7-be59-5cf8-a385-25cd2dc9e5e4","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"06a5334f-8392-59ff-a463-72f8e81a6172","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio/unit_conversion_initial_value","group":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio","passage":"The number of bacteria in a culture is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot 2^{t/30}$, where a is a positive constant and t is the number of minutes since the first measurement. One hour after the first measurement, the model gives a value of 180.","question":"What is the value of a, the number at the first measurement?","options":["45","3","90","60"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 1 hour = 60 minutes 이므로 t = 60 를 대입한다. (2) N(60) = a·2^(60/30) = a·2^2 이다. (3) 2^2 = 4 이므로 4a = 180 이다. (4) a = 180/4 = 45 이다. (5) a 는 t = 0 일 때의 값이므로 초기값은 45 이다. 따라서 정답은 45이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Convert one larger unit into the model's unit. (2) Substitute into the model. (3) Evaluate the power. (4) Solve for a. (5) a is the value at t = 0. So the answer is 45.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["시간 단위 환산(1일=24시간 등)으로 지수를 정리하고 a 가 t=0 의 값임을 해석 — medium 은 단위 환산 없이 초기값 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"시간 단위 환산(1일=24시간 등)으로 지수를 정리하고 a 가 t=0 의 값임을 해석 — medium 은 단위 환산 없이 초기값 읽기","concepts":["단위 환산","지수함수의 초기값","배가 주기"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"unit_conversion_initial_value","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":45,"correctOption":"45"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"06a5334f-8392-59ff-a463-72f8e81a6172","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"fa8f9309-94c1-51af-a633-1879d6adad01","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios/crossover_time","group":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","passage":"Colony A starts with 75 cells, and the number of cells is multiplied by 3 every hour. Colony B starts with 32 cells, and the number of cells is multiplied by 5 every hour.","question":"What is the smallest whole number of hours after which Colony B has more cells than Colony A?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["2"],"explanation":"(1) A 의 세포 수는 75·3^t, B 의 세포 수는 32·5^t 이다. (2) t = 0 에서는 A(75) > B(32) 이다. (3) t = 1 에서 A = 225, B = 160 로 아직 B 가 작거나 같다. (4) t = 2 에서 A = 675, B = 800 로 B 가 처음 더 크다. (5) 따라서 2 시간이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both models. (2) Compare the starting values. (3) Check just before the crossing. (4) Find the first t where B exceeds A. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["초기값이 서로 다른 두 지수 모델을 비교해 역전 시점을 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 초기값 해석"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"초기값이 서로 다른 두 지수 모델을 비교해 역전 시점을 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 초기값 해석","concepts":["초기값 비교","성장 배율 비교","역전 시점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"crossover_time","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"fa8f9309-94c1-51af-a633-1879d6adad01","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"6b2d6fd5-3856-5006-abfc-9d0b1f23895f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.chain2/initial_then_later_sum","group":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","passage":"The number of bacteria in a culture is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot 2^t$, where a is a positive constant and t is the number of days since the first measurement. The model gives N(2) = 60.","question":"What is the sum of the number at the first measurement and the number 4 days later?","options":["255","15","240","300"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) N(2) = a·2^2 = 60 이므로 4a = 60 이다. (2) a = 15 이고 a 는 N(0) 이다. (3) N(4) = 15·2^4 = 240 이다. (4) 두 값을 더한다. (5) N(0) + N(4) = 15 + 240 = 255 이다. 따라서 정답은 255이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the given value. (2) Solve for a, which is N(0). (3) Evaluate N at the later time. (4) Add the two values. (5) State the sum. So the answer is 255.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["한 시점의 값으로 초기값 a 를 구하고(앞 단계) 그 a 로 다른 시점의 값과 합을 계산(뒤 단계) — medium 은 초기값 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"한 시점의 값으로 초기값 a 를 구하고(앞 단계) 그 a 로 다른 시점의 값과 합을 계산(뒤 단계) — medium 은 초기값 하나","concepts":["지수함수의 초기값","연쇄 계산","함숫값"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"initial_then_later_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":255,"correctOption":"255"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"6b2d6fd5-3856-5006-abfc-9d0b1f23895f","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"56867ab7-0e1c-558f-a6af-d75bd5ac88d2","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio/growth_factor","group":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","passage":"The number of members of an online club is multiplied by 2 every 20 minutes.","question":"What is the factor by which the number changes in 1 hour?","options":["8","2","6","5"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 1 hour = 60 minutes 이고 60/20 = 3 번의 주기가 지난다. (2) 한 주기마다 2 배이므로 3 번 거듭하면 2^3 이다. (3) 2^3 를 계산한다. (4) 증가하므로 1 보다 큰 값이다. (5) 배율은 8 이다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Count how many periods fit in the larger unit. (2) Multiply the factor once per period. (3) Evaluate the power. (4) Check the direction of change. (5) State the factor. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["시간 단위 환산과 지수 법칙(주기 수 f/τ 만큼 거듭 곱함)을 결합하고 증가/감소 방향을 해석 — medium 은 한 주기 동안의 배율 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"시간 단위 환산과 지수 법칙(주기 수 f/τ 만큼 거듭 곱함)을 결합하고 증가/감소 방향을 해석 — medium 은 한 주기 동안의 배율 읽기","concepts":["단위 환산","성장·감소 배율","지수 법칙"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"growth_factor","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"56867ab7-0e1c-558f-a6af-d75bd5ac88d2","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"cc43cb98-cd60-5a91-af77-b8553c3eee88","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift/total_to_rate_increase","group":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","passage":"After 3 months, the number of followers of an account is 219.7% of its starting amount. It changed by the same percent each month.","question":"Each month, it increased by what percent?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["30"],"explanation":"(1) 매 기간 배율을 b 라 하면 3 기간 후 배율은 b^3 이다. (2) 219.7% = 2.197 이므로 b^3 = 2.197 이다. (3) 양변의 3 제곱근을 취하면 b = 1.3 이다. (4) b > 1 이므로 증가한다. (5) 변화율은 |b - 1|·100 = 30% 이다. 따라서 정답은 30이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let b be the factor per period. (2) Convert the percent to a factor. (3) Take the root. (4) Decide increase or decrease. (5) Convert back to a percent. So the answer is 30.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.583Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["전체 변화율을 기간당 변화율로 바꾸는 모델링(거듭제곱근, 증가/감소 판별) — medium 은 기간당 변화율에서 배율 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"전체 변화율을 기간당 변화율로 바꾸는 모델링(거듭제곱근, 증가/감소 판별) — medium 은 기간당 변화율에서 배율 읽기","concepts":["퍼센트 변화와 배율","거듭제곱근","증가·감소 해석"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"total_to_rate_increase","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":30,"correctOption":"30"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"cc43cb98-cd60-5a91-af77-b8553c3eee88","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"618ee3e5-2da0-511c-aa47-89fdfd5f596a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios/explicit_models_crossover","group":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","passage":"The membership of group A after t years is modeled by $A(t) = 49 \\cdot 3^t$, and the membership of group B after t years is modeled by $B(t) = 6 \\cdot 5^t$.","question":"For what least integer t is B(t) > A(t)?","options":["4","5","8","6"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A(t) = 49·3^t, B(t) = 6·5^t 이다. (2) t = 0 에서 A = 49 > B = 6 이다. (3) B 의 배율 5 가 A 의 배율 3 보다 커서 B 가 결국 따라잡는다. (4) t = 4 에서 A = 3969, B = 3750, t = 5 에서 A = 11907, B = 18750 이다. (5) B 가 처음 더 큰 t 는 5 이다. 따라서 정답은 5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both models. (2) Compare the starting values. (3) The larger growth factor eventually wins. (4) Compare consecutive values. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["밑(성장 배율)이 큰 쪽이 결국 앞선다는 해석과 역전 시점 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 배율 해석"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"밑(성장 배율)이 큰 쪽이 결국 앞선다는 해석과 역전 시점 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 배율 해석","concepts":["성장 배율 비교","지수 모델 비교","역전 시점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"explicit_models_crossover","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5,"correctOption":"5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"618ee3e5-2da0-511c-aa47-89fdfd5f596a","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a686cf5a-0536-5d68-a538-03c3e19bfdf4","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.inverse/total_factor_to_decrease","group":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","passage":"After 3 years, the number of cells in a sample is 1/64 of the starting number. The number was multiplied by the same factor each year.","question":"Each year, the number decreased by what percent?","options":["75","25","98","33"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 매 기간 배율을 b 라 하면 3 기간 후 배율은 b^3 이다. (2) b^3 = 1/64 이다. (3) 양변의 3 제곱근을 취하면 b = 1/4 이다. (4) b < 1 이므로 감소한다. (5) 변화율은 |b - 1|·100 = 75% 이다. 따라서 정답은 75이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let b be the per-period factor. (2) Set up the equation. (3) Take the root. (4) Decide increase or decrease. (5) Convert to a percent. So the answer is 75.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["총 변화 배율에서 기간당 배율을 거듭제곱근으로 역산하고 퍼센트 변화로 환산 — medium 은 기간당 배율에서 총 변화를 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"총 변화 배율에서 기간당 배율을 거듭제곱근으로 역산하고 퍼센트 변화로 환산 — medium 은 기간당 배율에서 총 변화를 계산","concepts":["거듭제곱근","성장 배율","퍼센트 변화"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"total_factor_to_decrease","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":75,"correctOption":"75"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a686cf5a-0536-5d68-a538-03c3e19bfdf4","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2dcbfd32-f020-5601-abea-ca2127c5bbfc","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.chain2/g_of_f","group":"nf.evaluate.chain2","passage":"The functions f and g are defined by the equations below. $f(x) = -x^2 + 2x + 4$ $g(x) = 4x + 5$","question":"What is the value of g(f(-1))?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["9"],"explanation":"(1) 안쪽부터 계산한다: f(-1) = -1·(-1)² + 2·(-1) + 4. (2) 제곱을 먼저 계산하면 -1·1 = -1 이다. (3) f(-1) = -1 + (-2) + 4 = 1 이다. (4) 이 값을 g 에 넣는다: g(1) = 4·1 + 5. (5) 계산하면 9 이다. 따라서 정답은 9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate the inner function first. (2) Square before multiplying. (3) Add the terms. (4) Use the result as the next input. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산","concepts":["함숫값","합성(연쇄 대입)","부호 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"g_of_f","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":9,"correctOption":"9"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"2dcbfd32-f020-5601-abea-ca2127c5bbfc","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"9e680a23-8330-5390-a020-3aa104081714","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind/difference_of_compositions","group":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","passage":"Two functions are given below. $f(x) = -x^2 + 3x$ $g(x) = -3x + 3$","question":"What is the value of f(g(1)) - g(f(1))?","options":["3","2","-3","0"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) g(1) = -3·1 + 3 = 0 이다. (2) f(g(1)) = f(0) = 0 이다. (3) f(1) = 2 이다. (4) g(f(1)) = g(2) = -3 이다. (5) 두 값의 차는 0 - (-3) = 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate g first. (2) Feed it into f. (3) Evaluate f(p). (4) Feed it into g. (5) Subtract. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값","concepts":["함수 합성","함숫값","순서의 비가환성"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"difference_of_compositions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"9e680a23-8330-5390-a020-3aa104081714","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f80da1c9-8053-5d72-a0a8-9547e3024829","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios/quadratic_vs_linear_threshold","group":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","passage":"The total cost, in dollars, of a cloud storage plan after t months is given by $A(t) = t^2 + t + 5$. The total cost of a drive rental plan after t months is given by $B(t) = 4t + 43$.","question":"For what is the least integer t such that A(t) > B(t)?","options":["9","8","6","7"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A(t) = t^2 + t + 5, B(t) = 4t + 43 이다. (2) A(0) = 5 < B(0) = 43 이므로 처음에는 A 가 더 싸다. (3) t 를 늘려 가며 두 값을 비교한다: t = 7 에서 A = 61, B = 71. (4) t = 8 에서 A = 77, B = 75 로 A 가 처음으로 더 크다. (5) 따라서 8 개월이다. 따라서 정답은 8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both cost models. (2) Compare at t = 0. (3) Compare just before the crossing. (4) Find the first t where A exceeds B. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 모델의 값을 비교해 임계 시점을 찾는 탐색(부등식·교차점 해석) — medium 은 한 모델의 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"두 모델의 값을 비교해 임계 시점을 찾는 탐색(부등식·교차점 해석) — medium 은 한 모델의 함숫값","concepts":["함숫값 비교","이차-일차 교차","임계점 탐색"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"quadratic_vs_linear_threshold","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":8,"correctOption":"8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f80da1c9-8053-5d72-a0a8-9547e3024829","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"167113d6-33b4-59c5-aa3d-0f86eea11380","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.inverse/vertex_and_point_inverse","group":"nf.vertex_x.inverse","passage":"For the function f defined below, b and c are constants. The graph of the function in the xy-plane has its vertex at x = -4 and passes through the point (4, -136).\n\n$f(x) = -3x^2 + bx + c$","question":"What is the value of b + c?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-16"],"explanation":"(1) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표는 -b/(2a) = -4 이다 (a = -3). (2) -b = 24 이므로 b = -24 이다. (3) 점 (4, -136) 를 대입한다: -3·4² + (-24)·4 + c = -136. (4) -48 + (-96) + c = -136 이므로 c = 8 이다. (5) b + c = -24 + 8 = -16 이다. 따라서 정답은 -16이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the vertex formula. (2) Solve for b. (3) Substitute the point. (4) Solve for c. (5) Add. So the answer is -16.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["꼭짓점 공식에서 b 를 역산하고 점의 좌표를 대입해 c 를 구하는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 표준형에서 꼭짓점 x좌표 -b/2a 를 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"꼭짓점 공식에서 b 를 역산하고 점의 좌표를 대입해 c 를 구하는 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 표준형에서 꼭짓점 x좌표 -b/2a 를 계산","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","점의 대입","계수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"vertex_and_point_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-16,"correctOption":"-16"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"167113d6-33b4-59c5-aa3d-0f86eea11380","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"581da896-0599-5218-aca9-9469ac92c92d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind/zeros_and_translation","group":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","passage":"A quadratic function f is given below: $f(x) = (x - 2)(x - 4)$. The function g is defined by $g(x) = f(x + 3) - 1$.","question":"What is the x-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of g in the xy-plane?","options":["-1","6","3","0"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 영점은 x = 2, 4 이다. (2) 영점의 중점이 꼭짓점의 x 좌표이므로 (2 + 4)/2 = 3 이다. (3) g(x) = f(x + 3) + (상수) 이므로 그래프는 오른쪽으로 -3 만큼 이동한다(음수면 왼쪽). (4) 위·아래 이동 e 는 꼭짓점의 y 좌표만 바꾼다. (5) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표는 3 + (-3) = 0 이다. 따라서 정답은 0이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Read the zeros of f. (2) The vertex lies midway between the zeros. (3) Interpret the horizontal shift. (4) The vertical shift does not change the x-coordinate. (5) Add the horizontal shift. So the answer is 0.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["영점의 중점이 꼭짓점이라는 성질과 평행이동(수평 이동만 x좌표에 영향)을 결합 — medium 은 표준형에서 -b/2a 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"영점의 중점이 꼭짓점이라는 성질과 평행이동(수평 이동만 x좌표에 영향)을 결합 — medium 은 표준형에서 -b/2a 계산","concepts":["영점과 대칭축","그래프 평행이동","꼭짓점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"zeros_and_translation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":0,"correctOption":"0"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"581da896-0599-5218-aca9-9469ac92c92d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"27f0a568-50bc-5a00-a1e1-d498cb128891","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift/four_sides","group":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","passage":"A farmer has 24 feet of fencing to build a rectangular garden bed. The fencing is used on all four sides. The width of the garden bed is x feet.","question":"The farmer wants the garden bed to have the greatest possible area. What should the width be, in feet?","options":["12","6","3","8"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 울타리는 폭 2개와 길이 2개에 쓰이므로 2x + 2(길이) = 24 이고 길이는 12 - x 이다. (2) 넓이 A(x) = x(12 - x) 이다. (3) 전개하면 A(x) = -x^2 + 12x 로 위로 볼록한 이차함수이다. (4) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표 = 12/(2·1) = 6 이다. (5) 폭은 6, 길이는 12 - 6 = 6 이므로 묻는 값은 6 이다. 따라서 정답은 6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Express the length with the fencing constraint. (2) Area is width times length. (3) Expand: a downward-opening quadratic. (4) The maximum occurs at the vertex. (5) Answer the question asked. So the answer is 6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["울타리 길이 조건을 식으로 모델링해 넓이 이차함수를 세우고 꼭짓점을 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 꼭짓점"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"울타리 길이 조건을 식으로 모델링해 넓이 이차함수를 세우고 꼭짓점을 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 꼭짓점","concepts":["문장 모델링(울타리·넓이)","이차함수의 최댓값 위치","꼭짓점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"four_sides","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6,"correctOption":"6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"27f0a568-50bc-5a00-a1e1-d498cb128891","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5f97f2a1-e97e-5500-a5c2-6bceee76b793","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.chain2/vertex_then_vertex","group":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","passage":"Let h be the x-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of the function f, where $f(x) = x^2 + 8x + 2$. A second function g is defined using h:\n\n$g(x) = -2x^2 + hx + 6$","question":"At what value of x does the graph of g have its vertex?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-1"],"explanation":"(1) f 의 꼭짓점 x 좌표 h = -(8)/(2·1) = -4 이다. (2) g(x) 에 h = -4 를 대입하면 g(x) = -2x^2 - 4x + 6 이다. (3) g 의 x 계수는 -4, x² 계수는 -2 이다. (4) 꼭짓점 공식: x = -(-4)/(2·-2). (5) 계산하면 -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find h with the vertex formula. (2) Substitute h into g. (3) Read the coefficients of g. (4) Apply the vertex formula to g. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 꼭짓점 좌표가 뒤 함수의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 함수의 꼭짓점 x좌표"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 꼭짓점 좌표가 뒤 함수의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 함수의 꼭짓점 x좌표","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","연쇄 대입","계수 해석"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"vertex_then_vertex","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5f97f2a1-e97e-5500-a5c2-6bceee76b793","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0a6b06b9-9b3a-563c-a35e-2aa885768b33","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.inverse/maximum_value","group":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","passage":"In the function below, b is a constant. The graph of the function in the xy-plane has its vertex at x = 5 and crosses the y-axis at the point (0, -9).\n\n$f(x) = -2x^2 + bx - 9$","question":"What is the maximum value of the function f?","options":["5","-9","41","-59"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 최고차 계수 -2 가 음수라 위로 볼록하므로 꼭짓점이 최댓값 이다. (2) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표가 5 이므로 -b/(2·-2) = 5, 즉 b = 20 이다. (3) y절편이 -9 이므로 상수항은 -9 이다. (4) f(5) = -2·25 + 20·5 + (-9). (5) 계산하면 41 이다. 따라서 정답은 41이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sign of a decides minimum or maximum. (2) Solve for b with the vertex formula. (3) Read the constant term. (4) Evaluate f at the vertex. (5) Compute. So the answer is 41.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.584Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["꼭짓점 위치 조건에서 b 를 역산하고 최대·최소 여부(a 의 부호)를 판단해 꼭짓점의 y 값을 구함 — medium 은 표준형의 최솟값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"꼭짓점 위치 조건에서 b 를 역산하고 최대·최소 여부(a 의 부호)를 판단해 꼭짓점의 y 값을 구함 — medium 은 표준형의 최솟값 계산","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","y절편","최대·최소 판단"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"maximum_value","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":41,"correctOption":"41"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"0a6b06b9-9b3a-563c-a35e-2aa885768b33","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"266b979e-e187-52e2-a91d-5ff801aa2b7c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind/scaled_max","group":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","passage":"The function f is defined by the equation below: $f(x) = x^2 + 2x - 2$. The function g is defined by $g(x) = -2f(x) - 1$.","question":"What is the maximum value of g?","options":["-4","6","5","-3"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f(x) = x^2 + 2x - 2 를 완전제곱식으로 쓰면 꼭짓점의 y 값(최솟값)은 -2 - 4/4 = -3 이다. (2) g(x) = -2f(x) - 1 이다. (3) u = -2 이므로 g 는 위로 볼록해 최댓값 을 가진다. (4) g 의 극값은 -2·(-3) - 1 이다. (5) 계산하면 5 이다. 따라서 정답은 5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the minimum of f. (2) Write g in terms of f. (3) A negative multiple flips the parabola. (4) Apply the transformation to the vertex value. (5) Compute. So the answer is 5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["함수의 상수배·평행이동이 꼭짓점의 y값에 어떻게 반영되는지(부호가 바뀌면 최소→최대)를 결합 — medium 은 한 함수의 최솟값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"함수의 상수배·평행이동이 꼭짓점의 y값에 어떻게 반영되는지(부호가 바뀌면 최소→최대)를 결합 — medium 은 한 함수의 최솟값","concepts":["완전제곱식(꼭짓점)","함수의 변환","최대·최소 판단"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"scaled_max","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5,"correctOption":"5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"266b979e-e187-52e2-a91d-5ff801aa2b7c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f3fa333d-a200-5913-a870-190d62795790","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift/maximize_revenue","group":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","passage":"A theater sells tickets at a price of p dollars per ticket. At that price, it sells 22 - 1p tickets per day.","question":"Over all prices, what is the greatest possible daily revenue, in dollars?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["121"],"explanation":"(1) 매출 = 가격 × 판매량 이므로 R(p) = p(22 - 1p) 이다. (2) 전개하면 R(p) = -1p² + 22p 로 위로 볼록한 이차함수이다. (3) 최대는 꼭짓점에서 생기고 p = 22/(2·1) = 11 이다. (4) R(11) = 11(22 - 1·11) 를 계산한다. (5) 최대 매출은 121 달러이다. 따라서 정답은 121이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Revenue is price times quantity. (2) Expand: a downward-opening quadratic. (3) The maximum is at the vertex. (4) Evaluate the revenue at that price. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 121.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(가격·판매량)에서 매출 이차함수를 모델링하고 꼭짓점의 y 값을 최대 매출로 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 최댓값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"문장(가격·판매량)에서 매출 이차함수를 모델링하고 꼭짓점의 y 값을 최대 매출로 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 최댓값","concepts":["문장 모델링(매출=가격×판매량)","이차함수 최댓값","꼭짓점 y 좌표"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"maximize_revenue","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":121,"correctOption":"121"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f3fa333d-a200-5913-a870-190d62795790","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3dae83c9-f58f-54f7-abce-2491ae7ab020","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios/compare_two_maxima","group":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","passage":"The heights, in feet, of two thrown balls t seconds after launch are modeled by the functions below.\n\n$h(t) = -2t^2 + 12t + 11$\n$k(t) = -2t^2 + 4t + 12$","question":"What is the difference, in feet, between the two maximum heights?","options":["2","1","43","15"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 번째 모델의 꼭짓점: t = -12/(2·(-2)) = 3, 최대 높이 29 이다. (2) 두 번째 모델의 꼭짓점: t = 1, 최대 높이 14 이다. (3) 두 최대 높이를 비교한다. (4) 더 큰 값 29 에서 작은 값 14 을 뺀다. (5) 차이는 15 피트이다. 따라서 정답은 15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Maximum of the first model. (2) Maximum of the second model. (3) Compare the two maxima. (4) Subtract the smaller maximum from the larger. (5) State the difference. So the answer is 15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 모델 각각의 꼭짓점 y 값을 구해 비교(두 경우의 최댓값 비교) — medium 은 한 모델의 최댓값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"두 모델 각각의 꼭짓점 y 값을 구해 비교(두 경우의 최댓값 비교) — medium 은 한 모델의 최댓값","concepts":["꼭짓점 y 값","두 모델 비교","차 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"compare_two_maxima","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":15,"correctOption":"15"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3dae83c9-f58f-54f7-abce-2491ae7ab020","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0846dac7-b69d-5b56-a4e3-2d42f7f1a3c6","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse/two_points_then_solve","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","passage":"The number of cells in a sample is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot b^t$, where a and b are positive constants and t is the number of days since the first measurement. The model gives N(1) = 16 and N(4) = 128.","question":"At what time t does the model give 256?","options":["4","6","32","5"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 값의 비: N(4)/N(1) = 128/16 = b^3 이다. (2) b^3 = 8 이므로 b = 2 이다. (3) N(1) = a·2^1 = 16 이므로 a = 8 이다. (4) 8·2^t = 256 에서 2^t = 32 이다. (5) 2^5 = 32 이므로 t = 5 이다. 따라서 정답은 5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Divide the two values. (2) Solve for b. (3) Solve for a. (4) Isolate the exponential. (5) Solve the exponent. So the answer is 5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 값의 비에서 b 를 역산하고 a 를 구한 뒤 지수 방정식을 푸는 3단 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 a, b 가 주어진 모델에서 시점을 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"두 값의 비에서 b 를 역산하고 a 를 구한 뒤 지수 방정식을 푸는 3단 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 a, b 가 주어진 모델에서 시점을 구함","concepts":["지수함수의 비","계수 역산","지수 방정식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"two_points_then_solve","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5,"correctOption":"5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"0846dac7-b69d-5b56-a4e3-2d42f7f1a3c6","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"7b43075d-07dd-5db7-af8e-2e0052ae8e2c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select/substitution_positive_root","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","passage":"The equation below has exactly one real solution. $3^{2x} - 20(3^{x}) - 189 = 0$","question":"What is the value of x that satisfies the equation?","options":["27","-7","4","3"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) u = 3^x 로 치환하면 3^(2x) = u² 이므로 $u^2 - 20u - 189 = 0$ 이다. (2) 인수분해하면 (u - 27)(u + 7) = 0 이므로 u = 27 또는 u = -7 이다. (3) 3^x 는 항상 양수이므로 u = -7 는 불가능하다. (4) 3^x = 27 이다. (5) 27 = 3^3 이므로 x = 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute u = b^x. (2) Factor. (3) An exponential is always positive. (4) Keep the positive root. (5) Solve the exponent. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환 후 나온 음수 u 는 b^x 가 될 수 없다는 제약으로 후보를 제거하고 지수 방정식을 풂 — medium 은 b^x = 상수 꼴을 한 번 풂"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"치환 후 나온 음수 u 는 b^x 가 될 수 없다는 제약으로 후보를 제거하고 지수 방정식을 풂 — medium 은 b^x = 상수 꼴을 한 번 풂","concepts":["치환(u=b^x)","이차방정식 인수분해","지수의 양수 제약"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"substitution_positive_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"7b43075d-07dd-5db7-af8e-2e0052ae8e2c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3c0ae65e-f663-5585-a1bc-806faf367a99","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2/exponent_solution_then_linear","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","passage":"The number of yeast cells in a dish t hours after a measurement begins is given by $P(t) = 8 \\cdot 2^t$. Let T be the time at which P(T) = 64. A second quantity is given by $Q(t) = -2t - 1$.","question":"What is Q(T)?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-7"],"explanation":"(1) P(T) = 8·2^T = 64 이므로 2^T = 8 이다. (2) 8 = 2^3 이므로 T = 3 이다. (3) Q(t) = -2t - 1 에 t = 3 를 대입한다. (4) Q(3) = -2·3 + (-1). (5) 계산하면 -7 이다. 따라서 정답은 -7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Isolate the exponential. (2) Solve the exponent. (3) Use T as the input of Q. (4) Substitute. (5) Compute. So the answer is -7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["지수 방정식의 해가 다른 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 지수 방정식의 해 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"지수 방정식의 해가 다른 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 지수 방정식의 해 한 번","concepts":["지수 방정식","일차함수의 값","연쇄 대입"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"exponent_solution_then_linear","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-7,"correctOption":"-7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3c0ae65e-f663-5585-a1bc-806faf367a99","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"29f82daf-aef8-5515-acdc-5fbdabee1198","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind/same_base_linear","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind","passage":"Consider the equation below. $2^{x + 3} = 2^{2x}$","question":"Find the value of x.","options":["4","-1","3","-3"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 2 = 2^1, 2 = 2^1 이므로 두 밑을 2 로 통일한다. (2) 좌변의 지수는 1(x + 3), 우변의 지수는 1(2x) 이다. (3) 밑이 같으므로 지수를 같게 놓는다. (4) 1x + 3 = 2x + 0 로 정리한다. (5) x 항을 모으면 -1x = -3 이므로 x = 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Rewrite both bases with the same prime. (2) Multiply the exponents by the base powers. (3) Equal bases mean equal exponents. (4) Write the linear equation. (5) Solve for x. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["밑을 통일(지수 법칙)하고 지수의 일차방정식을 세워 푸는 개념의 결합 — medium 은 한 변이 상수인 지수 방정식"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"밑을 통일(지수 법칙)하고 지수의 일차방정식을 세워 푸는 개념의 결합 — medium 은 한 변이 상수인 지수 방정식","concepts":["밑의 통일(지수 법칙)","일차방정식","지수 방정식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"same_base_linear","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"29f82daf-aef8-5515-acdc-5fbdabee1198","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a5e2c22f-adf0-5a62-ac3e-9c4fa66b5b72","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio/unit_conversion_initial_value","group":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio","passage":"The number of members of an online club is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot 2^{t/3}$, where a is a positive constant and t is the number of months since the first measurement. One year after the first measurement, the model gives a value of 832.","question":"What is the initial value of N?","options":["52","26","104","416"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 1 year = 12 months 이므로 t = 12 를 대입한다. (2) N(12) = a·2^(12/3) = a·2^4 이다. (3) 2^4 = 16 이므로 16a = 832 이다. (4) a = 832/16 = 52 이다. (5) a 는 t = 0 일 때의 값이므로 초기값은 52 이다. 따라서 정답은 52이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Convert one larger unit into the model's unit. (2) Substitute into the model. (3) Evaluate the power. (4) Solve for a. (5) a is the value at t = 0. So the answer is 52.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["시간 단위 환산(1일=24시간 등)으로 지수를 정리하고 a 가 t=0 의 값임을 해석 — medium 은 단위 환산 없이 초기값 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"시간 단위 환산(1일=24시간 등)으로 지수를 정리하고 a 가 t=0 의 값임을 해석 — medium 은 단위 환산 없이 초기값 읽기","concepts":["단위 환산","지수함수의 초기값","배가 주기"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"unit_conversion_initial_value","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":52,"correctOption":"52"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a5e2c22f-adf0-5a62-ac3e-9c4fa66b5b72","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2460ff57-d458-554f-ad61-22be72c5dbdc","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios/crossover_time","group":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","passage":"Colony A starts with 38 cells, and the number of cells is multiplied by 3 every hour. Colony B starts with 17 cells, and the number of cells is multiplied by 5 every hour.","question":"How many hours must pass before Colony B first has more cells than Colony A?","options":["0","1","2","3"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A 의 세포 수는 38·3^t, B 의 세포 수는 17·5^t 이다. (2) t = 0 에서는 A(38) > B(17) 이다. (3) t = 1 에서 A = 114, B = 85 로 아직 B 가 작거나 같다. (4) t = 2 에서 A = 342, B = 425 로 B 가 처음 더 크다. (5) 따라서 2 시간이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both models. (2) Compare the starting values. (3) Check just before the crossing. (4) Find the first t where B exceeds A. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["초기값이 서로 다른 두 지수 모델을 비교해 역전 시점을 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 초기값 해석"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"초기값이 서로 다른 두 지수 모델을 비교해 역전 시점을 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 초기값 해석","concepts":["초기값 비교","성장 배율 비교","역전 시점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"crossover_time","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"2460ff57-d458-554f-ad61-22be72c5dbdc","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"cafb1019-0e8d-5661-aac7-b522b3480603","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.chain2/initial_then_later_sum","group":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","passage":"The number of members of an online club is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot 2^t$, where a is a positive constant and t is the number of days since the first measurement. The model gives N(2) = 44.","question":"What is the sum of the number at the first measurement and the number 3 days later?","options":["132","11","88","99"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) N(2) = a·2^2 = 44 이므로 4a = 44 이다. (2) a = 11 이고 a 는 N(0) 이다. (3) N(3) = 11·2^3 = 88 이다. (4) 두 값을 더한다. (5) N(0) + N(3) = 11 + 88 = 99 이다. 따라서 정답은 99이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the given value. (2) Solve for a, which is N(0). (3) Evaluate N at the later time. (4) Add the two values. (5) State the sum. So the answer is 99.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["한 시점의 값으로 초기값 a 를 구하고(앞 단계) 그 a 로 다른 시점의 값과 합을 계산(뒤 단계) — medium 은 초기값 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"한 시점의 값으로 초기값 a 를 구하고(앞 단계) 그 a 로 다른 시점의 값과 합을 계산(뒤 단계) — medium 은 초기값 하나","concepts":["지수함수의 초기값","연쇄 계산","함숫값"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"initial_then_later_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":99,"correctOption":"99"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"cafb1019-0e8d-5661-aac7-b522b3480603","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"03d3b0ec-4e80-5deb-a2b7-853465879358","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio/growth_factor","group":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","passage":"The number of yeast cells in a dish is multiplied by 3 every 30 minutes.","question":"By what factor does the number change over 60 minutes (1 hour)?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["9"],"explanation":"(1) 1 hour = 60 minutes 이고 60/30 = 2 번의 주기가 지난다. (2) 한 주기마다 3 배이므로 2 번 거듭하면 3^2 이다. (3) 3^2 를 계산한다. (4) 증가하므로 1 보다 큰 값이다. (5) 배율은 9 이다. 따라서 정답은 9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Count how many periods fit in the larger unit. (2) Multiply the factor once per period. (3) Evaluate the power. (4) Check the direction of change. (5) State the factor. So the answer is 9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["시간 단위 환산과 지수 법칙(주기 수 f/τ 만큼 거듭 곱함)을 결합하고 증가/감소 방향을 해석 — medium 은 한 주기 동안의 배율 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"시간 단위 환산과 지수 법칙(주기 수 f/τ 만큼 거듭 곱함)을 결합하고 증가/감소 방향을 해석 — medium 은 한 주기 동안의 배율 읽기","concepts":["단위 환산","성장·감소 배율","지수 법칙"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"growth_factor","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":9,"correctOption":"9"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"03d3b0ec-4e80-5deb-a2b7-853465879358","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"54b2d142-4e09-5f05-ac0c-6116ab3b4913","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift/total_to_rate_decrease","group":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","passage":"After 3 months, the value of an investment is 2.7% of its starting amount. It changed by the same percent each month.","question":"Each month, it decreased by what percent?","options":["80","60","70","30"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 매 기간 배율을 b 라 하면 3 기간 후 배율은 b^3 이다. (2) 2.7% = 0.027000000000000003 이므로 b^3 = 0.027000000000000003 이다. (3) 양변의 3 제곱근을 취하면 b = 0.30000000000000004 이다. (4) b < 1 이므로 감소한다. (5) 변화율은 |b - 1|·100 = 70% 이다. 따라서 정답은 70이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let b be the factor per period. (2) Convert the percent to a factor. (3) Take the root. (4) Decide increase or decrease. (5) Convert back to a percent. So the answer is 70.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["전체 변화율을 기간당 변화율로 바꾸는 모델링(거듭제곱근, 증가/감소 판별) — medium 은 기간당 변화율에서 배율 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"전체 변화율을 기간당 변화율로 바꾸는 모델링(거듭제곱근, 증가/감소 판별) — medium 은 기간당 변화율에서 배율 읽기","concepts":["퍼센트 변화와 배율","거듭제곱근","증가·감소 해석"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"total_to_rate_decrease","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":70,"correctOption":"70"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"54b2d142-4e09-5f05-ac0c-6116ab3b4913","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"78f2a7c1-a915-5ef0-a789-cb0f1fc91628","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios/explicit_models_crossover","group":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","passage":"The value of fund A after t years is modeled by $A(t) = 46 \\cdot 2^t$, and the value of fund B after t years is modeled by $B(t) = 10 \\cdot 4^t$.","question":"After how many whole years does the second model first exceed the first?","options":["3","4","2","5"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A(t) = 46·2^t, B(t) = 10·4^t 이다. (2) t = 0 에서 A = 46 > B = 10 이다. (3) B 의 배율 4 가 A 의 배율 2 보다 커서 B 가 결국 따라잡는다. (4) t = 2 에서 A = 184, B = 160, t = 3 에서 A = 368, B = 640 이다. (5) B 가 처음 더 큰 t 는 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both models. (2) Compare the starting values. (3) The larger growth factor eventually wins. (4) Compare consecutive values. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.585Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["밑(성장 배율)이 큰 쪽이 결국 앞선다는 해석과 역전 시점 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 배율 해석"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"밑(성장 배율)이 큰 쪽이 결국 앞선다는 해석과 역전 시점 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 배율 해석","concepts":["성장 배율 비교","지수 모델 비교","역전 시점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"explicit_models_crossover","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"78f2a7c1-a915-5ef0-a789-cb0f1fc91628","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4126e734-4f81-50d9-a9ae-ecc83542a862","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.inverse/total_factor_to_increase","group":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","passage":"After 6 years, the number of yeast cells in a dish is 64 times the starting number. The number was multiplied by the same factor each year.","question":"Each year, the number increased by what percent?","options":["100","6400","6300","200"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 매 기간 배율을 b 라 하면 6 기간 후 배율은 b^6 이다. (2) b^6 = 64 이다. (3) 양변의 6 제곱근을 취하면 b = 2 이다. (4) b > 1 이므로 증가한다. (5) 변화율은 |b - 1|·100 = 100% 이다. 따라서 정답은 100이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let b be the per-period factor. (2) Set up the equation. (3) Take the root. (4) Decide increase or decrease. (5) Convert to a percent. So the answer is 100.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["총 변화 배율에서 기간당 배율을 거듭제곱근으로 역산하고 퍼센트 변화로 환산 — medium 은 기간당 배율에서 총 변화를 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"총 변화 배율에서 기간당 배율을 거듭제곱근으로 역산하고 퍼센트 변화로 환산 — medium 은 기간당 배율에서 총 변화를 계산","concepts":["거듭제곱근","성장 배율","퍼센트 변화"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"total_factor_to_increase","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":100,"correctOption":"100"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4126e734-4f81-50d9-a9ae-ecc83542a862","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"6e01aa0c-445d-5401-a5f7-e0ece13a80c5","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.chain2/f_of_f","group":"nf.evaluate.chain2","passage":"The function f is defined by the equation below. $f(x) = -2x^2 + 3x - 3$","question":"What is f(f(3))?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-327"],"explanation":"(1) 안쪽부터 계산한다: f(3) = -2·3² + 3·3 + (-3). (2) 제곱을 먼저 계산하면 -2·9 = -18 이다. (3) f(3) = -18 + 9 + (-3) = -12 이다. (4) 이 값을 다시 f 에 넣는다: f(-12) = -2·(-12)² + 3·(-12) + (-3). (5) 계산하면 -327 이다. 따라서 정답은 -327이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate the inner function first. (2) Square before multiplying. (3) Add the terms. (4) Use the result as the next input. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is -327.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산","concepts":["함숫값","합성(연쇄 대입)","부호 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"f_of_f","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-327,"correctOption":"-327"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"6e01aa0c-445d-5401-a5f7-e0ece13a80c5","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"fd58a669-dd5c-5e90-a65d-1c14bad14298","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind/difference_of_compositions","group":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","passage":"Let f and g be the functions defined below. $f(x) = -x^2 + x$ $g(x) = 4x + 3$","question":"Find f(g(2)) - g(f(2)).","options":["-110","-5","-105","105"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) g(2) = 4·2 + 3 = 11 이다. (2) f(g(2)) = f(11) = -110 이다. (3) f(2) = -2 이다. (4) g(f(2)) = g(-2) = -5 이다. (5) 두 값의 차는 -110 - (-5) = -105 이다. 따라서 정답은 -105이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate g first. (2) Feed it into f. (3) Evaluate f(p). (4) Feed it into g. (5) Subtract. So the answer is -105.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값","concepts":["함수 합성","함숫값","순서의 비가환성"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"difference_of_compositions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-105,"correctOption":"-105"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"fd58a669-dd5c-5e90-a65d-1c14bad14298","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b811069c-580c-5eb0-a846-10531bf2ddbd","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift/table_to_formula","group":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","passage":"A quadratic function f has the values below: f(0) = -5, f(1) = -1, and f(2) = 7.","question":"What is f(4)?","options":["55","15","19","35"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f(0) = -5 이므로 상수항은 -5 이다. (2) f(x) = ax² + bx + -5 에서 f(1) = a + b + -5 = -1 이므로 a + b = 4 이다. (3) f(2) = 4a + 2b + -5 = 7 이므로 2a + b = 6 이다. (4) 두 식을 빼면 a = 2, b = 2 이다. (5) f(x) = 2x^2 + 2x - 5 이므로 f(4) = 35 이다. 따라서 정답은 35이다.","explanationEn":"(1) f(0) is the constant term. (2) Use f(1). (3) Use f(2). (4) Solve for a and b. (5) Evaluate at the new input. So the answer is 35.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표(값)에서 이차함수 식을 세우는 모델링(상수항, 일차·이차 계수 연립) 후 새 입력에서 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"표(값)에서 이차함수 식을 세우는 모델링(상수항, 일차·이차 계수 연립) 후 새 입력에서 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함숫값","concepts":["표에서 식 세우기","이차함수 계수 결정","함숫값"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"table_to_formula","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":35,"correctOption":"35"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b811069c-580c-5eb0-a846-10531bf2ddbd","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b697fbfd-033e-5dee-a4dc-e90de24c86d3","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios/quadratic_vs_linear_threshold","group":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","passage":"The total cost, in dollars, of a streaming bundle after t months is given by $A(t) = t^2 + 4t + 15$. The total cost of a streaming plan after t months is given by $B(t) = 4t + 53$.","question":"For what is the least integer t such that A(t) > B(t)?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["7"],"explanation":"(1) A(t) = t^2 + 4t + 15, B(t) = 4t + 53 이다. (2) A(0) = 15 < B(0) = 53 이므로 처음에는 A 가 더 싸다. (3) t 를 늘려 가며 두 값을 비교한다: t = 6 에서 A = 75, B = 77. (4) t = 7 에서 A = 92, B = 81 로 A 가 처음으로 더 크다. (5) 따라서 7 개월이다. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both cost models. (2) Compare at t = 0. (3) Compare just before the crossing. (4) Find the first t where A exceeds B. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 모델의 값을 비교해 임계 시점을 찾는 탐색(부등식·교차점 해석) — medium 은 한 모델의 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"두 모델의 값을 비교해 임계 시점을 찾는 탐색(부등식·교차점 해석) — medium 은 한 모델의 함숫값","concepts":["함숫값 비교","이차-일차 교차","임계점 탐색"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"quadratic_vs_linear_threshold","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b697fbfd-033e-5dee-a4dc-e90de24c86d3","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"066e7f2d-8b1b-5be1-a52c-70652af59fe7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind/zeros_and_translation","group":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","passage":"Let f be the function defined below: $f(x) = (x + 5)(x - 5)$. A second function is $g(x) = f(x + 5) - 6$.","question":"At what value of x does the graph of g have its vertex?","options":["-5","5","0","-11"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 영점은 x = -5, 5 이다. (2) 영점의 중점이 꼭짓점의 x 좌표이므로 (-5 + 5)/2 = 0 이다. (3) g(x) = f(x + 5) + (상수) 이므로 그래프는 오른쪽으로 -5 만큼 이동한다(음수면 왼쪽). (4) 위·아래 이동 e 는 꼭짓점의 y 좌표만 바꾼다. (5) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표는 0 + (-5) = -5 이다. 따라서 정답은 -5이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Read the zeros of f. (2) The vertex lies midway between the zeros. (3) Interpret the horizontal shift. (4) The vertical shift does not change the x-coordinate. (5) Add the horizontal shift. So the answer is -5.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["영점의 중점이 꼭짓점이라는 성질과 평행이동(수평 이동만 x좌표에 영향)을 결합 — medium 은 표준형에서 -b/2a 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"영점의 중점이 꼭짓점이라는 성질과 평행이동(수평 이동만 x좌표에 영향)을 결합 — medium 은 표준형에서 -b/2a 계산","concepts":["영점과 대칭축","그래프 평행이동","꼭짓점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"zeros_and_translation","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-5,"correctOption":"-5"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"066e7f2d-8b1b-5be1-a52c-70652af59fe7","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"842aa4f2-c8f7-53bc-ac9e-cc8972350b85","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift/three_sides_barn","group":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","passage":"A farmer has 28 feet of fencing to build a rectangular dog run along one side of a barn. The fencing is used on the three sides that are not the barn wall. The width of the dog run, the side perpendicular to the barn, is x feet.","question":"For the greatest possible area, what is the length of the dog run, in feet?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["14"],"explanation":"(1) 울타리는 폭 2개와 길이 1개에 쓰이므로 2x + (길이) = 28 이고 길이는 28 - 2x 이다. (2) 넓이 A(x) = x(28 - 2x) 이다. (3) 전개하면 A(x) = -2x^2 + 28x 로 위로 볼록한 이차함수이다. (4) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표 = 28/(2·2) = 7 이다. (5) 폭은 7, 길이는 28 - 27 = 14 이므로 묻는 값은 14 이다. 따라서 정답은 14이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Express the length with the fencing constraint. (2) Area is width times length. (3) Expand: a downward-opening quadratic. (4) The maximum occurs at the vertex. (5) Answer the question asked. So the answer is 14.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["울타리 길이 조건을 식으로 모델링해 넓이 이차함수를 세우고 꼭짓점을 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 꼭짓점"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"울타리 길이 조건을 식으로 모델링해 넓이 이차함수를 세우고 꼭짓점을 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 꼭짓점","concepts":["문장 모델링(울타리·넓이)","이차함수의 최댓값 위치","꼭짓점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"three_sides_barn","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":14,"correctOption":"14"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"842aa4f2-c8f7-53bc-ac9e-cc8972350b85","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4f277087-7dcb-5df7-af41-088fdb6084f0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_x.chain2/vertex_then_vertex","group":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","passage":"Let h represent the x-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of f, where $f(x) = x^2 + 8x - 3$. The function g is defined below, where h is that value:\n\n$g(x) = 2x^2 + hx - 6$","question":"What is the x-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of y = g(x)?","options":["-4","1","-1","2"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f 의 꼭짓점 x 좌표 h = -(8)/(2·1) = -4 이다. (2) g(x) 에 h = -4 를 대입하면 g(x) = 2x^2 - 4x - 6 이다. (3) g 의 x 계수는 -4, x² 계수는 2 이다. (4) 꼭짓점 공식: x = -(-4)/(2·2). (5) 계산하면 1 이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find h with the vertex formula. (2) Substitute h into g. (3) Read the coefficients of g. (4) Apply the vertex formula to g. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 꼭짓점 좌표가 뒤 함수의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 함수의 꼭짓점 x좌표"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"vertex_x","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 꼭짓점 좌표가 뒤 함수의 계수가 되는 2단계 연쇄 — medium 은 한 함수의 꼭짓점 x좌표","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","연쇄 대입","계수 해석"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"vertex_then_vertex","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4f277087-7dcb-5df7-af41-088fdb6084f0","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_x.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a6f535d8-0b7f-58bb-ae4f-cf74f0598299","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.inverse/maximum_value","group":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","passage":"Consider the function below, b is a constant. The graph of the function in the xy-plane has its vertex at x = -1 and crosses the y-axis at the point (0, -1).\n\n$f(x) = -3x^2 + bx - 1$","question":"Find the maximum value of f.","options":["-4","-2","2","-1"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 최고차 계수 -3 가 음수라 위로 볼록하므로 꼭짓점이 최댓값 이다. (2) 꼭짓점의 x 좌표가 -1 이므로 -b/(2·-3) = -1, 즉 b = -6 이다. (3) y절편이 -1 이므로 상수항은 -1 이다. (4) f(-1) = -3·1 + (-6)·(-1) + (-1). (5) 계산하면 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The sign of a decides minimum or maximum. (2) Solve for b with the vertex formula. (3) Read the constant term. (4) Evaluate f at the vertex. (5) Compute. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["꼭짓점 위치 조건에서 b 를 역산하고 최대·최소 여부(a 의 부호)를 판단해 꼭짓점의 y 값을 구함 — medium 은 표준형의 최솟값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"꼭짓점 위치 조건에서 b 를 역산하고 최대·최소 여부(a 의 부호)를 판단해 꼭짓점의 y 값을 구함 — medium 은 표준형의 최솟값 계산","concepts":["꼭짓점 공식","y절편","최대·최소 판단"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"maximum_value","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a6f535d8-0b7f-58bb-ae4f-cf74f0598299","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"01d28483-bb64-58e8-a337-e36a281d6475","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind/scaled_max","group":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","passage":"Let f be the function defined below: $f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 5$. The function g is defined by $g(x) = -2f(x) - 1$.","question":"What is the maximum value of g?","options":["-2","-3","1","0"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 5 를 완전제곱식으로 쓰면 꼭짓점의 y 값(최솟값)은 5 - 16/4 = 1 이다. (2) g(x) = -2f(x) - 1 이다. (3) u = -2 이므로 g 는 위로 볼록해 최댓값 을 가진다. (4) g 의 극값은 -2·1 - 1 이다. (5) 계산하면 -3 이다. 따라서 정답은 -3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the minimum of f. (2) Write g in terms of f. (3) A negative multiple flips the parabola. (4) Apply the transformation to the vertex value. (5) Compute. So the answer is -3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["함수의 상수배·평행이동이 꼭짓점의 y값에 어떻게 반영되는지(부호가 바뀌면 최소→최대)를 결합 — medium 은 한 함수의 최솟값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"함수의 상수배·평행이동이 꼭짓점의 y값에 어떻게 반영되는지(부호가 바뀌면 최소→최대)를 결합 — medium 은 한 함수의 최솟값","concepts":["완전제곱식(꼭짓점)","함수의 변환","최대·최소 판단"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"scaled_max","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-3,"correctOption":"-3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"01d28483-bb64-58e8-a337-e36a281d6475","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a8000524-9501-578a-ab80-4c63ec9f752a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift/maximize_revenue","group":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","passage":"A theater sells tickets at a price of p dollars per ticket. At that price, it sells 26 - 1p tickets per day.","question":"Over all prices, what is the greatest possible daily revenue, in dollars?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["169"],"explanation":"(1) 매출 = 가격 × 판매량 이므로 R(p) = p(26 - 1p) 이다. (2) 전개하면 R(p) = -1p² + 26p 로 위로 볼록한 이차함수이다. (3) 최대는 꼭짓점에서 생기고 p = 26/(2·1) = 13 이다. (4) R(13) = 13(26 - 1·13) 를 계산한다. (5) 최대 매출은 169 달러이다. 따라서 정답은 169이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Revenue is price times quantity. (2) Expand: a downward-opening quadratic. (3) The maximum is at the vertex. (4) Evaluate the revenue at that price. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 169.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.586Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장(가격·판매량)에서 매출 이차함수를 모델링하고 꼭짓점의 y 값을 최대 매출로 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 최댓값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"문장(가격·판매량)에서 매출 이차함수를 모델링하고 꼭짓점의 y 값을 최대 매출로 해석 — medium 은 이미 식으로 주어진 함수의 최댓값","concepts":["문장 모델링(매출=가격×판매량)","이차함수 최댓값","꼭짓점 y 좌표"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"maximize_revenue","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":169,"correctOption":"169"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a8000524-9501-578a-ab80-4c63ec9f752a","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"19e538f7-65fe-59ac-acc9-51dac23865de","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios/compare_two_maxima","group":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","passage":"The heights, in feet, of two rockets t seconds after launch are modeled by the functions below.\n\n$h(t) = -t^2 + 12t + 11$\n$k(t) = -t^2 + 10t + 7$","question":"What is the difference, in feet, between the two maximum heights?","options":["4","1","79","15"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 번째 모델의 꼭짓점: t = -12/(2·(-1)) = 6, 최대 높이 47 이다. (2) 두 번째 모델의 꼭짓점: t = 5, 최대 높이 32 이다. (3) 두 최대 높이를 비교한다. (4) 더 큰 값 47 에서 작은 값 32 을 뺀다. (5) 차이는 15 피트이다. 따라서 정답은 15이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Maximum of the first model. (2) Maximum of the second model. (3) Compare the two maxima. (4) Subtract the smaller maximum from the larger. (5) State the difference. So the answer is 15.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 모델 각각의 꼭짓점 y 값을 구해 비교(두 경우의 최댓값 비교) — medium 은 한 모델의 최댓값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"vertex_y","extraThinking":"두 모델 각각의 꼭짓점 y 값을 구해 비교(두 경우의 최댓값 비교) — medium 은 한 모델의 최댓값","concepts":["꼭짓점 y 값","두 모델 비교","차 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"compare_two_maxima","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":15,"correctOption":"15"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"19e538f7-65fe-59ac-acc9-51dac23865de","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.vertex_y.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"29b08b3b-b713-5f68-aaff-73be2733aa44","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse/two_points_then_solve","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","passage":"The number of members of an online club is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot b^t$, where a and b are positive constants and t is the number of days since the first measurement. The model gives N(0) = 9 and N(3) = 72.","question":"At what time t does the model give 576?","options":["7","6","5","3"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 두 값의 비: N(3)/N(0) = 72/9 = b^3 이다. (2) b^3 = 8 이므로 b = 2 이다. (3) N(0) = a·2^0 = 9 이므로 a = 9 이다. (4) 9·2^t = 576 에서 2^t = 64 이다. (5) 2^6 = 64 이므로 t = 6 이다. 따라서 정답은 6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Divide the two values. (2) Solve for b. (3) Solve for a. (4) Isolate the exponential. (5) Solve the exponent. So the answer is 6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 값의 비에서 b 를 역산하고 a 를 구한 뒤 지수 방정식을 푸는 3단 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 a, b 가 주어진 모델에서 시점을 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"두 값의 비에서 b 를 역산하고 a 를 구한 뒤 지수 방정식을 푸는 3단 역방향 재구성 — medium 은 a, b 가 주어진 모델에서 시점을 구함","concepts":["지수함수의 비","계수 역산","지수 방정식"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"two_points_then_solve","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6,"correctOption":"6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"29b08b3b-b713-5f68-aaff-73be2733aa44","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"da3be791-5e67-5c46-a543-e09384228f64","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select/substitution_positive_root","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","passage":"For the equation shown, x is a real number. $3^{2x} + 4(3^{x}) - 21 = 0$","question":"Find the real solution of the equation.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["1"],"explanation":"(1) u = 3^x 로 치환하면 3^(2x) = u² 이므로 $u^2 + 4u - 21 = 0$ 이다. (2) 인수분해하면 (u - 3)(u + 7) = 0 이므로 u = 3 또는 u = -7 이다. (3) 3^x 는 항상 양수이므로 u = -7 는 불가능하다. (4) 3^x = 3 이다. (5) 3 = 3^1 이므로 x = 1 이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute u = b^x. (2) Factor. (3) An exponential is always positive. (4) Keep the positive root. (5) Solve the exponent. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["치환 후 나온 음수 u 는 b^x 가 될 수 없다는 제약으로 후보를 제거하고 지수 방정식을 풂 — medium 은 b^x = 상수 꼴을 한 번 풂"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"치환 후 나온 음수 u 는 b^x 가 될 수 없다는 제약으로 후보를 제거하고 지수 방정식을 풂 — medium 은 b^x = 상수 꼴을 한 번 풂","concepts":["치환(u=b^x)","이차방정식 인수분해","지수의 양수 제약"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"substitution_positive_root","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"da3be791-5e67-5c46-a543-e09384228f64","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"14c8be34-6d7a-5f85-a532-d1f22e839f65","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2/exponent_solution_then_linear","group":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","passage":"The number of members of an online club t hours after a measurement begins is given by $P(t) = 3 \\cdot 2^t$. Let T be the time at which P(T) = 24. A second quantity is given by $Q(t) = t - 9$.","question":"What is the value of Q(T)?","options":["3","15","-5","-6"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) P(T) = 3·2^T = 24 이므로 2^T = 8 이다. (2) 8 = 2^3 이므로 T = 3 이다. (3) Q(t) = t - 9 에 t = 3 를 대입한다. (4) Q(3) = 1·3 + (-9). (5) 계산하면 -6 이다. 따라서 정답은 -6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Isolate the exponential. (2) Solve the exponent. (3) Use T as the input of Q. (4) Substitute. (5) Compute. So the answer is -6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["지수 방정식의 해가 다른 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 지수 방정식의 해 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"지수 방정식의 해가 다른 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 — medium 은 지수 방정식의 해 한 번","concepts":["지수 방정식","일차함수의 값","연쇄 대입"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820000,"variant":"exponent_solution_then_linear","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-6,"correctOption":"-6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"14c8be34-6d7a-5f85-a532-d1f22e839f65","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.find_x_for_value.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"acee17b0-0c37-5a41-aeb6-1c3472127cce","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios/crossover_time","group":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","passage":"Colony A starts with 35 cells, and the number of cells is multiplied by 2 every hour. Colony B starts with 16 cells, and the number of cells is multiplied by 4 every hour.","question":"How many hours must pass before Colony B first has more cells than Colony A?","options":["0","3","1","2"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A 의 세포 수는 35·2^t, B 의 세포 수는 16·4^t 이다. (2) t = 0 에서는 A(35) > B(16) 이다. (3) t = 1 에서 A = 70, B = 64 로 아직 B 가 작거나 같다. (4) t = 2 에서 A = 140, B = 256 로 B 가 처음 더 크다. (5) 따라서 2 시간이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both models. (2) Compare the starting values. (3) Check just before the crossing. (4) Find the first t where B exceeds A. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["초기값이 서로 다른 두 지수 모델을 비교해 역전 시점을 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 초기값 해석"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"초기값이 서로 다른 두 지수 모델을 비교해 역전 시점을 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 초기값 해석","concepts":["초기값 비교","성장 배율 비교","역전 시점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"crossover_time","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"acee17b0-0c37-5a41-aeb6-1c3472127cce","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d90de010-175d-59cc-a0b1-c9e66005d07c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_a.chain2/initial_then_later_sum","group":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","passage":"The number of followers of an online account is modeled by the function $N(t) = a \\cdot 2^t$, where a is a positive constant and t is the number of days since the first measurement. The model gives N(3) = 120.","question":"What is the value of N(0) + N(6)?","options":["15","975","1080","960"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) N(3) = a·2^3 = 120 이므로 8a = 120 이다. (2) a = 15 이고 a 는 N(0) 이다. (3) N(6) = 15·2^6 = 960 이다. (4) 두 값을 더한다. (5) N(0) + N(6) = 15 + 960 = 975 이다. 따라서 정답은 975이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Use the given value. (2) Solve for a, which is N(0). (3) Evaluate N at the later time. (4) Add the two values. (5) State the sum. So the answer is 975.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["한 시점의 값으로 초기값 a 를 구하고(앞 단계) 그 a 로 다른 시점의 값과 합을 계산(뒤 단계) — medium 은 초기값 하나"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"interpret_a","extraThinking":"한 시점의 값으로 초기값 a 를 구하고(앞 단계) 그 a 로 다른 시점의 값과 합을 계산(뒤 단계) — medium 은 초기값 하나","concepts":["지수함수의 초기값","연쇄 계산","함숫값"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"initial_then_later_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":975,"correctOption":"975"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d90de010-175d-59cc-a0b1-c9e66005d07c","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_a.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"a5fc17df-114d-557c-a43f-affaf4b483cc","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio/growth_factor","group":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","passage":"The number of yeast cells in a dish is multiplied by 3 every 12 hours.","question":"By what factor does the number change over 24 hours (1 day)?","options":["5","9","6","3"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 1 day = 24 hours 이고 24/12 = 2 번의 주기가 지난다. (2) 한 주기마다 3 배이므로 2 번 거듭하면 3^2 이다. (3) 3^2 를 계산한다. (4) 증가하므로 1 보다 큰 값이다. (5) 배율은 9 이다. 따라서 정답은 9이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Count how many periods fit in the larger unit. (2) Multiply the factor once per period. (3) Evaluate the power. (4) Check the direction of change. (5) State the factor. So the answer is 9.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["시간 단위 환산과 지수 법칙(주기 수 f/τ 만큼 거듭 곱함)을 결합하고 증가/감소 방향을 해석 — medium 은 한 주기 동안의 배율 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","operator":"unit_ratio","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"시간 단위 환산과 지수 법칙(주기 수 f/τ 만큼 거듭 곱함)을 결합하고 증가/감소 방향을 해석 — medium 은 한 주기 동안의 배율 읽기","concepts":["단위 환산","성장·감소 배율","지수 법칙"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"growth_factor","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":9,"correctOption":"9"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"a5fc17df-114d-557c-a43f-affaf4b483cc","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.unit_ratio","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"29e173c4-f003-56af-abbc-abc653020f0b","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift/total_to_rate_increase","group":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","passage":"After 3 months, the population of a town is 172.8% of its starting amount. It changed by the same percent each month.","question":"Each month, it increased by what percent?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["20"],"explanation":"(1) 매 기간 배율을 b 라 하면 3 기간 후 배율은 b^3 이다. (2) 172.8% = 1.7280000000000002 이므로 b^3 = 1.7280000000000002 이다. (3) 양변의 3 제곱근을 취하면 b = 1.2 이다. (4) b > 1 이므로 증가한다. (5) 변화율은 |b - 1|·100 = 20% 이다. 따라서 정답은 20이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let b be the factor per period. (2) Convert the percent to a factor. (3) Take the root. (4) Decide increase or decrease. (5) Convert back to a percent. So the answer is 20.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["전체 변화율을 기간당 변화율로 바꾸는 모델링(거듭제곱근, 증가/감소 판별) — medium 은 기간당 변화율에서 배율 읽기"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"전체 변화율을 기간당 변화율로 바꾸는 모델링(거듭제곱근, 증가/감소 판별) — medium 은 기간당 변화율에서 배율 읽기","concepts":["퍼센트 변화와 배율","거듭제곱근","증가·감소 해석"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820001,"variant":"total_to_rate_increase","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":20,"correctOption":"20"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"29e173c4-f003-56af-abbc-abc653020f0b","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"104afd49-20be-50ce-a2ec-b9cecc170bf6","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios/explicit_models_crossover","group":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","passage":"The account value of plan A after t years is modeled by $A(t) = 18 \\cdot 3^t$, and the account value of plan B after t years is modeled by $B(t) = 9 \\cdot 5^t$.","question":"What is the smallest whole number t for which B(t) is greater than A(t)?","options":["1","4","3","2"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) A(t) = 18·3^t, B(t) = 9·5^t 이다. (2) t = 0 에서 A = 18 > B = 9 이다. (3) B 의 배율 5 가 A 의 배율 3 보다 커서 B 가 결국 따라잡는다. (4) t = 1 에서 A = 54, B = 45, t = 2 에서 A = 162, B = 225 이다. (5) B 가 처음 더 큰 t 는 2 이다. 따라서 정답은 2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Write both models. (2) Compare the starting values. (3) The larger growth factor eventually wins. (4) Compare consecutive values. (5) State the answer. So the answer is 2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["밑(성장 배율)이 큰 쪽이 결국 앞선다는 해석과 역전 시점 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 배율 해석"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"밑(성장 배율)이 큰 쪽이 결국 앞선다는 해석과 역전 시점 탐색 — medium 은 한 모델의 배율 해석","concepts":["성장 배율 비교","지수 모델 비교","역전 시점"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"explicit_models_crossover","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":2,"correctOption":"2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"104afd49-20be-50ce-a2ec-b9cecc170bf6","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8db422a1-5f34-5f62-a76d-79e53b12e617","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.interpret_b.inverse/total_factor_to_increase","group":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","passage":"After 2 weeks, the number of cells in a sample is 9 times the starting number. The number was multiplied by the same factor each week.","question":"By what percent did the number increase each week?","options":["200","300","800","900"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 매 기간 배율을 b 라 하면 2 기간 후 배율은 b^2 이다. (2) b^2 = 9 이다. (3) 양변의 2 제곱근을 취하면 b = 3 이다. (4) b > 1 이므로 증가한다. (5) 변화율은 |b - 1|·100 = 200% 이다. 따라서 정답은 200이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Let b be the per-period factor. (2) Set up the equation. (3) Take the root. (4) Decide increase or decrease. (5) Convert to a percent. So the answer is 200.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["총 변화 배율에서 기간당 배율을 거듭제곱근으로 역산하고 퍼센트 변화로 환산 — medium 은 기간당 배율에서 총 변화를 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"interpret_b","extraThinking":"총 변화 배율에서 기간당 배율을 거듭제곱근으로 역산하고 퍼센트 변화로 환산 — medium 은 기간당 배율에서 총 변화를 계산","concepts":["거듭제곱근","성장 배율","퍼센트 변화"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"total_factor_to_increase","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":200,"correctOption":"200"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"8db422a1-5f34-5f62-a76d-79e53b12e617","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.interpret_b.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"0cfb580a-9f91-584f-a41d-a5e8468a895d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.chain2/f_of_f","group":"nf.evaluate.chain2","passage":"The function f is defined by the equation below. $f(x) = x^2 + 5x + 4$","question":"Find f(f(1)).","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["154"],"explanation":"(1) 안쪽부터 계산한다: f(1) = 1·1² + 5·1 + 4. (2) 제곱을 먼저 계산하면 1·1 = 1 이다. (3) f(1) = 1 + 5 + 4 = 10 이다. (4) 이 값을 다시 f 에 넣는다: f(10) = 1·10² + 5·10 + 4. (5) 계산하면 154 이다. 따라서 정답은 154이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate the inner function first. (2) Square before multiplying. (3) Add the terms. (4) Use the result as the next input. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is 154.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"앞 단계의 함숫값이 다음 함수의 입력이 되는 연쇄 대입과 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값 계산","concepts":["함숫값","합성(연쇄 대입)","부호 처리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"f_of_f","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":154,"correctOption":"154"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"0cfb580a-9f91-584f-a41d-a5e8468a895d","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2a9d55ad-e886-58fe-adc1-5a5f227d0aeb","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind/difference_of_compositions","group":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","passage":"Two functions are given below. $f(x) = x^2 + 4x$ $g(x) = 4x - 2$","question":"What is the value of f(g(1)) - g(f(1))?","options":["6","-6","18","12"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) g(1) = 4·1 + (-2) = 2 이다. (2) f(g(1)) = f(2) = 12 이다. (3) f(1) = 5 이다. (4) g(f(1)) = g(5) = 18 이다. (5) 두 값의 차는 12 - 18 = -6 이다. 따라서 정답은 -6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate g first. (2) Feed it into f. (3) Evaluate f(p). (4) Feed it into g. (5) Subtract. So the answer is -6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"합성의 순서가 결과를 바꾼다는 개념과 두 번의 합성 계산, 부호 처리 — medium 은 한 번의 함숫값","concepts":["함수 합성","함숫값","순서의 비가환성"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820002,"variant":"difference_of_compositions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-6,"correctOption":"-6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"2a9d55ad-e886-58fe-adc1-5a5f227d0aeb","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4965ecd7-c296-57a0-abe4-8d6e9beef14a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"nonlinear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift/table_to_formula","group":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","passage":"The values of a quadratic function f are given below: f(0) = 5, f(1) = 7, and f(2) = 15.","question":"Find f(4).","options":["23","25","49","29"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) f(0) = 5 이므로 상수항은 5 이다. (2) f(x) = ax² + bx + 5 에서 f(1) = a + b + 5 = 7 이므로 a + b = 2 이다. (3) f(2) = 4a + 2b + 5 = 15 이므로 2a + b = 5 이다. (4) 두 식을 빼면 a = 3, b = -1 이다. (5) f(x) = 3x^2 - x + 5 이므로 f(4) = 49 이다. 따라서 정답은 49이다.","explanationEn":"(1) f(0) is the constant term. (2) Use f(1). (3) Use f(2). (4) Solve for a and b. (5) Evaluate at the new input. So the answer is 49.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.587Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["표(값)에서 이차함수 식을 세우는 모델링(상수항, 일차·이차 계수 연립) 후 새 입력에서 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함숫값"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"표(값)에서 이차함수 식을 세우는 모델링(상수항, 일차·이차 계수 연립) 후 새 입력에서 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함숫값","concepts":["표에서 식 세우기","이차함수 계수 결정","함숫값"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":2,"seed":820003,"variant":"table_to_formula","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":49,"correctOption":"49"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4965ecd7-c296-57a0-abe4-8d6e9beef14a","intendedSkill":"nonlinear_functions","recipeId":"nf.evaluate.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"765ee0be-3781-52b2-a86d-df01fd04adc0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.compose_kind/area_context","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.compose_kind","passage":"A square poster has side length $5x + 5$ inches, and a square photo with side length $3x - 3$ inches is placed inside it, where x is a positive number large enough for this to make sense.","question":"Which expression gives the area of the poster not covered by the photo, in square inches?","options":["$4x^2 + 32x + 64$","$16x^2 + 68x + 16$","$16x^2 + 16$","$16x^2 + 68x + 34$"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 첫 번째 제곱을 전개한다: $(5x + 5)^2 = 25x^2 + 50x + 25$. (2) 두 번째 제곱을 전개한다: $(3x - 3)^2 = 9x^2 - 18x + 9$. (3) 두 번째 전개식 전체에 뺄셈을 분배해 모든 항의 부호를 바꾼다. (4) $x^2$ 항: 25 - 9 = 16, $x$ 항: 50 - (-18) = 68, 상수항: 25 - 9 = 16 이다. (5) 결과는 $16x^2 + 68x + 16$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $16x^2 + 68x + 16$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Expand the first square. (2) Expand the second square. (3) Distribute the subtraction over every term of the second expansion. (4) Combine like terms. (5) Write the simplified result. So the answer is $16x^2 + 68x + 16$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.588Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["제곱 전개(중간항)와 뺄셈 전체에 대한 부호 분배, 동류항 결합 — medium 은 a(x+b)+c(x+d) 선형 분배 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"제곱 전개(중간항)와 뺄셈 전체에 대한 부호 분배, 동류항 결합 — medium 은 a(x+b)+c(x+d) 선형 분배 한 번","concepts":["이항식 제곱 전개","뺄셈의 부호 분배","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"area_context","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":364,"correctOption":"$16x^2 + 68x + 16$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"765ee0be-3781-52b2-a86d-df01fd04adc0","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"e7d3fb71-f32a-5ecb-a291-40d1286bf0ce","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse/coefficient_inverse","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","passage":"A student writes the identity below, where k is an unknown constant and x is any real number.\n\n$(5x + 4)(-2x + k) = -10x^2 - 33x + D$","question":"Find the value of D.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-20"],"explanation":"(1) 곱을 전개하면 일차항 계수는 5·k + 4·(-2) = 5k + (-8) 이다. (2) 식의 일차항 계수 -33 와 비교하면 5k + (-8) = -33 이다. (3) 이 식을 풀면 k = -5 이다. (4) 상수항은 (4)((-5)) = -20 이다. (5) 이차항 계수 5·(-2) = -10 가 주어진 식과 같은지 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 -20이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Expand the product and collect the coefficient of the linear term. (2) Equate it to the given linear coefficient. (3) Solve for k. (4) The constant term is b times k. (5) Check the quadratic coefficient. So the answer is -20.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.588Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함","concepts":["다항식 곱 전개","계수 비교(항등식)","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-20,"correctOption":"-20"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"e7d3fb71-f32a-5ecb-a291-40d1286bf0ce","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5a5474af-5c59-5af1-a9d9-b6c5777fdb1c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select/abstract","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","passage":"The polynomial $6t^2 - 17t + 7$ has two linear factors with integer coefficients, written $mt + n$ and $pt + q$, where m is greater than p and p is positive.","question":"Find n + q.","options":["5","-8","8","7"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) $6$ 의 인수쌍 중 m > p > 0 인 후보를 나열한다. (2) 상수항 7 의 정수 인수쌍(부호 포함)을 나열한다. (3) 각 조합에서 중간항 m·q + n·p 를 계산해 일차항 계수와 비교한다. (4) 조건을 만족하는 조합은 (3t - 7)(2t - 1) 하나뿐이다. (5) n + q = -7 + (-1) = -8 이다. 따라서 정답은 -8이다.","explanationEn":"(1) List the factor pairs of the leading coefficient with m > p > 0. (2) List integer factor pairs of the constant term, with signs. (3) For each combination compute mq + np and compare with the linear coefficient. (4) Exactly one combination works. (5) Add the constants. So the answer is -8.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.588Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번","concepts":["이차식 인수분해(선행계수≠1)","인수쌍 탐색","제약 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"abstract","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-8,"correctOption":"-8"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5a5474af-5c59-5af1-a9d9-b6c5777fdb1c","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3e3adf56-3a2e-5aae-aea3-febab7ab3542","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse/product","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","passage":"Constants P and Q make the following equation true whenever both sides are defined.\n\n$\\frac{13t + 45}{(t + 5)(t + 1)} = \\frac{P}{t + 5} + \\frac{Q}{t + 1}$","question":"Find the value of P times Q.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["40"],"explanation":"(1) 양변에 분모 $(t + 5)(t + 1)$ 를 곱해 분모를 없앤다. (2) $13t + 45 = P(t + 1) + Q(t + 5)$ 를 얻는다. (3) t = -5 를 대입하면 좌변의 분자는 -20, 우변은 P(-4) 이므로 P = 5 이다. (4) t = -1 를 대입하면 좌변의 분자는 32, 우변은 Q(4) 이므로 Q = 8 이다. (5) 일차항 계수 P + Q = 13 이 분자의 계수와 같은지 확인한다. (6) PQ = 5·8 = 40 이다. 따라서 정답은 40이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Multiply both sides by the common denominator. (2) This gives a polynomial identity. (3) Substitute the zero of the first factor to isolate A. (4) Substitute the zero of the second factor to isolate B. (5) Check with the linear coefficient. (6) Compute the requested value. So the answer is 40.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.589Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["공통분모를 '만드는' 방향이 아니라 분해 방향(미지수 A, B 역산): 양변에 분모를 곱하고 근을 대입하거나 계수 비교 — medium 은 공통분모로 결합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"공통분모를 '만드는' 방향이 아니라 분해 방향(미지수 A, B 역산): 양변에 분모를 곱하고 근을 대입하거나 계수 비교 — medium 은 공통분모로 결합","concepts":["유리식 공통분모","항등식 계수 비교","부분분수 분해"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820000,"variant":"product","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":40,"correctOption":"40"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3e3adf56-3a2e-5aae-aea3-febab7ab3542","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"7ec84f86-e238-5946-a4b4-c7bd98df1e0c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind/reciprocal_of_sum","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind","passage":"An expression is given below.\n\n$\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{x - 1} + \\frac{1}{x + 3}}$","question":"Which of the following is equivalent to the expression shown?","options":["$\\frac{(x - 1)(x + 3)}{2x + 2}$","$\\frac{2x + 2}{2}$","$\\frac{(x - 1)(x + 3)}{x + 2}$","$\\frac{2x + 2}{(x - 1)(x + 3)}$"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 분모의 두 분수를 통분한다: $\\frac{1}{x - 1} + \\frac{1}{x + 3}$ 의 공통분모는 $(x - 1)(x + 3)$ 이다. (2) 통분한 분자는 $(x + 3) + (x - 1) = 2x + 2$ 이다. (3) 따라서 큰 분수의 분모는 분자/(공통분모) 꼴의 하나의 분수가 된다. (4) 1 을 그 분수로 나누는 것은 역수를 곱하는 것과 같으므로 분자와 분모를 뒤집는다. (5) 결과는 $\\frac{(x - 1)(x + 3)}{2x + 2}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $\\frac{(x - 1)(x + 3)}{2x + 2}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Put the inner fractions over a common denominator. (2) Combine the numerators. (3) The denominator of the big fraction is a single fraction. (4) Dividing 1 by a fraction flips it. (5) State the simplified form. So the answer is $\\frac{(x - 1)(x + 3)}{2x + 2}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.589Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["복합분수 구조 인식: 안쪽 분수 통분 → 분자·분모 역전 → 약분 — medium 은 두 분수의 단순 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"복합분수 구조 인식: 안쪽 분수 통분 → 분자·분모 역전 → 약분 — medium 은 두 분수의 단순 합","concepts":["복합분수 단순화","통분","역수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820000,"variant":"reciprocal_of_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3.75,"correctOption":"$\\frac{(x - 1)(x + 3)}{2x + 2}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"7ec84f86-e238-5946-a4b4-c7bd98df1e0c","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"66a73f2a-f0d4-5417-a660-511705a58987","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition/ask_s","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","passage":"The expression below is equivalent to z + d for all values of z except the zero of the denominator, where c and d are constants.\n\n$\\frac{z^2 + cz + 12}{z + 2} = z + d$","question":"What must d equal?","options":["8","6","-6","4"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 이 식이 분모의 영점을 제외한 모든 값에서 성립하려면 분자가 분모 인수로 나누어떨어져야 한다. (2) 즉 분자 = $(z + 2)(z + d)$ 이다. (3) 우변을 전개하면 $z^2 + (d - (-2))z - (-2)d$ 이다. (4) 상수항을 비교하면 -(-2)d = 12 이므로 d = 6 이다. (5) 일차항 계수를 비교하면 c = d - (-2) = 8 이다. (6) 구하는 값은 6 이다. 따라서 정답은 6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) For the equality to hold, the numerator must be divisible by the denominator. (2) So the numerator factors as (x - r)(x + s). (3) Expand the right side. (4) Compare constants to find s. (5) Compare the linear coefficients to find k. (6) Report the requested value. So the answer is 6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.590Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["동치가 되려면 나머지가 0(인수정리)이어야 한다는 암묵 조건 도출 후 계수 비교 — medium 은 주어진 두 유리식의 결합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"동치가 되려면 나머지가 0(인수정리)이어야 한다는 암묵 조건 도출 후 계수 비교 — medium 은 주어진 두 유리식의 결합","concepts":["유리식 동치 조건","인수정리·다항식 나눗셈","계수 비교"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820000,"variant":"ask_s","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":6,"correctOption":"6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"66a73f2a-f0d4-5417-a660-511705a58987","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"b4c97991-1de4-535c-a14f-9b693765984e","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select/excluded_values_sum","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","passage":"A student cancels a common factor and reports that the expression below simplifies to $\\frac{t - 3}{t - 5}$.\n\n$\\frac{t^2 - t - 6}{t^2 - 3t - 10}$","question":"What is the sum of all values of t for which the original expression is undefined?","options":["5","-3","3","-10"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 분자를 인수분해한다: $t^2 - t - 6 = (t + 2)(t - 3)$. (2) 분모를 인수분해한다: $t^2 - 3t - 10 = (t + 2)(t - 5)$. (3) 공통인수 $(t + 2)$ 를 약분하면 $\\frac{t - 3}{t - 5}$ 이 된다. (4) 원래 식의 분모가 0 이 되는 값은 t = -2 와 t = 5 두 개이다(약분된 인수의 영점도 포함). (5) 두 값의 합은 -2 + (5) = 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor the numerator. (2) Factor the denominator. (3) Cancel the common factor. (4) The original denominator is zero at both roots. (5) Add the excluded values. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.590Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["약분해 사라진 인수도 원식에서는 제외값이라는 정의역 제약 추적 — medium 은 동치 결합만 요구하고 제외값을 묻지 않음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"약분해 사라진 인수도 원식에서는 제외값이라는 정의역 제약 추적 — medium 은 동치 결합만 요구하고 제외값을 묻지 않음","concepts":["유리식 약분","이차식 인수분해","정의역(제외값)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820000,"variant":"excluded_values_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"b4c97991-1de4-535c-a14f-9b693765984e","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"04e512d2-d084-5511-a227-d499e730af35","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2/factor_pair_square_sum","group":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","passage":"Factoring $t^2 - 8t + 7$ over the integers gives $(t + p)(t + q)$.","question":"Find $p^2 + q^2$.","options":["49","50","78","64"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) p + q = -8, pq = 7. (2) 합이 -8, 곱이 7 인 두 정수를 찾는다. (3) p, q = -7, -1. (4) p² + q² = (p + q)² − 2pq. (5) 64 − 14 = 50. 따라서 정답은 50이다.","explanationEn":"(1) p + q = -8, pq = 7. (2) Find integers with sum -8 and product 7. (3) p, q = -7, -1. (4) p² + q² = (p + q)² − 2pq. (5) 64 − 14 = 50. So the answer is 50.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.590Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계에서 얻은 계수·인수가 다음 계산의 입력이 되는 2단계 — medium 은 한 번의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"coefficient_matching","extraThinking":"앞 단계에서 얻은 계수·인수가 다음 계산의 입력이 되는 2단계 — medium 은 한 번의 전개","concepts":["식의 전개","계수 비교","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"factor_pair_square_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":50,"correctOption":"50"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"04e512d2-d084-5511-a227-d499e730af35","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5b9c69d8-736e-520c-ab5d-edfd410baec8","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.compose_kind/power_of_power_times","group":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.compose_kind","passage":"Simplify $(x^3)^4 \\cdot x^2$ for positive $x$; the result can be written as $x^k$.","question":"What exponent k results?","options":["18","24","9","14"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) (x^3)^4 = x^(3·4) = x^12. (2) 거듭제곱의 거듭제곱은 지수를 곱한다. (3) 같은 밑의 곱은 지수를 더한다: 12 + 2. (4) k = 12 + 2. (5) k = 14. 따라서 정답은 14이다.","explanationEn":"(1) (x^3)^4 = x^(3·4) = x^12. (2) A power of a power multiplies exponents. (3) Same-base products add exponents. (4) k = 12 + 2. (5) k = 14. So the answer is 14.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.591Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["여러 지수법칙을 올바른 순서로 합성해야 함 — medium 은 법칙 하나 적용"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"exponent_radical_forms","extraThinking":"여러 지수법칙을 올바른 순서로 합성해야 함 — medium 은 법칙 하나 적용","concepts":["지수법칙","근호와 분수식 변형","동치 변형"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"power_of_power_times","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":14,"correctOption":"14"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5b9c69d8-736e-520c-ab5d-edfd410baec8","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.exponent_radical_forms.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5df12cfc-7cb1-5705-a185-bf7323136707","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind/linear_identity_constant","group":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind","passage":"The expression $-4(z - 7) + -5(z - 1)$ is equivalent to $Rz + C$, where R and C are constants.","question":"Find C.","options":["29","66","23","33"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) -4(z + -7) = -4z + 28. (2) -5(z − 1) = -5z − -5. (3) 두 식을 더하면 상수항끼리 합쳐진다. (4) 28 + (5). (5) C = 33. 따라서 정답은 33이다.","explanationEn":"(1) -4(z + -7) = -4z + 28. (2) -5(z − 1) = -5z − -5. (3) Constant terms combine. (4) 28 + (5). (5) C = 33. So the answer is 33.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.591Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["양변을 전개·통분해 계수끼리 맞춰야 함 — medium 은 한 식의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"identity_parameters","extraThinking":"양변을 전개·통분해 계수끼리 맞춰야 함 — medium 은 한 식의 전개","concepts":["항등식","계수 비교로 상수 결정","동치 조건"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"linear_identity_constant","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":33,"correctOption":"33"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5df12cfc-7cb1-5705-a185-bf7323136707","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.identity_parameters.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"2d5192e7-4d43-5f98-ab89-ce876b30348f","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.identity_parameters.inverse/square_form_parameter","group":"ee.identity_parameters.inverse","passage":"Given $f(z) = a(z - 3)^2 - 6$ and the condition $f(1) = 10$, a is an unknown constant.","question":"What is the value of a?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["4"],"explanation":"(1) f(1) = a(1 + -3)² + -6. (2) (-2)² = 4. (3) 4a + -6 = 10. (4) a = 16 ÷ 4. (5) a = 4. 따라서 정답은 4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) f(1) = a(1 + -3)² + -6. (2) (-2)² = 4. (3) 4a + -6 = 10. (4) a = 16 ÷ 4. (5) a = 4. So the answer is 4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.591Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["항등 조건 한 개를 식으로 세워 상수를 풀어야 함 — medium 은 미지수 없는 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.identity_parameters.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"identity_parameters","extraThinking":"항등 조건 한 개를 식으로 세워 상수를 풀어야 함 — medium 은 미지수 없는 전개","concepts":["항등식","계수 비교로 상수 결정","동치 조건"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820000,"variant":"square_form_parameter","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":4,"correctOption":"4"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"2d5192e7-4d43-5f98-ab89-ce876b30348f","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.identity_parameters.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ebb6aec9-92bd-5a9b-abb8-d8ccb2b62468","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse/coefficient_inverse","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","passage":"Suppose k is a constant for which the equation below is an identity in t.\n\n$(-2t - 1)(4t + k) = -8t^2 - 2t + C$","question":"The constant C is equal to what number?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["1"],"explanation":"(1) 곱을 전개하면 일차항 계수는 -2·k + (-1)·4 = -2k + (-4) 이다. (2) 식의 일차항 계수 -2 와 비교하면 -2k + (-4) = -2 이다. (3) 이 식을 풀면 k = -1 이다. (4) 상수항은 (-1)((-1)) = 1 이다. (5) 이차항 계수 -2·4 = -8 가 주어진 식과 같은지 확인한다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Expand the product and collect the coefficient of the linear term. (2) Equate it to the given linear coefficient. (3) Solve for k. (4) The constant term is b times k. (5) Check the quadratic coefficient. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.591Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"결과식의 계수를 주고 입력 상수를 역추적(계수 비교 → k → 상수항) — medium 은 주어진 식을 그대로 전개만 함","concepts":["다항식 곱 전개","계수 비교(항등식)","미지 상수 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"coefficient_inverse","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"ebb6aec9-92bd-5a9b-abb8-d8ccb2b62468","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"3db84258-e7be-5461-a787-a90dc798e55a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select/abstract","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","passage":"The polynomial $2n^2 + n - 15$ has two linear factors with integer coefficients, written $mn + n$ and $pn + q$, where m is greater than p and p is positive.","question":"If n and q are the constant terms of the two factors, what is their sum?","options":["14","-2","-14","2"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) $2$ 의 인수쌍 중 m > p > 0 인 후보를 나열한다. (2) 상수항 -15 의 정수 인수쌍(부호 포함)을 나열한다. (3) 각 조합에서 중간항 m·q + n·p 를 계산해 일차항 계수와 비교한다. (4) 조건을 만족하는 조합은 (2n - 5)(n + 3) 하나뿐이다. (5) n + q = -5 + 3 = -2 이다. 따라서 정답은 -2이다.","explanationEn":"(1) List the factor pairs of the leading coefficient with m > p > 0. (2) List integer factor pairs of the constant term, with signs. (3) For each combination compute mq + np and compare with the linear coefficient. (4) Exactly one combination works. (5) Add the constants. So the answer is -2.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.591Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"상수항의 인수쌍과 x^2 계수의 인수쌍을 시도해 중간항으로 선별하는 제약 탐색 — medium 은 전개 방향(분배) 한 번","concepts":["이차식 인수분해(선행계수≠1)","인수쌍 탐색","제약 조건 선택"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"abstract","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-2,"correctOption":"-2"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"3db84258-e7be-5461-a787-a90dc798e55a","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"cc856eb9-5b80-5fb8-a7ba-db2a576478d7","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift/border_area","group":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift","passage":"A stone walkway 2 yards wide is built around all four sides of a rectangular courtyard that measures $3t + 4$ yards by $3t + 9$ yards.","question":"Which expression gives the area covered by the stone walkway, in square yards?","options":["$12t + 30$","$24t + 52$","$24t + 68$","$9t^2 + 63t + 104$"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 바깥 직사각형의 길이는 3t + 4 + 2·2, 너비는 3t + 9 + 2·2 이다. (2) 바깥 넓이 = $(3t + 8)(3t + 13)$ 를 전개한다. (3) 안쪽 넓이 = $(3t + 4)(3t + 9)$ 를 전개한다. (4) 바깥 넓이에서 안쪽 넓이를 빼면 $t^2$ 항이 사라진다. (5) 동류항을 정리하면 $24t + 68$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $24t + 68$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) The outer dimensions are each larger by twice the width. (2) Expand the outer area. (3) Expand the inner area. (4) Subtract: the quadratic terms cancel. (5) Combine like terms. So the answer is $24t + 68$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.591Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["문장→식 변환(바깥 변 = 안 변 + 2w)과 모서리 정사각형 4w² 포함 여부 판단 — medium 은 주어진 식의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"polynomial_distribution","extraThinking":"문장→식 변환(바깥 변 = 안 변 + 2w)과 모서리 정사각형 4w² 포함 여부 판단 — medium 은 주어진 식의 전개","concepts":["도형의 넓이 모델링","이항식 곱 전개","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"border_area","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":140,"correctOption":"$24t + 68$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"cc856eb9-5b80-5fb8-a7ba-db2a576478d7","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.polynomial_distribution.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d0cfe323-d429-5b6b-a508-0cf99c3f02c6","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse/product","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","passage":"Constants P and Q make the following equation true whenever both sides are defined.\n\n$\\frac{x - 4}{(x + 4)(x + 2)} = \\frac{P}{x + 4} + \\frac{Q}{x + 2}$","question":"Find the value of P times Q.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-12"],"explanation":"(1) 양변에 분모 $(x + 4)(x + 2)$ 를 곱해 분모를 없앤다. (2) $x - 4 = P(x + 2) + Q(x + 4)$ 를 얻는다. (3) x = -4 를 대입하면 좌변의 분자는 -8, 우변은 P(-2) 이므로 P = 4 이다. (4) x = -2 를 대입하면 좌변의 분자는 -6, 우변은 Q(2) 이므로 Q = -3 이다. (5) 일차항 계수 P + Q = 1 이 분자의 계수와 같은지 확인한다. (6) PQ = 4·(-3) = -12 이다. 따라서 정답은 -12이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Multiply both sides by the common denominator. (2) This gives a polynomial identity. (3) Substitute the zero of the first factor to isolate A. (4) Substitute the zero of the second factor to isolate B. (5) Check with the linear coefficient. (6) Compute the requested value. So the answer is -12.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.592Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["공통분모를 '만드는' 방향이 아니라 분해 방향(미지수 A, B 역산): 양변에 분모를 곱하고 근을 대입하거나 계수 비교 — medium 은 공통분모로 결합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"공통분모를 '만드는' 방향이 아니라 분해 방향(미지수 A, B 역산): 양변에 분모를 곱하고 근을 대입하거나 계수 비교 — medium 은 공통분모로 결합","concepts":["유리식 공통분모","항등식 계수 비교","부분분수 분해"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820001,"variant":"product","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-12,"correctOption":"-12"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d0cfe323-d429-5b6b-a508-0cf99c3f02c6","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"ec09e7fa-dcfd-508e-a17d-e0e188c150e0","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind/reciprocal_of_sum","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind","passage":"Consider the expression shown.\n\n$\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{z + 5} + \\frac{1}{z + 3}}$","question":"Which of the following is equivalent to the expression shown?","options":["$\\frac{(z + 5)(z + 3)}{z + 8}$","$\\frac{(z + 5)(z + 3)}{2z + 8}$","$\\frac{2z + 8}{2}$","$\\frac{2z + 8}{(z + 5)(z + 3)}$"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 분모의 두 분수를 통분한다: $\\frac{1}{z + 5} + \\frac{1}{z + 3}$ 의 공통분모는 $(z + 5)(z + 3)$ 이다. (2) 통분한 분자는 $(z + 3) + (z + 5) = 2z + 8$ 이다. (3) 따라서 큰 분수의 분모는 분자/(공통분모) 꼴의 하나의 분수가 된다. (4) 1 을 그 분수로 나누는 것은 역수를 곱하는 것과 같으므로 분자와 분모를 뒤집는다. (5) 결과는 $\\frac{(z + 5)(z + 3)}{2z + 8}$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 $\\frac{(z + 5)(z + 3)}{2z + 8}$이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Put the inner fractions over a common denominator. (2) Combine the numerators. (3) The denominator of the big fraction is a single fraction. (4) Dividing 1 by a fraction flips it. (5) State the simplified form. So the answer is $\\frac{(z + 5)(z + 3)}{2z + 8}$.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.592Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["복합분수 구조 인식: 안쪽 분수 통분 → 분자·분모 역전 → 약분 — medium 은 두 분수의 단순 합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"복합분수 구조 인식: 안쪽 분수 통분 → 분자·분모 역전 → 약분 — medium 은 두 분수의 단순 합","concepts":["복합분수 단순화","통분","역수"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820001,"variant":"reciprocal_of_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":5.454545454545454,"correctOption":"$\\frac{(z + 5)(z + 3)}{2z + 8}$"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"ec09e7fa-dcfd-508e-a17d-e0e188c150e0","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"f6874d5d-2536-5968-aa93-8f1c2c038cfb","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition/ask_sum","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","passage":"After polynomial division with no remainder, the quotient below equals z + d. Here c and d are constants.\n\n$\\frac{z^2 + cz + 1}{z + 1} = z + d$","question":"Find c + d.","options":["2","-3","1","3"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 이 식이 분모의 영점을 제외한 모든 값에서 성립하려면 분자가 분모 인수로 나누어떨어져야 한다. (2) 즉 분자 = $(z + 1)(z + d)$ 이다. (3) 우변을 전개하면 $z^2 + (d - (-1))z - (-1)d$ 이다. (4) 상수항을 비교하면 -(-1)d = 1 이므로 d = 1 이다. (5) 일차항 계수를 비교하면 c = d - (-1) = 2 이다. (6) 구하는 값은 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) For the equality to hold, the numerator must be divisible by the denominator. (2) So the numerator factors as (x - r)(x + s). (3) Expand the right side. (4) Compare constants to find s. (5) Compare the linear coefficients to find k. (6) Report the requested value. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.593Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["동치가 되려면 나머지가 0(인수정리)이어야 한다는 암묵 조건 도출 후 계수 비교 — medium 은 주어진 두 유리식의 결합"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","operator":"param_condition","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"동치가 되려면 나머지가 0(인수정리)이어야 한다는 암묵 조건 도출 후 계수 비교 — medium 은 주어진 두 유리식의 결합","concepts":["유리식 동치 조건","인수정리·다항식 나눗셈","계수 비교"],"steps":6,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820001,"variant":"ask_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"f6874d5d-2536-5968-aa93-8f1c2c038cfb","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.param_condition","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"fa08625d-88c3-58ae-a3d1-2a144025c3fa","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select/excluded_values_sum","group":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","passage":"A student cancels a common factor and reports that the expression below simplifies to $\\frac{n - 1}{n - 4}$.\n\n$\\frac{n^2 + 2n - 3}{n^2 - n - 12}$","question":"What is the total of every value of n that makes the original denominator equal to zero?","options":["1","-1","-12","4"],"correctIndex":0,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) 분자를 인수분해한다: $n^2 + 2n - 3 = (n + 3)(n - 1)$. (2) 분모를 인수분해한다: $n^2 - n - 12 = (n + 3)(n - 4)$. (3) 공통인수 $(n + 3)$ 를 약분하면 $\\frac{n - 1}{n - 4}$ 이 된다. (4) 원래 식의 분모가 0 이 되는 값은 n = -3 와 n = 4 두 개이다(약분된 인수의 영점도 포함). (5) 두 값의 합은 -3 + (4) = 1 이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Factor the numerator. (2) Factor the denominator. (3) Cancel the common factor. (4) The original denominator is zero at both roots. (5) Add the excluded values. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.593Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["약분해 사라진 인수도 원식에서는 제외값이라는 정의역 제약 추적 — medium 은 동치 결합만 요구하고 제외값을 묻지 않음"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","operator":"constraint_select","kind":"rational_equivalence","extraThinking":"약분해 사라진 인수도 원식에서는 제외값이라는 정의역 제약 추적 — medium 은 동치 결합만 요구하고 제외값을 묻지 않음","concepts":["유리식 약분","이차식 인수분해","정의역(제외값)"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":4,"seed":820001,"variant":"excluded_values_sum","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":1,"correctOption":"1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"fa08625d-88c3-58ae-a3d1-2a144025c3fa","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.rational_equivalence.constraint_select","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"d603129b-2a17-5c74-a7c3-837183956349","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2/perfect_square_k","group":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","passage":"A trinomial $z^2 + kz + 49$ is a perfect square, $(z + m)^2$, with k and m positive.","question":"Find k.","options":["7","16","14","49"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) z² + kz + 49 = (z + m)² = z² + 2mz + m². (2) m² = 49 이므로 m = 7 (양수). (3) 중간항 계수 k = 2m. (4) k = 2 × 7. (5) k = 14. 따라서 정답은 14이다.","explanationEn":"(1) z² + kz + 49 = (z + m)² = z² + 2mz + m². (2) m^2 = 49, so m = 7. (3) The middle coefficient is k = 2m. (4) k = 2 × 7. (5) k = 14. So the answer is 14.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.593Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["앞 단계에서 얻은 계수·인수가 다음 계산의 입력이 되는 2단계 — medium 은 한 번의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"coefficient_matching","extraThinking":"앞 단계에서 얻은 계수·인수가 다음 계산의 입력이 되는 2단계 — medium 은 한 번의 전개","concepts":["식의 전개","계수 비교","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"perfect_square_k","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":14,"correctOption":"14"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"d603129b-2a17-5c74-a7c3-837183956349","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"6052451d-8e7d-51e2-aaba-d6a9ef1f9aa9","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Advanced Math (이차·지수·다항)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"equivalent_expressions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"ee.coefficient_matching.compare_scenarios/solve_for_equal_value","group":"ee.coefficient_matching.compare_scenarios","passage":"For which value of $x$ does $(x + 2)^2$ equal $x^2 + 32$? The two expressions are not equivalent, but they take the same value for exactly one positive value of $x$.","question":"Find the positive value of $x$ at which the two expressions agree.","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["7"],"explanation":"(1) (x + 2)² = x² + 4x + 4. (2) x² + 4x + 4 = x² + 32. (3) x² 항이 소거된다. (4) 4x = 28. (5) x = 7. 따라서 정답은 7이다.","explanationEn":"(1) (x + 2)² = x² + 4x + 4. (2) x² + 4x + 4 = x² + 32. (3) The squared terms cancel. (4) 4x = 28. (5) x = 7. So the answer is 7.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.593Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["같은 값처럼 보이는 두 식의 차이를 중간항이나 항등성으로 설명해야 함 — medium 은 한 식의 전개"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"coefficient_matching","extraThinking":"같은 값처럼 보이는 두 식의 차이를 중간항이나 항등성으로 설명해야 함 — medium 은 한 식의 전개","concepts":["식의 전개","계수 비교","동류항 정리"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":3,"seed":820001,"variant":"solve_for_equal_value","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":7,"correctOption":"7"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"6052451d-8e7d-51e2-aaba-d6a9ef1f9aa9","intendedSkill":"equivalent_expressions","recipeId":"ee.coefficient_matching.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"5917f340-5b16-570a-a260-07efa7c5be68","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"lf.evaluate.chain2/two_compositions","group":"lf.evaluate.chain2","passage":"Let $h(x) = 5x + 1$ and $k(x) = 5x - 8$.","question":"Compute $h(k(-4)) - k(h(-4))$.","options":["36","9","-242","-36"],"correctIndex":3,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) $k(-4) = 5\\cdot (-4) - 8 = -28$ 이다. (2) $h(k(-4)) = h(-28) = -139$ 이다. (3) $h(-4) = -19$ 이다. (4) $k(h(-4)) = k(-19) = -103$ 이다. (5) 두 값을 빼면 -36 이다. 따라서 정답은 -36이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate the inner function. (2) Feed it into the outer function. (3) Evaluate the other inner function. (4) Feed it into the other outer function. (5) Combine. So the answer is -36.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.593Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["안쪽 함수값을 바깥 함수의 입력으로 넘기는 두 번의 합성과 순서(f∘g 와 g∘f)의 구분 — medium 은 함수값 하나 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"lf.evaluate.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"안쪽 함수값을 바깥 함수의 입력으로 넘기는 두 번의 합성과 순서(f∘g 와 g∘f)의 구분 — medium 은 함수값 하나 계산","concepts":["함수값 계산","함수의 합성","합성 순서"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":1,"seed":820000,"variant":"two_compositions","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-36,"correctOption":"-36"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"5917f340-5b16-570a-a260-07efa7c5be68","intendedSkill":"linear_functions","recipeId":"lf.evaluate.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"143aa0a5-5098-5f1f-a112-e51ad010275a","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"lf.evaluate.compose_kind/restore_then_evaluate","group":"lf.evaluate.compose_kind","passage":"For a linear function g, the values $g(1) = -7$ and $g(5) = -19$ are known.","question":"What does $g(0)$ equal?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-4"],"explanation":"(1) 기울기는 $(-19 - (-7)) / (5 - 1) = -3$ 이다. (2) $g(x) = -3x + b$ 로 놓는다. (3) 1 를 대입하면 $-7 = -3\\cdot 1 + b$ 이다. (4) b = -4 이므로 $g(x) = -3x - 4$ 이다. (5) $g(0) = -3\\cdot 0 - 4 = -4$ 이다. 따라서 정답은 -4이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Find the slope. (2) Write the form. (3) Substitute a known point. (4) Solve for b. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is -4.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.594Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["함수값 두 개에서 직선의 식을 먼저 복원(기울기→절편)한 뒤 함수값을 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함수값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"lf.evaluate.compose_kind","operator":"compose_kind","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"함수값 두 개에서 직선의 식을 먼저 복원(기울기→절편)한 뒤 함수값을 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함수값 계산","concepts":["함수값 계산","두 점으로 직선의 식 구하기"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":1,"seed":820000,"variant":"restore_then_evaluate","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-4,"correctOption":"-4"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"143aa0a5-5098-5f1f-a112-e51ad010275a","intendedSkill":"linear_functions","recipeId":"lf.evaluate.compose_kind","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"4ee5bac6-668b-517f-a0ab-ba57612e6448","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"lf.evaluate.repr_shift/from_intercepts","group":"lf.evaluate.repr_shift","passage":"A linear function g has an x-intercept at $(-4, 0)$ and a y-intercept at $(0, 12)$.","question":"What is the value of $g(-6)$?","options":["-18","-6","6","30"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) x 절편은 점 (-4, 0), y 절편은 점 (0, 12) 이다. (2) 기울기는 $(0 - 12) / ((-4) - 0) = 3$ 이다. (3) y 절편이 12 이므로 $g(x) = 3x + 12$ 이다. (4) $g(-6) = 3\\cdot (-6) + 12$ 이다. (5) 계산하면 -6 이다. 따라서 정답은 -6이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Read the two intercept points. (2) Compute the slope. (3) Write the equation. (4) Substitute. (5) Evaluate. So the answer is -6.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.594Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["절편 서술(그래프의 좌표 정보)을 기울기와 식으로 번역한 뒤 함수값을 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함수값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"lf.evaluate.repr_shift","operator":"repr_shift","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"절편 서술(그래프의 좌표 정보)을 기울기와 식으로 번역한 뒤 함수값을 계산 — medium 은 식이 주어진 함수값 계산","concepts":["절편으로 직선의 식 구하기","함수값 계산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":1,"seed":820000,"variant":"from_intercepts","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-6,"correctOption":"-6"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"4ee5bac6-668b-517f-a0ab-ba57612e6448","intendedSkill":"linear_functions","recipeId":"lf.evaluate.repr_shift","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"17f10c67-a789-542e-a211-6f79b3431767","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"lf.evaluate.compare_scenarios/two_shops_difference","group":"lf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","passage":"Shop A bills 85 dollars for a house call and 15 dollars per hour. Shop B bills 15 dollars for a house call and 26 dollars per hour.","question":"For 2 hours, what is the difference, in dollars, between Shop A's charge and Shop B's charge?","options":["115","48","-48","59"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) Shop A 의 함수는 $A(t) = 15t + 85$ 이다. (2) Shop B 의 함수는 $B(t) = 26t + 15$ 이다. (3) $A(2) = 15\\cdot 2 + 85 = 115$ 이다. (4) $B(2) = 26\\cdot 2 + 15 = 67$ 이다. (5) 차는 115 - 67 = 48 이다. 따라서 정답은 48이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Model Shop A. (2) Model Shop B. (3) Evaluate A. (4) Evaluate B. (5) Subtract. So the answer is 48.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.594Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 상황을 각각 함수로 모델링한 뒤 같은 입력에서 값을 비교 — medium 은 주어진 하나의 함수값 계산"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"lf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","operator":"compare_scenarios","kind":"evaluate","extraThinking":"두 상황을 각각 함수로 모델링한 뒤 같은 입력에서 값을 비교 — medium 은 주어진 하나의 함수값 계산","concepts":["문장→일차함수","함수값 계산","두 값의 비교"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":1,"seed":820000,"variant":"two_shops_difference","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":48,"correctOption":"48"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"17f10c67-a789-542e-a211-6f79b3431767","intendedSkill":"linear_functions","recipeId":"lf.evaluate.compare_scenarios","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"8c92dcb4-ccee-55d1-a624-4203b09c7c18","subject":"SAT Math","format":"spr","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"lf.find_x_for_value.inverse/equal_to_sum_of_values","group":"lf.find_x_for_value.inverse","passage":"Consider the function $h(x) = 4x - 8$. The equation $h(x) = h(-3) + h(4)$ has exactly one solution.","question":"For what value of x does the equation hold?","options":null,"correctIndex":null,"answers":["-1"],"explanation":"(1) $h(-3) = 4\\cdot (-3) - 8 = -20$ 이다. (2) $h(4) = 8$ 이다. (3) 합은 -12 이다. (4) $4x - 8 = -12$ 로 놓는다. (5) 상수를 이항하면 $4x = -4$ 이고 x = -1 이다. 따라서 정답은 -1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate f(p). (2) Evaluate f(q). (3) Add the two values. (4) Set f(x) equal to the sum. (5) Solve for x. So the answer is -1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.594Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["정방향으로 만든 목표값을 다시 출력값으로 두고 입력을 역산 — medium 은 주어진 출력값에서 x 를 한 번 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"lf.find_x_for_value.inverse","operator":"inverse","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"정방향으로 만든 목표값을 다시 출력값으로 두고 입력을 역산 — medium 은 주어진 출력값에서 x 를 한 번 구함","concepts":["함수값 계산","출력값에서 입력 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":1,"seed":820000,"variant":"equal_to_sum_of_values","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":-1,"correctOption":"-1"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"8c92dcb4-ccee-55d1-a624-4203b09c7c18","intendedSkill":"linear_functions","recipeId":"lf.find_x_for_value.inverse","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":2,"minMet":2,"of":2,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"338bd3c3-2e1c-57f1-a7f7-e78ce42aa89d","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"lf.find_x_for_value.chain2/composite_equals_target","group":"lf.find_x_for_value.chain2","passage":"Look at the functions $g(x) = 3x + 9$ and $h(x) = x - 8$.","question":"The composite output is -6. What is the input x of h?","options":["-5","3","-2","-3"],"correctIndex":1,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) $g(h(x)) = 3(x - 8) + 9$ 이다. (2) 분배하면 $3x - 15$ 이다. (3) $3x - 15 = -6$ 로 놓는다. (4) 상수를 이항하면 $3x = 9$ 이다. (5) 3 로 나누면 x = 3 이다. 따라서 정답은 3이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Substitute the inner function into the outer one. (2) Simplify the composite. (3) Set it equal to the target. (4) Isolate the x-term. (5) Solve. So the answer is 3.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.595Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["두 함수를 합성해 식을 정리(기울기 곱·상수 합성)한 뒤 방정식으로 푸는 2단계 — medium 은 한 함수에서 x 를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","mockExamGeneration":{"difficultyStatus":"provisional_ai","source":"compiler_archetype","archetypeId":"lf.find_x_for_value.chain2","operator":"chain2","kind":"find_x_for_value","extraThinking":"두 함수를 합성해 식을 정리(기울기 곱·상수 합성)한 뒤 방정식으로 푸는 2단계 — medium 은 한 함수에서 x 를 구함","concepts":["함수의 합성","일차방정식","출력값에서 입력 역산"],"steps":5,"mediumSteps":1,"seed":820000,"variant":"composite_equals_target","verification":{"method":"verification_js","verified":3,"correctOption":"3"},"runId":"sat-math-hard5","gid":"338bd3c3-2e1c-57f1-a7f7-e78ce42aa89d","intendedSkill":"linear_functions","recipeId":"lf.find_x_for_value.chain2","recipeCheck":{"source":"compiler_archetype","compliance":{"met":3,"minMet":2,"of":3,"ok":true}},"hardBasis":"compiler_archetype","review":null}}},{"gid":"94c1db8b-a3c0-5d31-a1f0-011eaf7b075c","subject":"SAT Math","format":"mc","skillType":"Algebra (선형식·연립·부등식)","difficulty":"hard","skill":"linear_functions","examSystem":"sat_math","createdVia":"compiler","subpattern":"lf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind/percent_of_value","group":"lf.find_x_for_value.compose_kind","passage":"The function f is defined by $f(x) = -x + 19$. There is a value of x for which the output is 50 percent more than $f(7)$.","question":"For which value of x is this true?","options":["18","11","1","12"],"correctIndex":2,"answers":null,"explanation":"(1) $f(7) = -1\\cdot 7 + 19 = 12$ 이다. (2) 50% 증가한 값은 12 × 1.5 = 18 이다. (3) $-1x + 19 = 18$ 로 놓는다. (4) 상수를 이항하면 $-1x = -1$ 이다. (5) -1 로 나누면 x = 1 이다. 따라서 정답은 1이다.","explanationEn":"(1) Evaluate f(p). (2) Apply the percent change. (3) Set f(x) equal to the target. (4) Isolate x. (5) Solve. So the answer is 1.","figure":null,"statements":null,"evidenceTarget":null,"evidenceSpan":null,"answerRationale":null,"distractorErrorTypes":null,"renderCheck":{"ok":true,"renderer":"std-1","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T16:19:24.595Z","issues":[]},"publish":true,"quality":{"contract":{"ok":true,"issues":[]},"estimatedDifficulty":"hard","requestedDifficulty":"hard","difficultyReasons":["퍼센트 변화를 함수의 출력값에 적용한 목표값을 만들고 그 목표값에서 입력을 역산 — medium 은 주어진 출력값에서 x 를 구함"],"distractors":[],"independentReview":{"pickedIndex":null,"pickedAnswer":null,"agrees":true,"confidence":"high","flags":[]},"needsReview":false,"needsReviewReasons":[],"calibrated":false,"reviewedAt":"1970-